translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_82e51c28:

    # e "So, what are you doing, Vurro?"
    e "那么，你在做什么，伏罗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_d6b88479:

    # "You politely speak. Vurro does not turn his head towards you, but you can see a slight raise in the corner of his mouth."
    "你礼貌地开口。伏罗没有转头看你，但你能看到他的嘴角微上扬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_787081f8:

    # v "Nothing much, just thinking."
    v "没什么，只是在想事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_f955ae05:

    # "He continues looking ahead into the depth of the dark forest, his gaze blurred yet unmoving."
    "他继续望着幽暗森林深处，目光朦胧，却始终没有移动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_8cafb5b0:

    # e "Well, what are you thinking?"
    e "那你在想什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_eb0b8182:

    # "The brown werewolf turns to you, his shaggy fur is evidence of either his pondering, or his exhaustion."
    "棕色狼人转向你；他蓬乱的毛发说明他要么在沉思，要么已经精疲力竭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_fc989299:

    # v "Oh... you know, just thinking about what's Wuld gotta cook for dinner."
    v "哦……你知道的，只是在想伍尔顿晚饭会做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_5e4cbae3:

    # "Your eyes soften. Despite his uplifting voice, it is clear that Vurro is not telling you the whole truth."
    "你的目光柔和下来。尽管伏罗的声音听起来很轻快，但显然，他没有告诉你全部真相。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_c473afdb:

    # v "He better be cooking up something real good, like... a nice stew to satiate... my... appeti-"
    v "他最好能做点真正美味的东西，比如……一锅能填饱我……胃口的炖菜——"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_ecab050e:

    # "Vurro sinks into silence, his eyes turning back to the forest."
    "伏罗陷入沉默，目光重新投向森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_3e0a7c8b:

    # "You struggle to find words to comfort him, and he seems to have quickly caught that."
    "你努力想找些话安慰他，而他似乎很快就察觉到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_88bd1713:

    # v "Don't worry about me, [e]. I'll be fine, for the time being."
    v "别担心我，[e]。至少暂时，我不会有事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Ask_How_Doing_a0e3b375:

    # "He gives you a small smile, but it doesn't seem to reach his eyes."
    "他朝你微一笑，但笑意似乎并未抵达眼底。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1c9ac6ea:

    # "You come across a small wooden hut, sides and top partway consumed by the surrounding forest."
    "你发现了一间小木屋，侧面与屋顶都已被周围的森林侵蚀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f6ec2964:

    # "If you hadn't happened to stumble into it by chance, you never would have found it."
    "如果不是偶然撞见，你恐怕永远也找不到它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_614805c4:

    # "At first, it seems like the area is completely abandoned, but... looking closely, you can see a well."
    "起初，这片地方似乎已经彻底荒废；但仔细看去，你发现那里有一口井。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_be67821d:

    # "And beside it, the large form of a dark blue werewolf pulling water up from said well."
    "井边，一个高大的深蓝色狼人正从井里打水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_58940927:

    # "His arms glisten with sweat, his powerful frame ill-hidden by his pale-green cloak."
    "他的手臂泛着汗光，浅绿色斗篷也遮不住那副强壮的身躯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b571a60d:

    # "Despite that, he himself blends in with the terrain itself as well, his blue fur and green cloak blending in with the blues and greens of the river and shrubs."
    "尽管如此，他本人也几乎融入了地形之中：蓝色的毛发与绿色的斗篷，和河流、灌木的蓝绿交织在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0a09964e:

    # my "Hello there little one."
    my "你好啊，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a57ae1fc:

    # "You hear a deep voice, rich and rumbling like the sound of a far distant storm."
    "你听见一个低沉浑厚的声音，像遥远风暴传来的隆回响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_cfa41d7f:

    # e "Hello?"
    e "有人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_213b8cb6:

    # "The blue wolf turns around and reveals himself to be the one speaking to you."
    "蓝狼转过身来，你这才发现刚才正是他在对你说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2260a624:

    # my "Yes, hello. I hope you weren't trying to spy on me, as you would be a rather poor excuse for one if so."
    my "是的，你好。希望你不是在偷看我；如果真是这样，你可算不上一个合格的窥探者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7f386407:

    # "There is a light grin playing across his face. It doesn't quite reach his eyes."
    "他脸上挂着淡的笑意，但那笑意并未抵达眼底。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f9e4f048:

    # my "You somehow managed to snap a twig under your foot with every step you took."
    my "不知怎么的，你每走一步，都会踩断一根树枝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_763173be:

    # "You can't help but wince."
    "你忍不住瑟缩了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5e1348f3:

    # e "Sorry, I didn't mean to bother you."
    e "对不起，我不是故意要打扰你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f05f2a0d:

    # "The wolf relaxes. Even so, he is still an entire head higher than you, far wider, and stronger."
    "狼人放松下来。即便如此，他仍比你高出一头，身形也宽阔得多，强壮得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_bd1c5c0e:

    # my "It's no problem. I will need you to start paying if you ogle me any longer, though."
    my "没关系。不过你要是再这么盯着我看，可就得开始付钱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e19eeae9:

    # "He smirks."
    "他得意地扬起嘴角。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7bdcd869:

    # my "I don't think you could afford my rates."
    my "我不觉得你付得起我的价码。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_805c0fc4:

    # w "The name's Wuldon, by the way. Thought I'd give it since you seem intent on sticking around."
    w "对了，我叫伍尔顿。看你似乎打算一直待在这儿，我想还是告诉你一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_28bbfd4f:

    # e "O-oh. Yes! My name is [e]!"
    e "哦、哦。对了！我叫[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_99ad7ef8:

    # w "Mm. Nice name."
    w "嗯。名字不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6bef5704:

    # "Wuldon gets back to filling up the buckets."
    "伍尔顿重新往桶里装水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e20cf9bb:

    # w "So, what are you doing this far away from civilization, [e]."
    w "那么，你为什么会离文明世界这么远，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_734e37bd:

    # e "Well, I was originally sent in this direction to find out what was going on with this magic stone..."
    e "我本来是被派来调查这块魔法石的，想看它到底是怎么回事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3e097055:

    # "You pull out the stone in question."
    "你取出了那块魔法石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c84e7d36:

    # e "But then I met Uffe and his tribe-"
    e "但后来我遇到了乌菲和他的部落——"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_8ff9ff85:

    # "You see Wuldon freeze for a second, before continuing as if nothing happened."
    "你看到伍尔顿僵了一瞬，随后又若无其事地继续手上的动作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7abe6eb2:

    # e "And he told me to go kill this feral werewolf for him if I wanted to get any information."
    e "他说，如果我想得到任何情报，就得替他去杀掉那头狂野狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_50c5ed63:

    # w "And, what did you do?"
    w "那你做了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e7575fac:

    # e "Well, I haven't gotten that far yet. I was on my way to find it, and I found you first."
    e "我还没走到那一步。我本来正要去找它，结果先遇到了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d56a71f7:

    # "Wuldon, turns to look at you, relief on his face."
    "伍尔顿转过身看向你，脸上流露出如释重负的神情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a3aef918:

    # w "Well, I suppose I should tell you the story of the feral werewolf and its curse before you get there."
    w "那么，在你到达那里之前，我想我应该先告诉你那头狂野狼人和它身上诅咒的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_77465b36:

    # w "Uffe, mangy dog that he is, wants you to kill someone for him without even telling you how it happened."
    w "乌菲这个癞皮狗，想让你替他杀人，却连事情是怎么发生的都不告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_75f206ed:

    # "There is a cold light in his eyes. A grudge held and festering from years of denial."
    "他的眼中闪过一丝冷光，那是多年压抑与否认后积郁不散的怨恨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ef6e63a6:

    # w "Regardless, the story."
    w "总之，先说这个故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5ff6d557:

    # w "Once upon a time, two brothers led the dark forest tribe together."
    w "很久以前，两个兄弟共同领导着幽暗森林部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a6eed639:

    # w "One, a domineering and predatory man who wished for his tribe to hunt in isolation from the world."
    w "其中一个专横而凶残，希望自己的部落与世隔绝地狩猎为生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7e76f56b:

    # w "The other, kinder, and more mercantile, wishing to find ways to lead his brethren out of a life of kill or be killed."
    w "另一个更加温和，也更重视贸易，希望找到办法，让族人摆脱不是杀人就是被杀的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_30155229:

    # w "One day, the mercantile brother found a cave filled with precious ores. Ores that he knew the surrounding tribes and villages wanted."
    w "有一天，重视贸易的弟发现了一座满是珍贵矿石的洞穴。他知道，周围的部落和村庄都需要那些矿石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_18e00b1e:

    # w "Here, he saw his opportunity to lead his people out of the shadows, and into civilization."
    w "他看到了机会：带领族人走出阴影，迈入文明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a1ddfe21:

    # w "He told his pack about the cave, and told his brother about his dream."
    w "他把洞穴的事告诉了族人，也把自己的梦想告诉了哥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4ddaff46:

    # w "The hunting brother did not understand."
    w "负责狩猎的哥无法理解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9e95e973:

    # w "This lifestyle of hunting and killing was all they had ever had. All they would ever need."
    w "他们一直过的就是狩猎与杀戮的生活，也只需要这样的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_47af3197:

    # e "This sounds a lot like something I've heard before."
    e "这听起来很像我以前听过的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5a10f27b:

    # "Rather than respond, Wuldon grins a knowing grin."
    "伍尔顿不回答，而是嘲笑一个自知的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c8e72f65:

    # w "It was this very lifestyle that let his brother and he be alpha. They had carved their place in the tribe with their superior fangs and claws."
    w "他们用他们的尖牙和爪子在部落中刻出了他们的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_dbf010d5:

    # w "Even if they proved this by killing their brethren, that was how things should be."
    w "即使他们通过杀害兄弟来证明这一点，但事情应该如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_742fd9c4:

    # w "The mercantile brother asked that he still be allowed to try his dream."
    w "商家兄弟要求继续允许他尝试他的梦想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d1b3a1e8:

    # w "They were equals, and they could follow both lifestyles."
    w "他们是平等的，他们可以遵循两种生活方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4a79ac2e:

    # e "Could they really? It's only one pack."
    e "真的可以吗只有一包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_72aaacdd:

    # w "It was a pack with two alphas, little one. This was not the first disagreement."
    w "这是两张字母的包裹，小的，这不是第一次意见不一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_952f8a87:

    # w "They had their solutions, though sometimes one or both sides were unhappy with it."
    w "他们有自己的解决办法，尽管有时一方或双方对此不满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6914f8eb:

    # e "What kind of solutions were they?"
    e "它们是什么样的解决办法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4469fffe:

    # w "All will be revealed in time."
    w "一切都将及时公布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_75e6c887:

    # "Wuldon's tone carries a sense of finality to it, telling you to be quiet so he can keep telling the story."
    "沃尔登的语气有结束感告诉你安静这样他就可以继续讲故事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_777b66de:

    # w "In order to make sure his brother would not be disrupted, he took half of the tribe with him to the mines."
    w "为了确保他的兄弟不会受到干扰，他将一半的部落和他一起带到矿井。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ffc2c793:

    # w "The hunting brother was furious."
    w "猎杀兄弟很愤怒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e2f23def:

    # w "His foolish wretch of a brother wished to betray him and their way of life."
    w "他一个哥的愚蠢卑鄙之徒想背叛他和他们的生活方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a22cedd2:

    # w "He had to be rid of him, but they were equals, as his brother had intimated."
    w "他必须摆脱他，但他们是平等的，正如他兄弟所亲密的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_aaf44662:

    # w "They had fought before, and had to stop every time before they both died."
    w "他们以前打过仗每次都得在他们死前停下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_20591f0f:

    # w "As he fumed, lashing out and beating his fellow wolves in anger, we, the followers of the mercantile brother, left."
    w "当他抽烟、鞭打和愤怒地殴打他的狼同伴时，我们这个重商兄弟的追随者离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b9e7c7dc:

    # e "And the hunting brother? What happened when you left?"
    e "那负责狩猎的哥呢？你离开后发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_108d3b43:

    # w "I do not know what happened in the other half of the pack."
    w "我不知道在另一半的包里发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_bd1dca83:

    # w "I left, and never looked back."
    w "我离开，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_64201363:

    # e "Why did you leave?"
    e "为什么你离开？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3f8ae830:

    # "Wuldon looks unimpressed with you. His bright eyes betrayed his next line before he even spoke.:"
    "伍尔顿对你没有印象他的明亮眼睛在说话之前背叛了他的下一条线"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2763c97a:

    # w "You have seen the pack today."
    w "你们今天已经看到这群人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a036dfec:

    # w "I hear them hunting and dying like wild animals under the leadership of Uffe."
    w "我听到他们在乌菲的领导下像野兽一样猎杀和死去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_50686055:

    # e "But you didn't know that would happen!"
    e "但你不知道会发生这种事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3406d96a:

    # "Wuldon's face is creased with the beginning of a disgusted snarl."
    "伍尔顿的脸被一个恶心的鼻涕开始折裂了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3dc76aae:

    # w "Yes. I didn't. But I knew Uffe, and I knew he would become alpha."
    w "是的，我没有，但我认识乌菲，我知道他会成为阿尔法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_86bfa5c4:

    # "Having gotten his hatred of Uffe out of his system, his face returns to its neutral, somber state."
    "他对乌菲的憎恨已经从他的体制中消失他的脸回到了中立的平和的状态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_86928f5e:

    # e "Yeah... I can see what you mean."
    e "是的，我明白你的意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0cb8a352:

    # e "But, why would Uffe become alpha after this?"
    e "但是，为什么乌菲会成为阿尔法之后呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2f5332de:

    # w "Well, I was going to finish before you interrupted me, impatient little one."
    w "你打断我之前我本来要说完的急躁的小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_59280e30:

    # w "You will understand by the end of the story."
    w "故事结束时你会明白的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0d7e1ee8:

    # "Wuldon is chastising you, but not unkindly, as if indulging you. He seems to have something of a soft spot for you."
    "沃尔登在惩罚你，但并不是不礼貌的，好像在嘲弄你一样。他似乎对你有些温柔之处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e5cba2ee:

    # "... He also may or may not be checking you out."
    "他也可能在检查你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5d0b2774:

    # e "I understand, I'll let you continue."
    e "我明白，我让你继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5550ce65:

    # "Wuldon looks like he wants to chuckle... but as he recalls the story, he cannot seem to bring himself to."
    "伍尔顿看起来像他想要笑…… 但他回忆起这个故事，他似乎不能把自己带到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b74f8263:

    # w "I remember we spent hours in that cave, setting up the beginnings of a support structure."
    w "我记得我们在那洞穴里度过了几个小时建立了支助结构的开端。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_00d68bb3:

    # w "Wooden beams set up between us brothers as we moved deeper and deeper."
    w "在我们越走越深的时候，我们的兄弟之间架设了木梁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e901a1e2:

    # w "But, before we even got down to the ore..."
    w "但是，在我们还没到矿山之前……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_db0f4725:

    # "Wuldon's eyes are hollow as he approaches the true beginning of his story, his story bleeding into the present."
    "伍尔顿的眼神是空洞的当他接近他故事的真正开端时他的故事流着血流到现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5171ff42:

    # w "The mercantile brother began to scream."
    w "重商兄弟开始尖叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_43849761:

    # w "We in the mines felt it scratching at our minds, trying to etch its agony into our beings, as it did to him."
    w "我们在地雷里感觉到它触摸着我们的心灵，试图将它的痛苦带入我们的生命，就像它对他一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6670e10c:

    # w "The cave shook."
    w "洞穴震动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5d1bd972:

    # w "Our leader, this brother we trusted most, turned on us."
    w "我们的领袖——那个我们最信任的兄弟——反过来对付了我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_fc8f89f3:

    # w "When we looked at him, we found nobody looking back."
    w "当我们看着他，发现没有人回头看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_84a21c99:

    # w "He howled. A terrible, all-consuming sound of our basest instincts come to the fore."
    w "他哭泣了一种可怕的、耗尽一切的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b905f268:

    # w "Rocks fell."
    w "岩石落下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0e193144:

    # w "We ran. Less than half of us made it out."
    w "我们跑了不到一半的人逃出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e085a7cb:

    # "Wuldon looks empty as he remembers. Each death a person remembered and mourned."
    "沃尔登回忆起来时看起来空虚每一次死亡一个人都会记住并哀悼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9702f3bc:

    # e "W-what happened to them? How did they die?"
    e "他们怎么了他们怎么死的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0c54fb8a:

    # w "We were slaughtered by our trusted leader, and the crushing rocks he had called."
    w "我们被我们信任的领袖所屠杀和他所呼吁的石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e2c91b9f:

    # w "As the last of us escaped, the cave's mouth shrunk, smaller than even a werewolf runt could fit through."
    w "我们最后逃出来的时候洞穴的嘴缩小了比狼人矮子都小。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_cca2e7e3:

    # w "We could hear our brothers screaming, saw their faces as they tried to make it out, as we tried to pull them out..."
    w "我们能听到我们的兄弟尖叫，看见他们的脸当他们试图做到这一点出来，当我们试图拉他们出来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1757695f:

    # w "Invariably, they were pulled back in by the feral werewolf."
    w "他们总是被狼人救回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0e4693ec:

    # "Wuldon is simply looking at you, face locked into the grim features you first spied on him when you arrived."
    "沃尔登只是看着你面对你刚来时第一次监视他的严酷特征。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6fc1ead3:

    # e "Well, I found him in this cave a bit further out from here."
    e "我在这洞穴里发现他离这里更远一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_54f48265:

    # e "We fought, and I knocked him unconscious."
    e "我们吵架了我把他打晕了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_87bf6300:

    # e "Unfortunately, our fight caused the cave to collapse. I managed to rescue him, but..."
    e "不幸的是我们的战斗导致洞穴倒塌我设法救了他但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c0f6b8f0:

    # "Wuldon looks both relieved and concerned."
    "沃尔登看起来既松了一口气又忧心忡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_96a2484b:

    # w "But what?"
    w "但是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5d5267a7:

    # e "Well, he's not waking up. He's been unconscious since I left the cave, and I have nowhere to hide him."
    e "他没醒过来自从我离开洞穴后他就昏迷不醒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_fbd836f6:

    # "Wuldon turns sharply to look at you, his face filled with unease."
    "沃尔登转过身来直视你他的脸充满不安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ff1460b1:

    # w "You're not going to return him to Uffe, are you?"
    w "你不会把他还给乌菲吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c76d5c89:

    # e "No, probably not, but... he is a feral animal at this point."
    e "不，也许不是，但是…… 他现在是个野兽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0d04128e:

    # w "..."
    w "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ce6877c9:

    # w "Well, yes and no."
    w "是和不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9e15db04:

    # e "What do you mean?"
    e "你的意思是？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b8d96285:

    # "Wuldon has an extremely complicated look on his face."
    "伍尔顿脸上的表情非常复杂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1ee7559d:

    # w "Well, I suppose the best way to explain is to tell you the story of the feral werewolf and his curse."
    w "我想最好的解释方法就是告诉你狼人大军的故事和他的诅咒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1c09bd1d:

    # w "Uffe wants you to kill someone for him without even telling you who it was."
    w "乌菲要你为他杀人却不告诉你是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_48dc4dda:

    # "Wuldon's gaze has hardened somewhat."
    "伍尔顿的目光变硬了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1b391539:

    # w "He wants you to do his dirty work. Get rid of someone he sees as an obstacle."
    w "他要你做他的肮脏工作甩掉他视为障碍的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2fd10329:

    # "Wuldon lets out a sigh, and seems to center himself, preparing to tell a story."
    "伍尔顿叹息了一下似乎居中准备讲故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5ff6d557_1:

    # w "Once upon a time, two brothers led the dark forest tribe together."
    w "很久以前，两个兄弟共同领导着幽暗森林部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a6eed639_1:

    # w "One, a domineering and predatory man who wished for his tribe to hunt in isolation from the world."
    w "其中一个专横而凶残，希望自己的部落与世隔绝地狩猎为生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7e76f56b_1:

    # w "The other, kinder, and more mercantile, wishing to find ways to lead his brethren out of a life of kill or be killed."
    w "另一个更加温和，也更重视贸易，希望找到办法，让族人摆脱不是杀人就是被杀的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_30155229_1:

    # w "One day, the mercantile brother found a cave filled with precious ores. Ores that he knew the surrounding tribes and villages wanted."
    w "有一天，重视贸易的弟发现了一座满是珍贵矿石的洞穴。他知道，周围的部落和村庄都需要那些矿石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_18e00b1e_1:

    # w "Here, he saw his opportunity to lead his people out of the shadows, and into civilization."
    w "他看到了机会：带领族人走出阴影，迈入文明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a1ddfe21_1:

    # w "He told his pack about the cave, and told his brother about his dream."
    w "他把洞穴的事告诉了族人，也把自己的梦想告诉了哥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4ddaff46_1:

    # w "The hunting brother did not understand."
    w "负责狩猎的哥无法理解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9e95e973_1:

    # w "This lifestyle of hunting and killing was all they had ever had. All they would ever need."
    w "他们一直过的就是狩猎与杀戮的生活，也只需要这样的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_47af3197_1:

    # e "This sounds a lot like something I've heard before."
    e "这听起来很像我以前听过的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5a10f27b_1:

    # "Rather than respond, Wuldon grins a knowing grin."
    "伍尔顿不回答，而是嘲笑一个自知的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c8e72f65_1:

    # w "It was this very lifestyle that let his brother and he be alpha. They had carved their place in the tribe with their superior fangs and claws."
    w "他们用他们的尖牙和爪子在部落中刻出了他们的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_dbf010d5_1:

    # w "Even if they proved this by killing their brethren, that was how things should be."
    w "即使他们通过杀害兄弟来证明这一点，但事情应该如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_742fd9c4_1:

    # w "The mercantile brother asked that he still be allowed to try his dream."
    w "商家兄弟要求继续允许他尝试他的梦想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d1b3a1e8_1:

    # w "They were equals, and they could follow both lifestyles."
    w "他们是平等的，他们可以遵循两种生活方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4a79ac2e_1:

    # e "Could they really? It's only one pack."
    e "真的可以吗只有一包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_72aaacdd_1:

    # w "It was a pack with two alphas, little one. This was not the first disagreement."
    w "这是两张字母的包裹，小的，这不是第一次意见不一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_952f8a87_1:

    # w "They had their solutions, though sometimes one or both sides were unhappy with it."
    w "他们有自己的解决办法，尽管有时一方或双方对此不满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6914f8eb_1:

    # e "What kind of solutions were they?"
    e "它们是什么样的解决办法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4469fffe_1:

    # w "All will be revealed in time."
    w "一切都将及时公布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_75e6c887_1:

    # "Wuldon's tone carries a sense of finality to it, telling you to be quiet so he can keep telling the story."
    "沃尔登的语气有结束感告诉你安静这样他就可以继续讲故事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_777b66de_1:

    # w "In order to make sure his brother would not be disrupted, he took half of the tribe with him to the mines."
    w "为了确保他的兄弟不会受到干扰，他将一半的部落和他一起带到矿井。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ffc2c793_1:

    # w "The hunting brother was furious."
    w "猎杀兄弟很愤怒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e2f23def_1:

    # w "His foolish wretch of a brother wished to betray him and their way of life."
    w "他一个哥的愚蠢卑鄙之徒想背叛他和他们的生活方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a22cedd2_1:

    # w "He had to be rid of him, but they were equals, as his brother had intimated."
    w "他必须摆脱他，但他们是平等的，正如他兄弟所亲密的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_aaf44662_1:

    # w "They had fought before, and had to stop every time before they both died."
    w "他们以前打过仗每次都得在他们死前停下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_20591f0f_1:

    # w "As he fumed, lashing out and beating his fellow wolves in anger, we, the followers of the mercantile brother, left."
    w "当他抽烟、鞭打和愤怒地殴打他的狼同伴时，我们这个重商兄弟的追随者离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b9e7c7dc_1:

    # e "And the hunting brother? What happened when you left?"
    e "那负责狩猎的哥呢？你离开后发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_108d3b43_1:

    # w "I do not know what happened in the other half of the pack."
    w "我不知道在另一半的包里发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_bd1dca83_1:

    # w "I left, and never looked back."
    w "我离开，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_64201363_1:

    # e "Why did you leave?"
    e "为什么你离开？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3f8ae830_1:

    # "Wuldon looks unimpressed with you. His bright eyes betrayed his next line before he even spoke.:"
    "伍尔顿对你没有印象他的明亮眼睛在说话之前背叛了他的下一条线"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2763c97a_1:

    # w "You have seen the pack today."
    w "你们今天已经看到这群人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a036dfec_1:

    # w "I hear them hunting and dying like wild animals under the leadership of Uffe."
    w "我听到他们在乌菲的领导下像野兽一样猎杀和死去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_50686055_1:

    # e "But you didn't know that would happen!"
    e "但你不知道会发生这种事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3406d96a_1:

    # "Wuldon's face is creased with the beginning of a disgusted snarl."
    "伍尔顿的脸被一个恶心的鼻涕开始折裂了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3dc76aae_1:

    # w "Yes. I didn't. But I knew Uffe, and I knew he would become alpha."
    w "是的，我没有，但我认识乌菲，我知道他会成为阿尔法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_86bfa5c4_1:

    # "Having gotten his hatred of Uffe out of his system, his face returns to its neutral, somber state."
    "他对乌菲的憎恨已经从他的体制中消失他的脸回到了中立的平和的状态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_86928f5e_1:

    # e "Yeah... I can see what you mean."
    e "是的，我明白你的意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0cb8a352_1:

    # e "But, why would Uffe become alpha after this?"
    e "但是，为什么乌菲会成为阿尔法之后呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2ae8194a:

    # w "Well, I was going to finish before you interrupted me."
    w "你打断我之前我本来要说完的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_59280e30_1:

    # w "You will understand by the end of the story."
    w "故事结束时你会明白的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d680e614:

    # "Wuldon is chastising you gently. You have been interrupting a lot, so you suppose it makes sense"
    "沃尔登轻地惩罚你打扰了很久，所以你认为这合理"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5d0b2774_1:

    # e "I understand, I'll let you continue."
    e "我明白，我让你继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_190ffc79:

    # "Wuldon takes a deep breath, and begins once more."
    "伍尔顿深呼吸重新开始。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b74f8263_1:

    # w "I remember we spent hours in that cave, setting up the beginnings of a support structure."
    w "我记得我们在那洞穴里度过了几个小时建立了支助结构的开端。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_00d68bb3_1:

    # w "Wooden beams set up between us brothers as we moved deeper and deeper."
    w "在我们越走越深的时候，我们的兄弟之间架设了木梁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e901a1e2_1:

    # w "But, before we even got down to the ore..."
    w "但是，在我们还没到矿山之前……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_db0f4725_1:

    # "Wuldon's eyes are hollow as he approaches the true beginning of his story, his story bleeding into the present."
    "伍尔顿的眼神是空洞的当他接近他故事的真正开端时他的故事流着血流到现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5171ff42_1:

    # w "The mercantile brother began to scream."
    w "重商兄弟开始尖叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_43849761_1:

    # w "We in the mines felt it scratching at our minds, trying to etch its agony into our beings, as it did to him."
    w "我们在地雷里感觉到它触摸着我们的心灵，试图将它的痛苦带入我们的生命，就像它对他一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6670e10c_1:

    # w "The cave shook."
    w "洞穴震动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5d1bd972_1:

    # w "Our leader, this brother we trusted most, turned on us."
    w "我们的领袖——那个我们最信任的兄弟——反过来对付了我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_fc8f89f3_1:

    # w "When we looked at him, we found nobody looking back."
    w "当我们看着他，发现没有人回头看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_84a21c99_1:

    # w "He howled. A terrible, all-consuming sound of our basest instincts come to the fore."
    w "他哭泣了一种可怕的、耗尽一切的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b905f268_1:

    # w "Rocks fell."
    w "岩石落下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0e193144_1:

    # w "We ran. Less than half of us made it out."
    w "我们跑了不到一半的人逃出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e085a7cb_1:

    # "Wuldon looks empty as he remembers. Each death a person remembered and mourned."
    "沃尔登回忆起来时看起来空虚每一次死亡一个人都会记住并哀悼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_921f1ebe:

    # e "Having fought him, I can't imagine the feral werewolf could kill that many of you."
    e "我无法想象狼人能杀死你们中那么多人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b618a9a2:

    # e "How did they die?"
    e "他们是怎么死的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_371ef37b:

    # "Wuldon lets out a hollow laugh."
    "伍尔顿大笑了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4dfabce2:

    # w "We were slaughtered not only by our trusted leader, but the crushing rocks he had called."
    w "我们不仅被我们信任的领导人所屠杀，而且被他所召唤的岩石所摧毁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e2c91b9f_1:

    # w "As the last of us escaped, the cave's mouth shrunk, smaller than even a werewolf runt could fit through."
    w "我们最后逃出来的时候洞穴的嘴缩小了比狼人矮子都小。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_cca2e7e3_1:

    # w "We could hear our brothers screaming, saw their faces as they tried to make it out, as we tried to pull them out..."
    w "我们能听到我们的兄弟尖叫，看见他们的脸当他们试图做到这一点出来，当我们试图拉他们出来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1757695f_1:

    # w "Invariably, they were pulled back in by the feral werewolf."
    w "他们总是被狼人救回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0e4693ec_1:

    # "Wuldon is simply looking at you, face locked into the grim features you first spied on him when you arrived."
    "沃尔登只是看着你面对你刚来时第一次监视他的严酷特征。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9484e513:

    # e "Well... I killed him."
    e "我杀了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2c173a44:

    # "Wuldon goes still."
    "沃尔登不动了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4d2d9237:

    # e "More accurately, we fought, and I knocked him unconscious."
    e "更确切地说，我们吵架了，我把他打晕了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e92ef770:

    # e "I was deciding what to do with him when the cave started to collapse due to our fight."
    e "山洞由于我们的战斗而塌陷的时候我决定了怎么处置他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ab051a53:

    # e "I had to leave him behind and escape."
    e "我不得不丢下他逃走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2a7e25f8:

    # "Wuldon sits down. His eyes are filled with grief"
    "伍尔顿坐下来，他满眼忧愁，"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7017f3fd:

    # w "Vurro..."
    w "伏罗..."

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7565e124:

    # e "Who's Vurro?."
    e "谁是伏罗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4df964cf:

    # "Wuldon turns to look at you. He is still clearly mourning, but there is a sort of grim determination written on his face."
    "沃尔登转身看你，他显然仍然在哀悼你，但他脸上写着一种严酷的决心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_efebc27f:

    # w "The person Uffe made you kill."
    w "乌菲让你杀的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2328ccd5:

    # "A sense of unease grips your chest."
    "一种不安感抚摸你的胸口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f4cd35cc:

    # e "I thought he was just some feral werewolf, no?"
    e "我以为他只是狼人，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_8bcbc333:

    # "Wuldon lets out a humorless chuckle."
    "伍尔顿放出一个没幽默感的笑柄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_fee2ebc7:

    # w "In a way, yes."
    w "从某种意义上说，是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a8930d83:

    # w "But no. That feral werewolf was once a man with friends and loved ones."
    w "但是没有那个狼人曾是朋友和亲人的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_78ecc45e:

    # "He sighs deeply, deflating slightly"
    "他深的叹气轻的减缩"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f929221e:

    # w "One who has now died through no fault of his own."
    w "一个已经去世的人并不是因为自己的过错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6a79af39:

    # "There is a long stretch of silence in the conversation."
    "谈话中一直有很长的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_68cfa84f:

    # "You are both just... looking at the floor, before Wuldon looks up at you."
    "你们两个只是…… 看着地板，在沃尔登看着你之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6e487166:

    # w "You know... I don't really blame you for his death."
    w "我不怪你杀他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2c9b233f:

    # w "It's that rat Uffe that I hate more than ever for this."
    w "我比以往更讨厌那老鼠乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_143b80ad:

    # e "Well, from what he was saying, he just wanted to make sure the disease didn't spread..."
    e "从他所说的话来看他只是想确保疾病没有传播……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a0279f66:

    # "Wuldon laughs. An actual, deep laugh. A laugh filled with hateful contempt."
    "沃尔登笑，一个真正的，深沉的笑充满了仇恨的蔑视的笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_672c1048:

    # w "No, little one. Knowing him, that was not why he did so at all."
    w "不，小家伙，了解他，这不是他这么做的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9e15db04_1:

    # e "What do you mean?"
    e "你的意思是？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_cd87ad5b:

    # "Wuldon turns to look you dead in the eye."
    "伍尔顿转身看着你死在眼里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_75e8188c:

    # w "Well, I suppose the best way to explain is to tell you the story of Vurro, and his curse."
    w "我想最好的解释方法就是告诉你伏罗的故事还有他的诅咒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_adfc97a5:

    # w "Uffe used you to kill a great man without even telling you who he was."
    w "乌菲利用你杀了一个伟人却连他是谁都不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c2f3f9ea:

    # "Wuldon's eyes have sharpened into flints."
    "伍尔顿的眼睛已经尖锐到火石了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9a2ddfb0:

    # w "He got rid of an obstacle. He has no respect for others - only the veneration of the self."
    w "他摆脱了障碍，他不尊重他人，只尊重自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2fd10329_1:

    # "Wuldon lets out a sigh, and seems to center himself, preparing to tell a story."
    "伍尔顿叹息了一下似乎居中准备讲故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_eb88dbf0:

    # w "So, I'm going to tell you the story of the man you were forced to kill."
    w "所以我要告诉你被迫杀的人的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5ff6d557_2:

    # w "Once upon a time, two brothers led the dark forest tribe together."
    w "很久以前，两个兄弟共同领导着幽暗森林部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a6eed639_2:

    # w "One, a domineering and predatory man who wished for his tribe to hunt in isolation from the world."
    w "其中一个专横而凶残，希望自己的部落与世隔绝地狩猎为生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7e76f56b_2:

    # w "The other, kinder, and more mercantile, wishing to find ways to lead his brethren out of a life of kill or be killed."
    w "另一个更加温和，也更重视贸易，希望找到办法，让族人摆脱不是杀人就是被杀的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_30155229_2:

    # w "One day, the mercantile brother found a cave filled with precious ores. Ores that he knew the surrounding tribes and villages wanted."
    w "有一天，重视贸易的弟发现了一座满是珍贵矿石的洞穴。他知道，周围的部落和村庄都需要那些矿石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_18e00b1e_2:

    # w "Here, he saw his opportunity to lead his people out of the shadows, and into civilization."
    w "他看到了机会：带领族人走出阴影，迈入文明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a1ddfe21_2:

    # w "He told his pack about the cave, and told his brother about his dream."
    w "他把洞穴的事告诉了族人，也把自己的梦想告诉了哥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4ddaff46_2:

    # w "The hunting brother did not understand."
    w "负责狩猎的哥无法理解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9e95e973_2:

    # w "This lifestyle of hunting and killing was all they had ever had. All they would ever need."
    w "他们一直过的就是狩猎与杀戮的生活，也只需要这样的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_47af3197_2:

    # e "This sounds a lot like something I've heard before."
    e "这听起来很像我以前听过的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_024c0001:

    # "Rather than respond, Wuldon shoots you a glare."
    "伍尔顿没有回应，反而给你一枪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c8e72f65_2:

    # w "It was this very lifestyle that let his brother and he be alpha. They had carved their place in the tribe with their superior fangs and claws."
    w "他们用他们的尖牙和爪子在部落中刻出了他们的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_dbf010d5_2:

    # w "Even if they proved this by killing their brethren, that was how things should be."
    w "即使他们通过杀害兄弟来证明这一点，但事情应该如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_742fd9c4_2:

    # w "The mercantile brother asked that he still be allowed to try his dream."
    w "商家兄弟要求继续允许他尝试他的梦想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d1b3a1e8_2:

    # w "They were equals, and they could follow both lifestyles."
    w "他们是平等的，他们可以遵循两种生活方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4a79ac2e_2:

    # e "Could they really? It's only one pack."
    e "真的可以吗只有一包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_72aaacdd_2:

    # w "It was a pack with two alphas, little one. This was not the first disagreement."
    w "这是两张字母的包裹，小的，这不是第一次意见不一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_952f8a87_2:

    # w "They had their solutions, though sometimes one or both sides were unhappy with it."
    w "他们有自己的解决办法，尽管有时一方或双方对此不满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6914f8eb_2:

    # e "What kind of solutions were they?"
    e "它们是什么样的解决办法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_bdcdb42d:

    # w "The only ones you can make when your co-leader is a disgusting creature driven only by primal desire."
    w "唯一能做的就是你的共同领导是一个恶心的生物只能靠原始欲望驱使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f6aab478:

    # "Wuldon's tone carries a sense of finality to it, ordering you to be quiet so he can keep telling the story."
    "沃尔登的语气带有一种终极感命令你保持安静这样他才能继续讲故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_777b66de_2:

    # w "In order to make sure his brother would not be disrupted, he took half of the tribe with him to the mines."
    w "为了确保他的兄弟不会受到干扰，他将一半的部落和他一起带到矿井。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ffc2c793_2:

    # w "The hunting brother was furious."
    w "猎杀兄弟很愤怒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e2f23def_2:

    # w "His foolish wretch of a brother wished to betray him and their way of life."
    w "他一个哥的愚蠢卑鄙之徒想背叛他和他们的生活方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a22cedd2_2:

    # w "He had to be rid of him, but they were equals, as his brother had intimated."
    w "他必须摆脱他，但他们是平等的，正如他兄弟所亲密的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_aaf44662_2:

    # w "They had fought before, and had to stop every time before they both died."
    w "他们以前打过仗每次都得在他们死前停下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_20591f0f_2:

    # w "As he fumed, lashing out and beating his fellow wolves in anger, we, the followers of the mercantile brother, left."
    w "当他抽烟、鞭打和愤怒地殴打他的狼同伴时，我们这个重商兄弟的追随者离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b9e7c7dc_2:

    # e "And the hunting brother? What happened when you left?"
    e "那负责狩猎的哥呢？你离开后发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_108d3b43_2:

    # w "I do not know what happened in the other half of the pack."
    w "我不知道在另一半的包里发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_bd1dca83_2:

    # w "I left, and never looked back."
    w "我离开，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_64201363_2:

    # e "Why did you leave?"
    e "为什么你离开？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d24995f9:

    # "Wuldon looks disappointed in you. His bright eyes betrayed his next line before he even spoke.:"
    "伍尔顿对你很失望他的明亮眼睛在他说话之前就背叛了他的下一条线"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2763c97a_2:

    # w "You have seen the pack today."
    w "你们今天已经看到这群人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a036dfec_2:

    # w "I hear them hunting and dying like wild animals under the leadership of Uffe."
    w "我听到他们在乌菲的领导下像野兽一样猎杀和死去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_50686055_2:

    # e "But you didn't know that would happen!"
    e "但你不知道会发生这种事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3406d96a_2:

    # "Wuldon's face is creased with the beginning of a disgusted snarl."
    "伍尔顿的脸被一个恶心的鼻涕开始折裂了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3dc76aae_2:

    # w "Yes. I didn't. But I knew Uffe, and I knew he would become alpha."
    w "是的，我没有，但我认识乌菲，我知道他会成为阿尔法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_86928f5e_2:

    # e "Yeah... I can see what you mean."
    e "是的，我明白你的意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0cb8a352_2:

    # e "But, why would Uffe become alpha after this?"
    e "但是，为什么乌菲会成为阿尔法之后呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a185d6c4:

    # w "If you would let me speak, rather than interrupt me at your every whim, you would know by now."
    w "如果你让我说，而不是打扰我，因为你的每一个怪念头，你就会知道现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_01864d1d:

    # "There is disgust in his words. He seems to see your interruptions as a form of contempt for the story of the life you took."
    "他的话令人厌恶，他似乎认为你的干扰是对你所经历的人生的蔑视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b74f8263_2:

    # w "I remember we spent hours in that cave, setting up the beginnings of a support structure."
    w "我记得我们在那洞穴里度过了几个小时建立了支助结构的开端。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_00d68bb3_2:

    # w "Wooden beams set up between us brothers as we moved deeper and deeper."
    w "在我们越走越深的时候，我们的兄弟之间架设了木梁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e901a1e2_2:

    # w "But, before we even got down to the ore..."
    w "但是，在我们还没到矿山之前……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_db0f4725_2:

    # "Wuldon's eyes are hollow as he approaches the true beginning of his story, his story bleeding into the present."
    "伍尔顿的眼神是空洞的当他接近他故事的真正开端时他的故事流着血流到现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5171ff42_2:

    # w "The mercantile brother began to scream."
    w "重商兄弟开始尖叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_43849761_2:

    # w "We in the mines felt it scratching at our minds, trying to etch its agony into our beings, as it did to him."
    w "我们在地雷里感觉到它触摸着我们的心灵，试图将它的痛苦带入我们的生命，就像它对他一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6670e10c_2:

    # w "The cave shook."
    w "洞穴震动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5d1bd972_2:

    # w "Our leader, this brother we trusted most, turned on us."
    w "我们的领袖——那个我们最信任的兄弟——反过来对付了我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_fc8f89f3_2:

    # w "When we looked at him, we found nobody looking back."
    w "当我们看着他，发现没有人回头看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_84a21c99_2:

    # w "He howled. A terrible, all-consuming sound of our basest instincts come to the fore."
    w "他哭泣了一种可怕的、耗尽一切的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b905f268_2:

    # w "Rocks fell."
    w "岩石落下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0e193144_2:

    # w "We ran. Less than half of us made it out."
    w "我们跑了不到一半的人逃出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e085a7cb_2:

    # "Wuldon looks empty as he remembers. Each death a person remembered and mourned."
    "沃尔登回忆起来时看起来空虚每一次死亡一个人都会记住并哀悼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_921f1ebe_1:

    # e "Having fought him, I can't imagine the feral werewolf could kill that many of you."
    e "我无法想象狼人能杀死你们中那么多人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b618a9a2_1:

    # e "How did they die?"
    e "他们是怎么死的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_371ef37b_1:

    # "Wuldon lets out a hollow laugh."
    "伍尔顿大笑了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4dfabce2_1:

    # w "We were slaughtered not only by our trusted leader, but the crushing rocks he had called."
    w "我们不仅被我们信任的领导人所屠杀，而且被他所召唤的岩石所摧毁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e2c91b9f_2:

    # w "As the last of us escaped, the cave's mouth shrunk, smaller than even a werewolf runt could fit through."
    w "我们最后逃出来的时候洞穴的嘴缩小了比狼人矮子都小。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_cca2e7e3_2:

    # w "We could hear our brothers screaming, saw their faces as they tried to make it out, as we tried to pull them out..."
    w "我们能听到我们的兄弟尖叫，看见他们的脸当他们试图做到这一点出来，当我们试图拉他们出来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1757695f_2:

    # w "Invariably, they were pulled back in by the feral werewolf."
    w "他们总是被狼人救回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0e4693ec_2:

    # "Wuldon is simply looking at you, face locked into the grim features you first spied on him when you arrived."
    "沃尔登只是看着你面对你刚来时第一次监视他的严酷特征。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_dfaa372c:

    # e "I... take it Uffe was the hunting brother, wasn't he."
    e "我猜，乌菲就是那个负责狩猎的哥，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_77f9b3bf:

    # w "Yes. That sick excuse for a werewolf was Uffe."
    w "是的狼人的病因是乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ade8d9e0:

    # w "Is Uffe. He has not changed."
    w "是乌菲。他没有改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_61f6beb8:

    # e "And... you were among those in the mines, with..."
    e "你曾经是矿井里的人，还有……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_06ebdd12:

    # "Grief briefly fills Wuldon's features, an alien look on the otherwise unerringly confident man."
    "悲伤短暂地填充了沃尔登的特征外星人看着那个充满自信的男人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d4320832:

    # w "Vurro. Our leader, the mercantile brother Vurro."
    w "我们的领袖商家兄弟武洛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4b5f10bc:

    # e "So. He is..."
    e "所以。他是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7aa4d5dc:

    # w "Yes. He is the feral werewolf you have been sent to kill."
    w "是的他是你被派去杀的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c749a4c3:

    # e "And you have no idea what happened to make him go feral?"
    e "你不知道发生了什么使他大发雷霆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b9cb43ce:

    # w "No, but I strongly suspect Uffe had something to do with it."
    w "没有但我很怀疑乌菲和这件事有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f4664d41:

    # "Wuldon crosses his arms, a portrait of pent up frustration."
    "伍尔顿横跨他的手臂画上沮丧的肖像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9cf376ca:

    # e "What makes you say that?"
    e "你为什么这么说？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_db9809b8:

    # "The look of frustration has only turned into an ill-contained snarl."
    "沮丧的表情变成了一丝不挂的鼻涕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ad4191f5:

    # w "It is the kind of thing a creature like him would do."
    w "象他这样的生物会做这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ea00b63e:

    # e "Well... fine. We don't know what happened to him, but..."
    e "好吧，我们不知道他怎么了，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9ec52c5f:

    # e "Is there no way we can... you know... save him?"
    e "我们不可能…… 你知道…… 救他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7dce02f5:

    # w "Perhaps there is, but... I cannot reach him, nor do I have the expertise in medicines to find the cure."
    w "也许有，但是…… 我找不到他，我也没有药物方面的专门知识来找到治疗方法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_572c7d96:

    # e "Should I... kill him...?"
    e "我…… 杀了他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1c884221:

    # w "It is up to you, little one. I have told you his story, and it is your choice."
    w "由你决定，小家伙我已经告诉你他的故事了，这是你的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2b98de3c:

    # "Wuldon turns to focus on drawing water from the well once more."
    "伍尔顿又开始专注于从井里抽水了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_512e1175:

    # w "Merely know that before his curse, he did not deserve to die alone and forgotten."
    w "我只知道，在诅咒降临之前，他不该孤独地死去，更不该被世人遗忘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a60a6a96:

    # e "...Okay."
    e "……对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1a8da24f:

    # e "I think I will be going now."
    e "我想我该走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_01b73096:

    # e "I will not tell Uffe about where you are."
    e "我不会告诉乌菲你在哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_fe4115d0:

    # w "I appreciate it, little one. You seem to be as kind as you are handsome."
    w "我很感激，小家伙你看起来和帅气一样善良。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6f0f21b2:

    # "The entirely serious tone he took when saying that feels at odds with his words, but... you suppose he means it."
    "他说的语气很严肃感觉和他的话有矛盾但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e4941e3b:

    # w "Best of luck. Try to survive."
    w "祝你好运。试着生存下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_048133d4:

    # w "And do tell me what happens with Vurro."
    w "告诉我伏罗怎么样了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_dfaa372c_1:

    # e "I... take it Uffe was the hunting brother, wasn't he."
    e "我猜，乌菲就是那个负责狩猎的哥，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_77f9b3bf_1:

    # w "Yes. That sick excuse for a werewolf was Uffe."
    w "是的狼人的病因是乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ade8d9e0_1:

    # w "Is Uffe. He has not changed."
    w "是乌菲。他没有改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_61f6beb8_1:

    # e "And... you were among those in the mines, with..."
    e "你曾经是矿井里的人，还有……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_06ebdd12_1:

    # "Grief briefly fills Wuldon's features, an alien look on the otherwise unerringly confident man."
    "悲伤短暂地填充了沃尔登的特征外星人看着那个充满自信的男人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d4320832_1:

    # w "Vurro. Our leader, the mercantile brother Vurro."
    w "我们的领袖商家兄弟武洛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4b5f10bc_1:

    # e "So. He is..."
    e "所以。他是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_35540968:

    # w "Yes. He is the feral werewolf you were sent to kill."
    w "是的他是你派去杀的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c749a4c3_1:

    # e "And you have no idea what happened to make him go feral?"
    e "你不知道发生了什么使他大发雷霆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b9cb43ce_1:

    # w "No, but I strongly suspect Uffe had something to do with it."
    w "没有但我很怀疑乌菲和这件事有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f4664d41_1:

    # "Wuldon crosses his arms, a portrait of pent up frustration."
    "伍尔顿横跨他的手臂画上沮丧的肖像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9cf376ca_1:

    # e "What makes you say that?"
    e "你为什么这么说？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_51b7edec:

    # "The look of frustration on his face deepens, turning into an ill-contained snarl."
    "他脸上的沮丧的表情加深了，变成了一丝不挂的鼻涕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ad4191f5_1:

    # w "It is the kind of thing a creature like him would do."
    w "象他这样的生物会做这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ea00b63e_1:

    # e "Well... fine. We don't know what happened to him, but..."
    e "好吧，我们不知道他怎么了，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9ec52c5f_1:

    # e "Is there no way we can... you know... save him?"
    e "我们不可能…… 你知道…… 救他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c5922e65:

    # w "There might be..."
    w "也许……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4f21c884:

    # w "I do not have the expertise in medicine to save him, but I believe I may be able to help him."
    w "我没有医学专家来救他但我相信也许我能帮助他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2095331c:

    # w "If you tell me where you left him, I can go get him, and bring him back to my home."
    w "如果你告诉我你把他留在哪里我可以去找他把他带回我家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e96c429c:

    # "Wuldon looks somewhat hopeful."
    "伍尔顿看起来有点希望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7c6d014a:

    # e "I suppose I can do that."
    e "我想我可以做到这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e282a628:

    # e "How do you plan on trying to find a cure though?"
    e "那你打算怎么找解药呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_e75cb056:

    # "Wuldon spends a while deep in thought before answering you."
    "伍尔顿在回答你之前花了很多时间深思熟虑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ad430e96:

    # w "I know a few herbs that might be able to help. I will need to trial and error them."
    w "我知道一些药草也许能帮上忙我需要试一下错误地尝试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9b3991ec:

    # w "This would of course be faster with an alchemist, but..."
    w "当然，如果有炼金术师的话，这个速度会更快，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f02fdbe8:

    # "Wuldon gestures around him."
    "沃尔登在他身边的手势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_11febdeb:

    # w "As you can see, we have a relative paucity of alchemists around these parts."
    w "如你所见，这些地方的炼金术家相对稀少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3975bc85:

    # "You immediately think of Haskell, but remember his reluctance to mix potions."
    "你立刻想到哈斯克尔但记住他不愿混合药剂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_21df012d:

    # e "Well, I'll see if I can figure out some way to help."
    e "好吧，我会想办法看能不能帮上忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f6c3018a:

    # e "For now, though, you can find Vurro hidden in a large bush to the right of the collapsed cave."
    e "不过，现在，你可以发现伏罗藏在一个大灌木丛里在倒塌的洞穴的右边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ced41d49:

    # w "Thank you, little one."
    w "谢你，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_3c68a5b6:

    # "Wuldon's voice is a grateful growl. It seems he genuinely appreciates your desire to help."
    "沃尔登的声音是感激的咆哮他似乎真的很感激你帮忙的渴望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_314b7fe2:

    # w "I will be heading there now. I do not want to risk Uffe or any of his minions finding Vurro first."
    w "我现在要去那 我不想冒险让乌菲和他的任何仆人先找到伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ff4a99af:

    # w "I hope to talk to you later."
    w "希望之后还能再和你聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f2ce727d:

    # "And with that, Wuldon turns around and begins to quietly make his way through the forest, in the direction of the cave."
    "说完，伍尔顿转过身，朝洞穴的方向悄然穿过森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_20f315d4:

    # e "See you later!"
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_dfaa372c_2:

    # e "I... take it Uffe was the hunting brother, wasn't he."
    e "我猜，乌菲就是那个负责狩猎的哥，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_77f9b3bf_2:

    # w "Yes. That sick excuse for a werewolf was Uffe."
    w "是的狼人的病因是乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ade8d9e0_2:

    # w "Is Uffe. He has not changed."
    w "是乌菲。他没有改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_61f6beb8_2:

    # e "And... you were among those in the mines, with..."
    e "你曾经是矿井里的人，还有……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ec4e9e3a:

    # "Grief briefly fills Wuldon's features."
    "悲伤短暂地填补了沃尔登的特征。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_d4320832_2:

    # w "Vurro. Our leader, the mercantile brother Vurro."
    w "我们的领袖商家兄弟武洛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4b5f10bc_2:

    # e "So. He is..."
    e "所以。他是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_35540968_1:

    # w "Yes. He is the feral werewolf you were sent to kill."
    w "是的他是你派去杀的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c749a4c3_2:

    # e "And you have no idea what happened to make him go feral?"
    e "你不知道发生了什么使他大发雷霆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_b9cb43ce_2:

    # w "No, but I strongly suspect Uffe had something to do with it."
    w "没有但我很怀疑乌菲和这件事有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f4664d41_2:

    # "Wuldon crosses his arms, a portrait of pent up frustration."
    "伍尔顿横跨他的手臂画上沮丧的肖像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_9cf376ca_2:

    # e "What makes you say that?"
    e "你为什么这么说？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_51b7edec_1:

    # "The look of frustration on his face deepens, turning into an ill-contained snarl."
    "他脸上的沮丧的表情加深了，变成了一丝不挂的鼻涕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ad4191f5_2:

    # w "It is the kind of thing a creature like him would do."
    w "象他这样的生物会做这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_ea00b63e_2:

    # e "Well... fine. We don't know what happened to him, but..."
    e "好吧，我们不知道他怎么了，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6a67dcc0:

    # e "Is there some way we can find out?"
    e "有什么办法可以查吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_5715a3f8:

    # w "There might be, but... I don't really care."
    w "也许有，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_c8bbb7c0:

    # w "Vurro is dead."
    w "伏罗死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_1dc467a7:

    # "There is a long silence."
    "有一个很长的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_0b3d1fea:

    # e "So... what will you do now?"
    e "那么…… 你现在要做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6111a711:

    # w "I don't know."
    w "我不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a474c916:

    # w "For now, live out here. Think about things for a while."
    w "暂时就住在这里吧，好想一想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_7b49bfdc:

    # w "After that...?"
    w "在那之后……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_4bb18011:

    # "Wuldon's eyes turn cold."
    "沃尔登的眼睛变冷了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_49ae41b4:

    # w "Find the most painful way to kill Uffe I can think of."
    w "找到最痛苦的方法杀死乌菲，我可以想到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_a20cefa7_4:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_f899c20d:

    # e "Oh."
    e "哦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_cc74bd52:

    # e "Well, I'll... leave you to that. I'm sorry about Vurro."
    e "好吧，我先告辞了，我对伏罗的事很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_dc5bbb48:

    # "There is a long pause."
    "有一个很长的暂停时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_94382cd4:

    # w "Yes. I do not blame you, as I said before."
    w "是的，我不责怪你，就像我之前说过的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_2fcac9ad:

    # w "Goodbye. We may meet again. Until then."
    w "再见我们可能会再见面在那之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_6d62bfc2:

    # e "Until then."
    e "直到那时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_First_Meet_46b7991f:

    # "With that, you get out of there as quickly as you can without running."
    "有了它，你就能尽快离开那里，不跑就跑得越快越好。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_b2d01fe9:

    # "Arriving at Wuldon's house, you see the big blue werewolf sitting on a chair outside."
    "来到沃尔登家看到外面的椅子上坐在椅子上的大蓝狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_5321471c:

    # "Taking a closer look, you can tell that his eyes are closed. You think he's messing with you until you hear a quiet snore from him."
    "仔细看一看，他的眼睛是闭着的，你以为他在耍你，直到听到他安静的呼噜。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_01ae3222:

    # "Grinning, you sneak over close to Wuldon, making sure not to snap any twigs this time."
    "你咧嘴一笑，小心翼地靠近伍尔顿，确保这次不会踩断树枝。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_516db5cf:

    # "Just as you're about to try and spook him, you see one of his eyes snap open."
    "就像你正要吓唬他一样你看到他一只眼睛睁开。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_6a3759c0:

    # w "Good morning little one. You didn't really think you'd be able to catch me sleeping, did you?"
    w "早，你真以为能赶上我睡着吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_0d04128e:

    # w "..."
    w "……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_4f416a5d:

    # e "I was hoping I would."
    e "我希望我会。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_767cb4d2:

    # "Wuldon chuckles, getting up out of his chair."
    "伍尔顿笑着起床从他的椅子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_ac8335a3:

    # w "Well, maybe next time."
    w "也许下次吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_54dbf3bf:

    # w "For now, let's go take care of Vurro. Follow me."
    w "现在，我们去照顾伏罗，跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_d0084942:

    # "You walk up and knock on Wuldon's door."
    "你走起来敲沃尔登的门。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_cde4eaca:

    # "There is no answer."
    "没有答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_4bb8162a:

    # "He's either not here, or doesn't want to talk to you right now."
    "他要么不在这里要么现在不想和你说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_slumbrous_well_729eaed2:

    # "No one opens the door when you knock on it. They are either not here, or too busy to hear you."
    "敲门的时候没人开门他们要么不在这里要么忙到听不见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bruisers_Test_Loop_da138948:

    # "The ground rumbles and a green bush appears ahead, it seems you have successfully passed the test."
    "地面崩塌前面有一片绿树似乎你成功通过了测试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bruisers_Test_Loop_a9f3b742:

    # "You walk towards the bush, and discovers a trinket on the ground, a bitten mushroom that smells like blood."
    "你走到灌木丛边，发现地上有一件饰品——一朵带着齿痕、闻起来像血的蘑菇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bruisers_Test_Loop_4007d7bd:

    # "You pick it up and put it in the bag, and continue on your path to the well."
    "你把它捡起来放进袋子里继续沿着你通往井道前进。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Cave_729eaed2:

    # "No one opens the door when you knock on it. They are either not here, or too busy to hear you."
    "敲门的时候没人开门他们要么不在这里要么忙到听不见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Cave_b5c7ed76:

    # msg "Author's Note: The final stage (stage 4/4) of the werewolf plot line isn't ready yet."
    msg "作者的注：狼人地块线的最后阶段(第4/4阶段)尚未准备就绪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_3454f149:

    # "The forest is oddly silent as you approach Wuldon's house."
    "森林里有奇怪的沉默当你接近沃尔登家的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_b9a2144e:

    # "The only sounds you can hear are the quiet gurgling of the stream, and the soft rustling of the leaves underfoot."
    "你能听见的只有溪水轻的潺声，以及脚下树叶的细碎沙声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_ae19faae:

    # e "Hello? Is anyone there?"
    e "喂？有人在吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_aa14572f:

    # "Silence. Your voice echoes out into the woods."
    "安静，你的声音呼唤着树林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_4865da0d:

    # "As you turn around to leave, you see Wuldon far back on the path behind you, holding his khopesh."
    "当你转身离开时，你可以看到伍尔顿远在你的后面，抱着他的呼噜声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_6669ecc0:

    # w "Hello, little one."
    w "你好，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_23b57057:

    # w "I heard you while I was on my way to pay my respects at Vurro's grave."
    w "我在去伏罗墓向您致敬的路上听见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_9adae723:

    # "Already you feel uncomfortable. The werewolf in front of you seems void of any emotion, his body driven only by purpose, or some vague promise."
    "站在你面前的狼人似乎没有任何情感，他的身体只是被目的所驱使的，或者一些模糊的承诺所驱使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_efa76f1a:

    # w "Would you like to come along with me?"
    w "你想和我一起去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_30037af1:

    # "Again, there is no intonation. Despite that, you get the feeling ,Wuldon isn't quite asking."
    "再说一遍，没有内向。尽管如此，你还是觉得，沃尔登并不问。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_c705e55f:

    # "Not that he'd harm you if you said no... you think. It's more that he understands how guilty you feel about the death of his friend."
    "他更明白你对他朋友的死有多内疚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_780c7d9d:

    # e "Y-yes. I think I would like to go and apologize to him."
    e "我想去跟他道歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_3d1f0554:

    # "Look at you. You can't even say his name properly."
    "看你，连他的名字都说不利索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_73775f55:

    # "Wuldon says nothing, only turning around and heading off, leaving you to run after him."
    "伍尔顿什么都没说，只是转过身去，然后离开，让你追他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_7c76fb77:

    # "In complete silence, the two of you make your way over to the cave where Vurro died."
    "你们一言不发地走向伏罗死去的那座洞穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_38b58bdf:

    # "When you get there, the front of the cave is nothing but a pile of rocks."
    "当你到达那里时洞穴前方就是一堆石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_4ff6003e:

    # "Less of the cave collapsed than you thought, but still enough to kill the poor werewolf inside."
    "洞穴的塌陷比你想的要少但还是足以杀死里面的可怜的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_686700be:

    # "Wuldon leads you forwards, onto the pile, towards a specific group he has covered with flowers."
    "伍尔顿带领你向前，向堆叠，向一个特定群体他已经覆盖花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_a18991a2:

    # "While at first you can't realize why he placed the flowers where he did, soon you see the small splotches of red underneath each of the stones with flowers on them."
    "一开始你还不明白为什么他把花放在哪里不久你就会看到每一块石头下边的红色小斑点上面都是鲜花。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_aca51e48:

    # e "He... he was much smaller than that. What happened?"
    e "他比那个小得多发生什么事了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_593d172e:

    # "The living werewolf next to you turns."
    "你身边的狼人正在转身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_36701f3a:

    # "You can see in his eyes that he should feel angry. He chooses to express nothing."
    "你从他的眼睛里可以看到他应该感到愤怒他选择什么都不说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_04ed4a7c:

    # w "Blood splatters far under immense weight."
    w "血液在巨大的重量下发芽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_59bfd850:

    # "Shivering, you take him at his word."
    "什弗林，你听他的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_f36cf925:

    # "The two of you stand there in silence, looking out at Vurro's remains."
    "你们默站在那里，望着伏罗的遗骸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_d3c99db1:

    # w "I'm going to kill Uffe."
    w "我要杀了乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_47a484ff:

    # "You turn to look at him in alarm, but Wuldon either doesn't notice, or doesn't care."
    "你转过身去惊慌地看着他但沃尔登要么没注意到要么不在乎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_285dca89:

    # w "I'm going to kill Uffe, and you're going to help."
    w "我要杀了乌菲而你要帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_01ea7c65:

    # "Again, not a question. You're about to ask why you would, when he speaks again."
    "再说一遍，不是问题，你正要问当他再次说话时你为什么会这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_1b226c32:

    # w "You're going to help me, because if you don't, the guilt will eat you whole. There will be nothing left of you but a husk of who you were."
    w "你会帮我的，因为如果你不这样做，内疚会把你整个吃掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_57b281c6:

    # "As if unaware of what he just said, he bends down to pick up one of the rocks with Vurro's blood on it."
    "仿佛不知道他刚才说什么他弯腰捡起一块石头上面有伏罗的血。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_6ed60ec3:

    # w "If I don't, I will be eaten whole."
    w "如果我不这样做，我会被吃掉整个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_55ae8c87:

    # "He did everything he could to prevent Vurro's death when he talked to you, but he still sees it as his fault."
    "他尽了一切力量防止伏罗死当他和你交谈时但他仍然认为这是他的错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_dbde6350:

    # "Then again, you could say much the same, and you're about to help someone kill another out of that same guilt."
    "再说一次，你也可以说同样的话，你将要帮助别人杀死另一个人，因为同样的内疚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_28755d7a:

    # "Considering that he left Vurro alone in that cave for what might have been years, it makes sense that he'd be beating himself up over it."
    "考虑到他离开伏罗独自在那个洞穴里可能已经几年了，这有道理，他会殴打自己了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_e5709eb5:

    # "...Not that actual guilt matters, considering you feel awful for killing Vurro despite thinking he was a wild animal when you did."
    "……不是真正的内疚，考虑到你对杀死伏罗感到可怕……。……尽管你当时认为他是个野兽……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_e00050f6:

    # "As you roll the thoughts around in your head, Wuldon takes the opportunity to do some thinking of his own."
    "当你脑海中充满思想时沃尔登利用这个机会为自己做一些思考。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_d488da95:

    # "He turns to you, bloody rock in hand, and asks you a question you wish you didn't know the answer to."
    "他向你转过身来手头的血腥石头问你一个问题你希望你不知道答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_d4872fde:

    # w "Do you know anybody who could tell me about Vurro's curse? How it came about, how it could be spread. Anything."
    w "你知道谁能告诉我伏罗的诅咒吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_02ba5a50:

    # "A nervous gulp later, and you're ready to answer."
    "等会你紧张地吐出来你就可以回答了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_e834f63c:

    # e "Yes, I know of one."
    e "是的，我知道一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_2214d1f8:

    # e "He's an alchemist that goes by the name of Haskell, he doesn't actually like ma-"
    e "他是个名叫哈斯克尔的炼金术师，只是他其实不喜欢我——"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_1c98ec8a:

    # "Wuldon cuts you off without warning."
    "伍尔顿没有警告就切断了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_af269cee:

    # w "Take me to him."
    w "带我去见他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_700b26c8:

    # "It's difficult to muster up the courage, but you feel you have to ask."
    "很难鼓起勇气但你觉得你必须问。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_1f51d4da:

    # e "Can I trust you not to hurt him?"
    e "我可以相信你不要伤害他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_382b6160:

    # "For the first time today, you see a flash of emotion in his eyes, one of pure anger and frustration."
    "今天，你第一次看到他眼中的一股情绪，一种纯粹的愤怒和沮丧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_6469b103:

    # w "I'm not going to hurt anybody that doesn't deserve it, unlike a certain someone."
    w "我不会伤害任何不值得伤害的人不像某个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_1037c2c9:

    # w "I am still the person I was, I am just ridding the world of a pest before I have the luxury of kindness."
    w "我仍然是原来的我，我只是在没有仁慈的奢侈品之前，在世界上摆脱了害虫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_3199e851:

    # "Done with tearing you apart verbally, Wuldon once more returns to a state of active calm."
    "伍尔顿再次回到了平静的状态伍尔顿的死期。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_112a16ff:

    # e "...Then yes, I'll take you to him."
    e "……那好，我带你去见他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_64854360:

    # e "I can't promise he'll help, but he should at least give something of value."
    e "我不能保证他会帮忙但他至少应该给点有价值的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_0a480e9c:

    # "Wuldon just nods at you, and gestures for you to get going."
    "沃尔登只是点头给你，和手势你可以走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_1778caf8:

    # "Reluctantly, you begin picking your way through the Dark Forest, and over to Haskell's house."
    "你不情不愿地穿过幽暗森林，朝哈斯克尔的住处走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_665d54a8:

    # "Once again, neither of you say a word. You could cut the tension with a knife, but any knife you knew of would snap at the haft in trying to do so."
    "再说一次，你们谁都别说一句话，你可以用刀子来切断紧张状态，但你们知道的刀子都会在刀杆上开枪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_8c2fb8fb:

    # "After what feels like years, you arrive at Haskell's. Never before having you wanted to see the red dragon this badly, if only to save you from this fresh hell."
    "过了这么多年，你来到哈斯克尔家之前你从未这么想看到红龙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_4343eefc:

    # e "Haskell? I'm here with a guest!"
    e "游戏对话是哈斯克尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_81c6e881:

    # "There is a moment of silence before you hear the sound of a tea kettle go off."
    "沉默片刻后，你听见茶壶烧开的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_7383d381:

    # "His tea thus having finished, you hear him pour some into a mug, before going and opening the door."
    "他喝完茶后，你听到他把茶倒进杯子里，然后走，打开门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_cadfbf9f:

    # h "What do you want."
    h "你想要什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_c1b94606:

    # e "...Help? If possible?"
    e "帮助？如果可能的话？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_06612c9e:

    # "The dragon glances at you suspiciously, before looking at Wuldon in much the same way."
    "龙对你的眼睛很可疑之前对沃尔登的眼神也差不多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_7b341a8e:

    # h "With what? I might consider it if it's not a potion."
    h "用什么我可能会考虑它如果它不是一个药剂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_d5c7bd07:

    # e "Well..."
    e "哈……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_fb59833d:

    # "You fidget nervously, not knowing how to broach the topic. Wuldon does it for you."
    "你紧张得发抖，不知道该如何讨论这个话题沃尔登为你做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_ce0601bf:

    # w "He killed a friend of mine who had gone insane under the effects of a curse. It was not his fault, but I want to know what happened and why."
    w "他杀了我的一个朋友，他因诅咒而疯癫，这不是他的错，但我要知道发生了什么事情和原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_759cceeb:

    # "Haskell pauses in taking a sip from his mug of tea."
    "哈斯克尔在喝茶喝一小口时暂停了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_94dd3a30:

    # h "I'm genuinely sorry to hear that."
    h "听到这消息我真的很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_d926e531:

    # "Considering this is the first time you've ever seen him look anything close to mournful or remorseful, you can only assume he's telling the truth."
    "考虑到这是你第一次看到他看上去像悲哀或悔恨一样你只能假设他说的是实话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_00b65fec:

    # w "Unimaginable horrors occur everyday. I would like to stop some of them from happening. Can you help tell me what happened."
    w "无法想象的恐怖每天都在发生，我想阻止其中某些恐怖发生。你能告诉我发生了什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_fa0b27ee:

    # "The mourning in Haskell's face has shifted to unease now, having picked up on Wuldon's emotionlessness, and pure determination."
    "哈斯克尔脸上的哀悼现在已经变成不安了已经感受到了伍尔顿的情绪和纯洁的意志。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_b2c7694d:

    # h "Alright. I don't know how much I can help, but I might as well give it a go."
    h "好吧。我不知道自己能帮上多少忙，但姑且试看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_de4a10ab:

    # w "Thank you."
    w "谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_81333f73:

    # "The werewolf moves to go into the hut, Haskell moving to let him go through."
    "狼人移动进入小屋哈斯克尔移动让他通过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_ee920248:

    # "You go to enter as well, reaching the door as Wuldon sits down and drops the bloody rock on the table with a dull thud."
    "你也可以进去到达门前伍尔顿坐下带着一股无聊的震动把血腥的石头扔在桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_3a0ab2df:

    # "He waits, motionless, for the two of you to sit down."
    "他无动于衷地等待着你们两个坐下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_b29e88a6:

    # "Haskell refuses to once he sees the stone."
    "哈斯克尔一看到石头就拒绝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_c84320a7:

    # h "I understand you are grieving, but that rock is going to have to be explained before I sit down."
    h "我知道你很悲伤但是那块石头在我坐下之前得先解释一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_1e88c246:

    # "Wuldon looks up at him with empty eyes."
    "伍尔顿用空洞的眼睛看着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_ece1936b:

    # w "This is one of the rocks from the cave that collapsed on Vurro."
    w "这是从洞穴里倒塌在伏罗的岩石之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_abb38d88:

    # w "It has his blood on it. I thought it would be useful to you in researching his curse."
    w "上面有他的血，我想这对你研究他的诅咒很有用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_5709fe82:

    # "Haskell moves over and picks up the rock, making sure to touch none of the blood."
    "哈斯克尔移动过来捡起岩石保证不碰任何血迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_9c43b6cc:

    # h "...You're right, it will help me. I would have preferred some warning, but I'll cut you some slack."
    h "你说得对，那会帮我的我更希望你警告我，但我会放你一马。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_10530a50:

    # h "I'm going to need you to give me some time before I can tell you what happened - or at least, some of the mechanisms of it."
    h "我需要你给我一些时间才能告诉你发生了什么至少是其中的一些机制。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_70188a49:

    # h "You can stick around, but I'd recommend coming back in a few days."
    h "你可以留下来，但我建议几天后回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_3dee8792:

    # "Wuldon makes no move to leave - reason enough for you to get out of here."
    "伍尔顿没有离开的理由…… 足够你离开这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_13bd75d2:

    # e "Alright, I'll see you then."
    e "好吧，到时见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_9198e3ad:

    # "Haskell immediately regrets saying that Wuldon could stay. It's not going to be a fun few days for the dragon."
    "哈斯克尔立即后悔说伍尔顿可以留下来这对龙来说不是好玩的几天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_After_Vurro_Death_61213500:

    # "You leave before Haskell can figure out a way to get you to stay."
    "在哈斯克尔想出办法让你留下来之前你就得离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_bd213ade:

    # "When you arrive at Wuldon's house, the werewolf is already outside with his khopesh at the ready."
    "当你到达伍尔顿家时狼人已经在外面和他一起欢呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_65d70ed8:

    # w "Slime country is up north."
    w "史莱姆之乡位于北部。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_d089f4d0:

    # w "I researched the two slimes we need to kill. They're both in the same area, in an arena."
    w "我研究过两个需要杀死的史莱姆它们都在同一区域，在竞技场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_edc2fc88:

    # "You give Wuldon a confused look."
    "你给伍尔顿一个模糊的外观。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_2ded2843:

    # e "An arena? Like, a ring you fight in for rewards?"
    e "竞技场？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_fb414d4e:

    # "The werewolf nods without betraying any emotion."
    "狼人点头时没有背叛任何情感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_1cf1f65c:

    # w "Slime country is named for the odd behaviors of its slimes. They often hide behind puzzles and traps, or engage with visitors in very specific circumstances."
    w "史莱姆之乡得名于史莱姆们古怪的行为。它们常藏在谜题和陷阱后面，或是在特定情况下与访客接触。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_90343d7b:

    # "Of all creatures, slimes seem the least likely to think, but if they like puzzles, then you have to wonder how accurate that is."
    "在所有生物中，史莱姆似乎最不可能去思考，但是如果他们喜欢谜题，那么你必须想知道这有多准确。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_50c189a5:

    # w "The arena only allows one fighter in at a time - you cannot fight twice in a row, somebody else has to challenge it after you."
    w "竞技场只允许一个拳手一次进入 - 你不能连续打两次，其他人必须先挑战它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_f7c88170:

    # w "That's the only reason I'm taking you with me."
    w "这就是我带你跟我走的唯一原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_37d959f7:

    # "Ouch. You didn't think it would be because he liked you, but it still hurts to see your worth reduced to that of literally any other person."
    "你没想到会是因为他喜欢你，但看到你的价值降为任何其他人的价值，还是很痛苦的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_35a51247:

    # e "What happens if two people go in at once?"
    e "如果两个人同时进去怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_21385290:

    # w "Nobody comes out. It is irrelevant."
    w "没人出来，这无关紧要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_ed4573e2:

    # "Seeing the explanation as complete, Wuldon begins marching off towards slime country."
    "沃尔登开始向史莱姆国进军伍尔顿的战争。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_a91e2770:

    # "The walk is once again, quiet. This gives you the perfect opportunity to hear how the sounds of the forest change as you go along."
    "这给了你一个完美的机会听到森林的声音如何改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_cffbfbe9:

    # "The Dark Forest is filled with the sounds of clicks and scrapes - moles and beetles being the prevalent species."
    "幽暗森林里到处都是咔哒声与刮擦声——鼹鼠和甲虫是这里最常见的生物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_e7dfd66b:

    # "As you move towards Slime Country, the sounds slowly shift to wet slopping noises, the animals of the area slowly being replaced by slimes."
    "你朝史莱姆之乡走去，周围的声音渐变成湿漉的啪嗒声；这里的动物也逐渐被史莱姆取代。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_d7263ea8:

    # "Even the trees start to look different, near-black evergreens gaining a bright green sheen, before changing to have thicker leaves and thinner branches."
    "就连树木也开始变得不同：近乎漆黑的常绿树木泛起鲜亮的绿光，随后长出更厚的叶片和更细的枝条。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_2568a2b9:

    # "The nettle underfoot changes to reflect that, eventually becoming a bright green muck that sucks on your boots as you trek through it."
    "为了反映这一点，织物尺下的变化，最终成为一个亮绿色的泥土吸在你的靴子上，当你走过它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_e91588fb:

    # "In the distance, you see marble pillars and gates standing or lying down, but always cracked and weathered."
    "距离很远的时候你看到大理石柱和门站着或躺着，但总是裂开和风化。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_534d89ec:

    # "The fact that you walk past them, ignoring them, makes you think these aren't what you're looking for."
    "你走过他们却无视他们让你觉得这不是你要找的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_978cd528:

    # "It's after the 8th such area that you reach your destination."
    "在第八区之后你才能到达目的地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_3e0ba7a2:

    # "A tall white circle of Marble, maybe 200 feet in diameter, stands in front of you."
    "一座高耸的白色大理石圆环立在你面前，直径大约两百尺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_5e3c995a:

    # "It is clearly constructed, with crenellations and small signatures in the marble confirming the theory you've slowly formed as you went through slime country."
    "它的构造是明确的，在大理石上，刻着小的符号证实了理论你慢形成。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_adcedbed:

    # "Interestingly, this is the only such structure you've seen that wasn't four-sided - perhaps due to a difference in purpose."
    "有趣的是，这是你所看到的唯一个没有四面派的结构也许是因为目的不同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_9215dc2c:

    # "Regardless of all that, here is where Wuldon turns around to look at you, hand tight around his weapon."
    "不管这一切，这里就是伍尔顿转身看你的地方紧握住他的武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_8957aeaa:

    # w "This is the arena. I will be going first to give you an idea of how this works, but I expect you to enter and fight after I finish."
    w "这是竞技场。我首先将首先给你们一个如何运作的想法，但我期望你进入和战斗在我完成后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_0a73a10d:

    # "So saying, the werewolf turns around and enters the structure through an absurdly large, imposing archway through the front."
    "所以说，狼人转过身穿过一个巨大的荒谬建筑进入了这个结构将拱门推向了前线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_0600a4a8:

    # "Once again, you have to wonder who could have built this. Only a giant would need a gate like this, but those are only myths and fables. At least... in your world."
    "你不得不再次怀疑谁能造出这个，只有巨人才需要这样的大门，但那些只是神话和神话，至少……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_14b66634:

    # "Whatever was here, the slimes have replaced them, a fact made abundantly clear as you enter after Wuldon."
    "无论这里是什么泥浆已经取代了它们这一事实在伍尔顿之后你进入时已经非常清楚了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_6770b93b:

    # "The circle forms a bowl on the inside - a bowl with a flat bottom of marble coated in ooze."
    "圆圈在里面形成一个碗里有一块平底大理石涂在水里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_3c3f72f7:

    # "The sides of the bowl are covered in stairs, where you can see hundreds of slimes... watching? The floor."
    "碗的两边都盖在楼梯上可以看到几百块史莱姆……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_e2db8781:

    # "You can see Wuldon making his way downstairs, and you make to follow, only to be interrupted by a slime with what seems to be a vest inside of it."
    "你可以看到沃尔登在楼下走着跟着你被史莱姆打断里面好像有背心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_834187d2:

    # "Most of the slimes here have something similar in them now that you think about it."
    "大部分的史莱姆都有类似的东西现在，你想看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_8a12cb8c:

    # "The one currently in front of you is shaking violently, agitated little bubbling sounds coming out of it every time you try to move forwards."
    "你眼前的那个人正在剧烈地颤抖发抖的微小的杂音发出来的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_db19f4a2:

    # "When you stop in front of it, it calms down and slowly slides towards the stairs."
    "当你停在前面的时候它会平静下来慢滑向楼梯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_c4a8d4d9:

    # "You start going up the side of the bowl, and look down at the slime - an odd thought to have, honestly - to see if it's still agitated."
    "你开始往碗边爬，然后往下看那些史莱姆，一种奇怪的想法，说实话，来看它是否还在激动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_fef2e0d7:

    # "It is standing where it was when it guided you to the stairs, much more calmly than previously."
    "它站在它引导你走上楼梯的地方比以前平静得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_57d1cea4:

    # "You find a seat as far away from the other slimes as possible, taking you rather high up, where you have a pretty good view of the arena floor."
    "你找到一个座位离其他史莱姆越远越好，把你抬高，在那里你对竞技场的地板可以看到相当不错的景色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_741d94f1:

    # "Just as long as you're willing to strain your eyes, that is."
    "只要你愿意紧张你的眼睛，这就是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_27568989:

    # "As you get settled, you take a look around and see what seem to be rows of weapons, all of them of rather high quality, if you were willing to look past the slime and rust covering them."
    "当你安顿下来，你四处看似乎有几排武器，都相当高品质，如果你愿意看过去史莱姆和生锈盖住它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_c53ef6a5:

    # "All of them seem to be quite well worn, a sign that whatever purpose they have comes quite often."
    "它们似乎都穿得相当好，一个迹象，表明无论它们有何种目的，它们经常出现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_0fd7f870:

    # "You're left to your own devices for longer than you expected. After what feels like ages of looking at an empty field, you see Wuldon and a slime emerge come out onto the field."
    "你被留在自己的设备上的时间比预期的要长。在看着空地的年代之后，你可以看到伍尔顿和一块史莱姆浮出水面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_2923b5aa:

    # "There is a sound coming from all around you, like someone is popping their knuckles repeatedly."
    "你周围传来声音好像有人反复敲响他们的指关节。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_e4ce936c:

    # "Looking for the source, you see the slimes in your area rapidly opening holes in themselves to create a vacuum, and then breaking them. Each time they do this, a pop is heard."
    "寻找源头时，你可以看到您所在区域的史莱姆迅速打开洞，制造真空，然后打破它们。每次他们这样做时，都会听到流行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_933e0698:

    # "This is only able to distract you for a moment, as your attention is grabbed incredibly quickly by the sight of Wuldon."
    "这只能让你分心一阵子伍尔顿的目光很快地吸引了你的注意力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_2afe8ca3:

    # "He's completely naked, stripped of everything but his khopesh."
    "他完全裸体，除了他的爱之外，什么都被剥光了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_a2b84ded:

    # "His stomach bounces slightly with every step he takes, if far less than it would had it been all fat, the muscle helping keep things compact."
    "他的胃在每一步后都稍有反弹，如果比它完全变胖时要小得多，肌肉会帮助保持紧凑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_e9a521e4:

    # "You can see a surprisingly short, if not small, package bouncing along beneath as well, a fat cock and balls swinging freely as he walks out onto the field."
    "你可以看到一个令人惊讶的短小，如果不是小的，包件在下面弹射，一只肥鸡和蛋在他走进田野时自由挥舞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_9812cb04:

    # "This, and his plump-but-firm ass are almost enough to distract you from the fact that Wuldon still looks vacant of anything but determination."
    "这一点，还有他的大屁股几乎足以分散你的注意力这一事实，伍尔顿仍然看起来空无一物，但决心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_dc2d702e:

    # "The pair walk out onto the field, and walk a short distance away from each other."
    "两人走到田野上彼此相距很近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_5e624976:

    # "Both figures are giant, the slime somehow managing to be slightly larger than Wuldon."
    "两个数字都是巨大的，史莱姆不知怎么的设法比沃尔登略大一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_e11998ff:

    # "If you fight something like that, you're pretty sure you're going to be in trouble."
    "如果你打这种仗你肯定会有麻烦的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_71efaf0e:

    # "A slime with a checkered shirt inside of it slides over to the edge of the arena."
    "史莱姆里面有一顶格子衬衫滑到竞技场边缘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_190ad861:

    # "It pops once, twice, and on the third pop, Wuldon and the slime explode into action."
    "它弹出一次，两次，第三弹出，沃尔登和史莱姆爆炸行动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_12c4c748:

    # "The fight is over in a flash."
    "战斗一瞬间结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_d5f46884:

    # "The slime was rushing forward one moment, and the next, Wuldon was on the other side of the arena, khopesh covered in slime, a slime core in his hand."
    "史莱姆在向前冲来下一瞬间伍尔顿站在竞技场的另一边粘着史莱姆的香草手里有史莱姆芯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_6c978b1f:

    # "Silence fills the arena, the pops of the other slimes stopping as the slime Wuldon fought dissipates, joining the ooze covering the floor."
    "静默填满了竞技场其他的史莱姆的流行停止了，因为史莱姆伍尔顿战斗消散，加入覆盖地板的粪便。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_c88e94e6:

    # w "I nominate [e] as the next participant."
    w "我提名[e]为下一位与会者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_e58578b7:

    # "With that, Wuldon jumps out of the pit, and walks up to where you're sitting, stunned."
    "伍尔顿从坑里跳出来走到你坐的地方惊呆了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_8ed2fc32:

    # w "You need to go down there and do your own fight."
    w "你需要下去并做你自己的战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_900c4e0c:

    # w "Clothes are banned - it's unfair to the slimes, and they won't fight you as long as you have them on."
    w "衣服是被禁止的 - 这是不公平的史莱姆，他们不会打你只要你有它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_a1b398bc:

    # e "Alright, well. Here goes nothing."
    e "好了，好了，这里什么都没有了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_83d830da:

    # "You take a nervous gulp, get up, and obediently begin to strip."
    "你神经紧张，站起来，听话，开始脱光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_1853c166:

    # "Once you are completely naked of even your accessories, you pick up your weapon, and dash down to where you saw Wuldon disappear."
    "一旦你完全脱光了连你的饰品都脱光了你就会拿起你的武器冲到你看见伍尔顿消失的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_a96a6977:

    # "You find yourself in a poorly lit room, bare of practically anything, except for Wuldon's clothes over in the corner."
    "你发现自己在一个不光亮的房间里，几乎什么也不穿，除了沃尔登的衣服在角落里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_5fb92b55:

    # "Wuldon's loincloth is at the top of the pile, the last thing he took off. A sudden urge overtakes you."
    "伍尔顿的腰衣在堆积物的顶端最后一件东西他走了突然的冲动超越了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_9a00f58f:

    # "Tentatively, as if afraid to be caught - which you are - you reach over for Wuldon's loincloth."
    "暂时来说，好像害怕被抓住一样，你就是这个样子，你为了伍尔顿的衣衫而去寻找。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_715edde2:

    # "The fabric hangs loosely between your fingers as you bring it up to your nose."
    "织物在你的手指之间松散地挂着当你把它抬到鼻子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_e1324c6d:

    # "It seems that the werewolf bathes fairly often, as the smell is not quite that strong, but you can definitely catch a whiff of earthy musk, likely from the walk over here."
    "狼人似乎经常洗澡，因为气味不那么强烈，但你绝对可以捕捉到一股土状的山雀，可能从这里的散步中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_4dab6776:

    # "The smell is intoxicating, and frustratingly thin, growing elusive every time you get close to being satisfied with it."
    "每次你接近满意的时候味道就越来越难闻了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_b789a106:

    # "He has the smell of a working man, a mix of sweat and musk coming together to create a rich scent."
    "他身上有工人的气味混合了汗水和香水聚集在一起创造出丰富多彩的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_20893a55:

    # "You put Wuldon's loincloth back where it was sooner than you'd like, knowing that you have to get out into the arena soon if you don't want people asking questions."
    "你把沃尔登的腰带放回你喜欢的地方早于你喜欢的地方知道你必须马上进入竞技场如果你不想别人问题的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_f681dcb3:

    # e "I'm better than that."
    e "我比这更好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_11d5be53:

    # e "Plus, Wuldon and I aren't even friends right now. I mean, I killed his best friend for god's sake."
    e "再说，我和沃尔登现在甚至都不是朋友我杀了他最好的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_0a88f4ca:

    # "You head out onto the field, where a slime is now waiting for you, emerging from a room much like your own."
    "你走到田野上，在那里，一个史莱姆正在等待着你，从一个非常像你自己的房间里出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_816baf6e:

    # "It is far larger than you. Larger even than Wuldon's opponent."
    "比你大得多甚至比沃尔登的对手还大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_ce788e03:

    # "The two of you meet in the middle before stepping back a few feet."
    "你们两个在中间碰头后退几步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_ec0355aa:

    # "Once again, the checker slime pops three times, starting the fight."
    "再一次，打牌的史莱姆弹三次，开始战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_5a81c8ce:

    # "You lay there, panting, after taking down the giant slime."
    "你躺在那里，喘气，在拿下巨大的史莱姆之后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_231b5ce9:

    # "Even if the slime didn't hurt you that much, the muck beneath you made every step that much harder."
    "即使史莱姆没有伤害你那么多你下面的污泥使每一步都更难。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_bc71b0c0:

    # "This isn't done, however. Wuldon is already climbing down for his round."
    "伍尔顿已经下山了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_6b9a5852:

    # "His face betrays nothing about how he may feel about how you won, but his cock definitely seems a bit bigger than before, if not hard."
    "他的脸没有背叛他如何看待你是如何赢的，但他的老二看起来一定比以前大一点，如果不是硬的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_4420fce5:

    # "You get up off the floor and back towards your seat."
    "你从地板上站起来回到座位上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_5d0bc5a1:

    # "You're given a canteen full of what looks like purple muck on your way up."
    "你上楼的时候给了你一个满的食堂里面装满了看起来像紫色泥浆的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_71969c3c:

    # "A gift from the slimes of the arena it seems."
    "似乎是竞技场上史莱姆的礼物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_fa14a895:

    # "You're too tired and thirsty to think twice, and you drink from it."
    "你太累了，太渴了不敢再思考了，你喝它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_0196a817:

    # "Health and Mana fully restored!"
    "健康与马纳完全恢复！"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_6d5bba3c:

    # "The concoction tastes surprisingly good."
    "调味品味道好得令人惊讶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_f8fa6ba9:

    # "It's like if someone mixed grape juice, milk, and honey together, and then made the unfortunate decision of turning it all into jello."
    "就好像有人混合了葡萄汁牛奶和蜂蜜然后做出不幸的决定把它变成果冻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_409d7d7f:

    # "Reinvigorated, you take a seat and watch Wuldon's match."
    "重新注入活力，你坐下来看沃尔登的比赛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_20b6327d:

    # "Or at least, you were going to, when you realize that Wuldon is already wiping his khopesh clean of his opponent."
    "或者至少，当你意识到伍尔顿已经清除了他的对手时，你本来打算这么做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_e68a388f:

    # "You get ready to head back down when another slime enters the ring to fight the werewolf."
    "当另一只史莱姆进入戒指与狼人战斗时你准备回去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_b2966772:

    # w "Waves. This will be time consuming."
    w "浪，这会耗费时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_2d95e5e2:

    # "You somehow hear Wuldon from all the way up here."
    "你从这里听到沃尔登的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_4c54ff70:

    # "Ultimately, however, you find that he's right."
    "但是最终，你发现他是对的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_f6b76422:

    # "However quickly he finishes off each individual enemy, it takes him a while to chunk through the twenty enemies that go to fight him."
    "无论他如何迅速地消灭每一个敌人，他需要一段时间才能打穿20个敌人来与他作战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_4acc3cdd:

    # "By the end, even he's exhausted."
    "到最后，甚至他都精疲力尽了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_6e584082:

    # "Once declared the victor, Wuldon walks out of the arena, and up to where you are, tagging you in."
    "伍尔顿曾宣布胜利者走出竞技场走到你现在的位置标记你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_2fcb9ca7:

    # w "It would be best if you didn't get what I did. It's rough work, and I'm not sure you'd make it."
    w "最好你别搞到我的所作所为工作很辛苦，我不确定你会不会成功。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_d41ef59e:

    # "You can't help but agree. Still, you're going to have to go and see what nasty surprise they have waiting for you."
    "你不得不同意，不过，你还是得去看他们等你的惊喜有多难看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_5bf8c76f:

    # "Little time is spent on the way down this time - you know full well where you're going."
    "这次在下山路上花费的时间很少- 你知道你要去的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_3901812f:

    # "As you emerge onto the field, you see a small slime."
    "当你浮出水面时，你会看到一小块史莱姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_b9e96d5f:

    # e "It's going to be waves isn't it."
    e "是波浪，不是波浪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_8c5a8d0a:

    # "The slime in front of you wiggles slightly in response. You couldn't tell what it said even if someone gave you three thousand gold."
    "你面前的史莱姆会轻地摇动反应。你不知道它说了什么，即使有人给了你3000金。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_efc8ce92:

    # "For now, let's just assume a yes."
    "现在，让我们假设是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_e8ee8174:

    # "This is going to be an endurance battle, where I'll want to come out as close to fresh as I can after each battle."
    "这将是一场耐力战，在那里，我想走出尽可能接近新鲜的战斗，每次战斗之后，我可以。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_0504e1e9:

    # "The lack of clothing means you have none of your items, so resource management is going to be tight, especially if there are twenty, like Wuldon had."
    "衣物缺乏意味着你没有你的物品所以资源管理会很紧张尤其是如果有20个，像沃尔登那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_8bfe1939:

    # "Nothing for it but to get in a fighting stance."
    "只会陷入战斗状态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_eae095b9:

    # "That wasn't that bad, especially now that you're getting used to the muck on the floor."
    "没那么糟尤其是现在你习惯了地板上的泥土。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_e9af671c:

    # "Here comes another one."
    "又来了一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_355d0f4b:

    # "You can definitely feel the fights wearing on you, but you have a lot of fight left. Send in the next one, let's get it over with."
    "你绝对能感觉到你身上的打斗，但你还有很多打斗。派下一个来，让我们来结束它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_ef801c26:

    # "One more."
    "再一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_9a947e2c:

    # e "Oh God, when will this end. Please tell me it's only five I have to beat."
    e "天啊，什么时候结束？"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_4c9d86aa:

    # "Oh no, it's more than five, what is it, ten?! Please don't be twenty like Wuldon had to deal with."
    "哦，不，超过5岁了，那是什么，10岁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_58555a5b:

    # "Each of these slimes has been identical to the last. It feels like you're trapped in a neverending hell."
    "感觉你被困在永无止境的地狱里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_086e4bdd:

    # "Whatever you did to get here, you're sorry. God, Wuldon, anything out there, please, help."
    "无论你做了什么，你都很抱歉上帝，沃尔登，任何外在的东西，拜托，救我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Begin_20406a55:

    # "You're covered in slime, though you can barely feel it. Whatever happens in the end, you'll at least have the resources you need."
    "不管最后发生什么，你至少拥有你需要的资源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_acd50ec8:

    # "You fall unconscious in front of one of the slimes."
    "你在一个史莱姆面前昏倒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_4a23ef87:

    # "They hit softly, but something about them tires you out when you fight them."
    "他们轻打击，但有些东西让你在和他们战斗时很疲惫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_ecdc1186:

    # "You wake up outside of the arena with an expressionless Wuldon in front of you."
    "你醒在竞技场外面前的无言无语的伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_389d668c:

    # w "You're a newcomer, so they'll let you pick up where you left off. Special treatment."
    w "你是新来的人，所以他们会让你继续你留下的东西，特殊待遇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_8a19d3de:

    # w "You can also leave and prepare a bit."
    w "您也可以离开并准备一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_0e291579:

    # "The flat look he gives you tells you what he thinks of that plan."
    "他给你的平面表情告诉你他对那个计划的看法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_c114841c:

    # e "I think I'll prepare."
    e "我想我会准备的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_13a07cd8:

    # "Wuldon tosses your clothes at you. He's still not wearing his."
    "伍尔顿把你的衣服扔到你身上他还没穿好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_8f421a07:

    # w "I'll be at the arena."
    w "我会在竞技场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Lose_08dc38ae:

    # "Within moments, he's back inside of the arena."
    "不久他就回到竞技场里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Recoup_2b5ab8a8:

    # "You're back at the slime arena."
    "你回到了史莱姆竞技场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Recoup_7f37c6cb:

    # "You don't know what you expected, but it wasn't a slowly wobbling slime at the entrance."
    "你不知道你期望什么，但这不是一个缓慢的杂乱的史莱姆在入口处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Recoup_27deb374:

    # "It tentatively reaches out for your hand. You let it grab you."
    "它暂时伸出手来抓你让它抓住你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Recoup_d804c005:

    # "The little thing begins to drag you into the arena, and down into the changing room."
    "小东西开始把你拖进竞技场拖进更衣室。"

translate schinese_rewrite Slimy_Fight_Recoup_607d9a50:

    # "Understanding its demands, you quickly strip once it leaves, and step into the arena's fighting grounds once more."
    "了解它的要求，一旦它离开，你很快地把它剥光，并再次踏入竞技场的战斗场地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_fca82051:

    # "You stand there, panting, your feet struggling to find a grip in the slime below."
    "你站在那里喘气尺站着挣扎着在下面的史莱姆里找根紧握。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_376d43ae:

    # "Waiting for the next slime has started to feel like an eternity."
    "等待下一个史莱姆开始感觉像一个永恒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_7246bb65:

    # "You stand in that eternity, taking in gulps of air as you slowly realize that nobody is coming."
    "你站在永恒中慢的意识到没有人会来却在空气中吞噬空气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_9ecaad07:

    # "The adrenaline rushes out of you, the desperate energy in your muscles giving out as you collapse onto the floor."
    "肾上腺素从你身上冲出来肌肉中绝望的能量随着你倒在地上而释放出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_d4923dfc:

    # "Whatever happens next, you'll never know. The world loses its color as you sink into a deep sleep."
    "无论接下来发生什么，你永远也不会知道当世界沉入沉睡时，它会失去颜色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_7a0fc6c0:

    # "You wake up to the feeling of your body being dragged on the forest floor by Wuldon."
    "你醒来时感觉你的身体被伍尔顿拖到森林里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_d9206cad:

    # "He had the decency to keep your head off the floor, as well as clothe and heal you, but your feet almost definitely have some bruising on them from this."
    "他有礼貌让你的头从地板上下来，以及衣服和治疗你，但你的尺几乎肯定有一些瘀伤从这一点上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_6fa34797:

    # "However undignified it is, you're too tired to complain, let alone walk, so you just stay quiet for the walk."
    "不论多么不光彩，你太累了抱怨，更别说走路了，所以你只是保持安静散步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_ba56ea45:

    # w "We got what we needed."
    w "我们得到了我们需要的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_90cdf998:

    # w "You were covered in one of the ingredients, and I collected one of them from the first slime I fought."
    w "你被其中一种成分覆盖我从我第一次战斗的史莱姆里收集了其中一种成分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_483c8b0a:

    # w "I'm taking you home so we can make the mixture and get ready for war."
    w "我带你回家，好让我们调配混合物，为战争做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_ff3ad089:

    # "You hate the certainty with which he speaks."
    "你讨厌他说话的确定性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_9eb55a52:

    # "While you'd love to get up and tell him you weren't going, the fact that you killed his best, and quite possibly only friend keeps you from doing so."
    "当你很想站起来告诉他你不去的时候你杀了他最好的人很可能只有朋友才能阻止你这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_5a6530fa:

    # "That, and you can't really say he's mistreated you."
    "你不能说他虐待你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_2e723651:

    # "The worst he's done has been this, and even then he went through the process of patching you up and getting everything on you, which had to be no small task."
    "他做的最糟糕的事情就是这个，即使那时他也经历了把你包扎好的过程把你身上的一切都记在你身上，这肯定不是一件小事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_cc426afd:

    # "So, you keep your mouth shut, and you let the werewolf take you where he wants."
    "所以，你闭上你的嘴，你让狼人带你到他想去的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_819930bf:

    # "At some point, you decide to get some rest again. Those fights left you more worn out than you've been in a long while."
    "你决定再休息一会打架让你比很久前更累。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_0bdd8746:

    # "The next time you open your eyes, you're seated at Wuldon's house."
    "下次你睁开眼睛的时候你就坐在伍尔顿家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_578e7de2:

    # "In front of you, there are three jars. One has a thimble of water mixed with dried blood, another is filled with a dimly glowing dark purple sludge, and the last has what looks like pureed vomit coated along the inside."
    "在你们面前有三罐。一个水夹着干血，另一个充斥着暗淡的光亮的黑紫色污泥，最后一个水壶里有看起来是纯净的呕吐物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_48ac1c39:

    # "How appetizing."
    "听起来真可口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_b81f73c0:

    # e "Are you there, Wuldon?"
    e "你在吗，沃尔登？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_5d4fea38:

    # "The werewolf comes in through the door, fresh vegetables in his hands."
    "狼人从门进来手里拿着新鲜蔬菜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_f650af64:

    # w "You're awake."
    w "你醒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_b1b0afb7:

    # w "You took long enough that I went out and gathered food for myself."
    w "你花了足够长的时间，我出去并为自己收集食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_63538fef:

    # "He sets down what you assume to be said food on a shelf, and moves over to the table."
    "他把你们所说的食物放在架子上然后移到桌子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_ebe57dcc:

    # w "Mix these for me. I would, but alchemy is one of the things I have no talent for."
    w "帮我把这些混为一谈吧，我会的，但是炼金术是我一无是处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_cd747e8b:

    # "Wuldon sits down in front of you to watch, as you gingerly reach out for the three jars."
    "伍尔顿坐在你面前观赏你切地伸出手来寻找三个罐子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_63711357:

    # "It really isn't a complicated process. All it consists of is pouring the contents of the other two jars into the one with Vurro's blood."
    "这其实不是一个复杂的过程。它所包括的只是把另外两个罐子的内装物 倒进一个有伏罗血的罐子里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_6baac445:

    # "The disgusting elements swirl together and become exponentially worse in the others presence."
    "恶心的元素聚集在一起而在其它的出现中变得非常糟糕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_4e7ae058:

    # "The vomit and sludge meld to become some form of bright brown, with yellow globs of... something, floating around in it."
    "呕吐物和淤泥焊化成某种明亮的棕色黄色的球状物漂浮在其中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_43ef0739:

    # "While those two combined instantly, it takes a bit for the blood to seep in, letting you watch as it moves up the jar in a horrid, slow wave."
    "当这两个瞬间合并时，血液渗入需要一点时间，让你看着它在一个可怕的慢波中向罐子上移动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_9d79a8aa:

    # "If the mixture was disgusting before, it is now offensive to one's very being."
    "如果混合物以前是恶心的现在对一个人的本性是冒犯的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_e6e0c10a:

    # "Aesthetically, it is beautiful, a light purple substance that shines like diamond in the light."
    "从美学上讲，它很美，一种浅紫质物质，像光中的钻石一样闪耀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_6fdb11f2:

    # "Despite that, every nerve in your body is screaming when you look at it."
    "尽管如此，你身上的每个神经都在尖叫当你看着它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_1492c2c1:

    # "Something about its very essence triggers a need for violence in you, the memory of a torture you never went through flooding your mind."
    "有关其本质的东西触发了对暴力的需求在你身上，记忆的酷刑你从来没有经历淹没你的脑海。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_d3ae98e9:

    # "You catch yourself and look away, panting."
    "你抓住自己，看远了，气喘吁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_b2dd8f05:

    # e "I'm pretty sure it works."
    e "我敢肯定它能奏效。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_e430d4d3:

    # "Being careful not to look at the mixture, you move to check on Wuldon."
    "小心点不要看混合物，你移动检查沃尔登。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_70528dfa:

    # "The werewolf appears to be transfixed by the liquid."
    "狼人似乎被液体粉碎了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_e5af37b9:

    # "He is not breathing hard like you were, nor is his body tensed."
    "他没有像你一样呼吸困难，他的身体也不紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_5a854078:

    # "He looks exactly the same as he has these past few days."
    "他长得和过去几天一模一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_7d03711f:

    # "You shiver thinking about what that might mean."
    "你总是在想那意味着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_bcee3ebc:

    # e "Wuldon, I think it works."
    e "沃尔登，我想它有效。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_de20bd56:

    # "He looks up at you slowly."
    "他慢地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_de069063:

    # w "Yes, it should do."
    w "是的，它应该这样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_e5cba69c:

    # w "Come back to me when you're ready to kill Uffe."
    w "等你准备好杀乌菲的时候回来找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_bfee29d8:

    # w "Everything on my end is ready. It is only a matter of the conditions being right for the occasion."
    w "我这边的一切都准备好了，只是时机成熟的条件问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_03738cf0:

    # "God, this sucks."
    "上帝，这太糟糕了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_ecc07e02:

    # e "Yeah, I will."
    e "是的，我会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_03f80d5d:

    # "There isn't anything more you can think to say."
    "没有什么可以说的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_0649e03e:

    # "Nor do you think Wuldon cares about what you could say right now."
    "你也不认为沃尔登在乎你现在能说什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Slime_Country_Curse_End_0923c301:

    # "All you can hope for is that the werewolf wakes up from whatever fugue he's in once he's gotten his revenge."
    "你所希望的就是狼人从他复仇后身上的迷惑中醒来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_7dc28936:

    # "Ready to start your adventure into the caves, you walk up to Wuldon's front door."
    "准备进入洞穴冒险走到伍尔顿的大门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_29fee1c1:

    # "Nobody spooked you on the way here this time. Either Wuldon was too busy for his antics, or your wariness kept him at bay."
    "伍尔顿忙得无法应付他的反动，或者你的警惕让他忍不住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d20eb0e8:

    # "You raise your fist to knock on the door, only for it to open just before your hand met the wood."
    "你举起拳头敲门只为了在你的手碰上木头之前打开门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_28ce91e1:

    # "Standing in front of you is Wuldon. The Big Blue Werewolf is looking down at you approvingly."
    "站在你面前的是沃尔登大蓝狼人正以认可的态度看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_66fc069d:

    # w "Looking good, little one."
    w "看起来不错，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_ff2e8913:

    # "There's a small smirk on his face."
    "他脸上有个小笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_ff6302c8:

    # w "It won't help you where we're going, but I certainly don't mind."
    w "我们要去的地方帮不了你但我当然不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_dfc43281:

    # "You raise an eyebrow at that."
    "你对此提高眉毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_103c0c23:

    # e "Aren't you worried I'll get hurt or something?"
    e "你不担心我会受伤吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_c618c180:

    # "A merry glint sparkles in Wuldon's eye, as he leans against the doorframe."
    "温登眼中闪发光的光芒紧靠着门框。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_c4fe5297:

    # w "I thought you felt safe around me?"
    w "我以为你在我身边很安全？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_cdc72357:

    # "You take a nervous gulp, working up the courage to continue this."
    "你神经紧张鼓起勇气继续这样下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_5e9dc91e:

    # e "Are you saying you'll protect me?"
    e "你是说你会保护我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_371bddf6:

    # "Wuldon reaches out, cupping your face slightly. You don't know when it happened, but he's suddenly far closer, looming over you."
    "你不知道是什么时候发生的，但他突然更接近了，在你身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_17ae38fb:

    # w "I promised, didn't I?"
    w "我答应了，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_cacd5017:

    # "You move to close the gap between the two of you, only for a loud coughing noise to come from behind you."
    "你移动缩小差距你们两个之间，仅因为响亮的咳嗽噪音从你身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_c923772f:

    # v "Is that [e]? I can't tell, because a certain someone is blocking the door."
    v "那是[e]吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_7e5452e4:

    # "Wuldon immediately turns around and steps out of the way, but not before giving Vurro a look of amused skepticism."
    "沃尔登立即转身离开而不是在给伏罗展示出令人愉快的怀疑论之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_4a6c82ff:

    # "As your eyes move over to Vurro, you see what he's wearing. A leather shirt and pants, armbands, and of course:"
    "当你的眼睛移到伏罗，你可以看到他穿什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_11f8c1cf:

    # "A green cape like Wuldon's."
    "像伍尔顿的绿色斗篷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b25aadea:

    # "There also appears to be some odd buckle on his head, but whatever it is is unknown to you."
    "他头上似乎还有个奇怪的扣子但不管是什么，你都不认识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_bbfe0489:

    # e "Could you not tell it was me? Wuldon always seems to be able to tell."
    e "你看不出来是我干的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_bb22ded8:

    # v "I don't know your scent and sounds as well, but yes, I could tell. I just wanted Wuldon to get out of the doorway."
    v "我不知道你的气味和声音但我看得出来我只是想让沃尔登离开门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_ff85fad2:

    # e "...Alright. Well, I'm here now."
    e "……好吧。总之，我现在已经在这儿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_55890200:

    # v "Yes, you are! Ready to head out?"
    v "是的，你就是！准备好出发了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_c5e7c72b:

    # "You check over your inventory one last time."
    "你最后一次检查你的库存。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_e75c5940:

    # e "I think I am, yes."
    e "我想我是，是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d05c8a13:

    # v "Good. Now, let's get out there."
    v "好。现在，让我们出去吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_83423406:

    # "Vurro points at a bag over on the right side of the room."
    "伏罗指向房间右侧的一个袋子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d35318eb:

    # "You hadn't noticed it previously, but Vurro and Wuldon have their own bags near them - on them, in the case of Vurro."
    "你之前没注意到,但是伏罗和伍尔顿在他们身边有他们自己的包-- 在伏罗的情况中,他们身上有他们自己的包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_3225a92c:

    # e "Caving supplies I assume?"
    e "我猜是进洞穴的补给吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_71db0302:

    # w "About a week's worth of food and water, should you ration it properly, two buckets, a pickaxe, and a flint and steel with tiny sticks."
    w "大约一个星期的粮食和水，如果你给它配给适当的话，两桶，一只小蜡烛，和一块火石和钢铁和小棍子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_49827d47:

    # "You look at Wuldon curiously."
    "你好奇地看伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_0dd14581:

    # e "This isn't enough wood for a fire. Why the firestarter's kit then?"
    e "这木柴不够火烧，为什么放火？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_7a865265:

    # w "Darkfog. There's are invisible, odorless zones in the mines sometimes."
    w "暗雾。矿井里有时会出现看不见、也没有气味的区域。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_3bb737cb:

    # w "If you're not careful, you'll drown in them."
    w "如果你不小心，你会淹死在它们中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_8f12a238:

    # "You wait for further explanation, but you get none out of Wuldon."
    "你等待进一步的解释，但你没有得到任何从沃尔登。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_eda05173:

    # v "The only way to get rid of darkfog, at least that we know of, is to burn it."
    v "唯一能除掉黑咖啡的方法就是烧掉它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_e5a1bc6d:

    # e "So, the mines will not only have dangerous monsters, but invisible kill zones."
    e "因此，地雷不仅有危险的怪物，而且有隐形的杀伤区。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_e545624c:

    # "Vurro gives you a nod."
    "伏罗点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_8277c3fe:

    # v "You can always back out if you want."
    v "如果你想的话随时可以退缩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_768ecdb9:

    # "You shake your head, determined to see your promise to its completion."
    "你摇头下定决心看到你的承诺完成它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_344411af:

    # e "No. I'll be heading in there. I can hold my breath for a long time anyways, so I'll be fine."
    e "不，我要去那，我可以屏气很久，没事的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_e01dad26:

    # w "I'll be the one scouting for darkfog anyways. You just worry about the monsters."
    w "反正我也会是暗影的侦察员你只要担心那些怪物就行了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_0ff2ff92:

    # "You head over to pick up your bag, hefting the surprisingly heavy load onto your back."
    "你走过去捡起包，把那份出人意料的沉重负担扛到背上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_f65038ad:

    # e "Well, I'll hold you to that. Monsters I can handle just fine."
    e "好吧，我会坚持住的怪物我可以应付的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_38a8f3c6:

    # "Both werewolves give you a nod, readying their packs and heading out the door as they see you get ready."
    "两个狼人给你点头准备他们的包并冲出门他们看到你准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_2b3767a4:

    # w "I've already scouted ahead a bit, so we have an entrance in mind."
    w "我已经先探过一点了所以我们想着一个入口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_794f8586:

    # w "It's good that you can hold your breath for a long time."
    w "你能屏住呼吸很长时间是好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_a64b42b9:

    # e "What do you mean by that?"
    e "你是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_a3b379cb:

    # "Wuldon just picks up the pace as Vurro snickers from his spot next to you."
    "伍尔顿只是从你旁边的伏罗店里抽取到他家的点子时加快了速度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b37a7614:

    # e "Hey-"
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_56840d73:

    # "You bite your tongue trying to talk and move at this pace, causing Wuldon to slow down slightly."
    "你咬舌头试图说话和移动以这种速度，导致伍尔顿稍微放慢下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_6c82f74e:

    # v "It's alright, we promise it's nothing dangerous. You'll see when we get there."
    v "没事的，我们保证没什么危险等我们到了就知道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_01e5e2e3:

    # e "I'm scared of what 'not dangerous' means to you two after darkfog, but alright."
    e "我害怕\"不危险\"对你们来说意味着什么黑暗后，但没关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b2ffbf5f:

    # e "How {i}did{/i} you two start going out on trips like this, anyways?"
    e "你们俩到底是{i}怎么{/i}开始像这样结伴出行的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_6055f8c9:

    # v "You mean exploring new places and scouting out their worth for the tribe?"
    v "你是说探索新地方并挖掘他们对于部落的价值？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_ff4353bf:

    # "Not quite how you'd put it, but you still give Vurro a nod. It seems Wuldon's nonverbality is starting to rub off on you."
    "你还是点头给伏罗看 沃尔登的无言无语正开始伤害你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_1211f724:

    # "Not the only thing of Wuldon's you want rubbing off on you-"
    "你不是唯一想要被伍尔顿的摩擦的东西"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_175fa2f0:

    # "{i}THUMP{/i}. Vurro's hand smacks into the back of your head mercilessly."
    "{i}砰{/i}。伏罗毫不留情地一巴掌拍在你的后脑勺上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_a68b2a51:

    # v "Do you want your answer, or do you want to daydream about that big lug over there."
    v "你想要你的答案，还是你想白日梦关于那个大傻瓜在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_299b9948:

    # "In the corner of your vision, you think you see the distant werewolf's ear twitch. You can't be sure, as he makes no other sign of having heard."
    "在你的视线的角落里，你认为你看到了远方的狼人的耳电动。你不能肯定，因为他没有听到其他声音的迹象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_20499361:

    # e "Ow, ow. I want my answer. Please don't hit me like that again."
    e "我要我的答案，求你别再打我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_63ab9708:

    # "Vurro's eyes soften."
    "伏罗的眼睛柔软。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_dabc4b5f:

    # v "Sorry, your skull isn't as thick as I thought it was. I'm used to Wuldon."
    v "抱歉，你的头骨没我想的那么厚我习惯了伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_ea60da14:

    # v "We can talk about your daydreams later, anyways."
    v "我们以后再谈你的白日梦吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_ec9b5b19:

    # e "I... don't know if we should, but please, carry on."
    e "我不知道我们是否应该，但请继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_8ed05974:

    # v "Alright."
    v "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_fb75194d:

    # v "We started out when we were very young. Wuldon was never a particularly sociable werewolf, always going off on his own, listening to the peace and quiet of the forest..."
    v "伍尔顿从小就开始了狼人从来就不是特别可亲的狼人总是自己走出去倾听森林的宁静和宁静……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_249aeaed:

    # v "You can imagine, he was not particularly popular with most of the other werewolves."
    v "你可以想象，他并不特别受其他狼人欢迎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_8cf3ee96:

    # v "Still, one day I decided to follow him into the less visited parts of the woods."
    v "但有一天我决定跟着他进入树林中受访人数较少的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_fcb067b4:

    # "Vurro smiles, remembering the halcyon days of youth."
    "华罗的微笑回忆着青春的悠久时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d2322e67:

    # v "It was pretty boring, I remember. The little blue werewolf walked slowly, drinking in the atmosphere."
    v "我记得那很无聊，小蓝狼人慢走来，在大气中喝酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_8814f776:

    # v "After hours of seemingly aimless wandering, he brought me over to a creek, grabbing a stick with string and calling up to me."
    v "经过几个小时似乎无目的游荡他把我带到小溪边拿着一根绳子的棍子呼唤我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_8c3f3839:

    # v "That was how we first became friends. Fishing together by the creek."
    v "我们就是这样成为朋友的一起在小溪边钓鱼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_0dc477a3:

    # v "Eventually I became bored of that spot, and asked him if he wanted to find another, which led us to a clearing of beautiful flowers..."
    v "最终我厌倦了那个地方，问他是否想找另一个，从而导致我们清空了美丽的花朵……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_836cca1c:

    # v "Each month, we'd find something new, and enjoy it to our heart's content."
    v "每个月，我们都会找到新的东西，并且享受它，让我们的心满意足。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_794a06df:

    # e "Did you have a favorite?"
    e "你有最喜欢的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d9d16259:

    # "Vurro gives you a surprised look."
    "伏罗让你惊讶地看了一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_2584e36d:

    # v "Well, yes! I loved caves the most. They were like little worlds, each one different in its atmosphere, smells, and inhabitants."
    v "是的，我最喜欢洞穴，就像小世界一样，空气、气味和居民都不同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_455c2f41:

    # e "What about Wuldon?"
    e "沃尔登呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_c9e47f92:

    # "This time, Vurro gives you a cheeky grin."
    "这一次，伏罗朝你露出一抹顽皮的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_115760c2:

    # v "The creek, clearly."
    v "显然，小溪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_56c638a7:

    # v "He spent most of his time without me fishing. How else do you think he'd get a gut like that?"
    v "他大部分时间都不让我钓鱼不然你还想他怎么得到这样的直觉？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_e41f44e2:

    # "Vurro lowers his voice conspiratorially."
    "伏罗的嗓音低调了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_5b0b4b9f:

    # v "If you ever want the perfect evening with him, go fishing and bring the fish back to his house to cook."
    v "如果你想和他共度一个完美的夜晚去钓鱼然后把鱼带回他家做饭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_cf64bc0e:

    # "You raise an eyebrow at him."
    "你对他眉目不一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_e052f641:

    # e "Any reason you're giving me this advice?"
    e "你给我这个建议有什么理由吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_dfd549e8:

    # "Vurro shrugs."
    "伏罗耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d58bcfc7:

    # v "I want the best for my friend. I think he's happier with you around."
    v "我想为我的朋友好点我想他跟你在一起会更快乐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_bf9b29d4:

    # v "...especially since I won't be around."
    v "特别是因为我不在身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_346e56f3:

    # "You both grow solemn, briefly, before Vurro breaks the mood by shoving you teasingly."
    "你们两个都变得庄严，简短的，在伏罗打破心情之前通过挑逗你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_12fcd950:

    # v "Though I think your relationship with him is going to be a bit different than ours was."
    v "虽然我觉得你和他的关系会和我们的关系有点不同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_f2a1b9b0:

    # "The wink Vurro gives you is enough to turn you cherry red. It's time to change the subject."
    "伏罗给你的眼珠足够让你变红了是时候换话题了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_de510b6c:

    # "You clear your throat slightly to clear away that last awkward statement."
    "你稍微清喉咙来清除最后的尴尬言论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d1c7dd37:

    # e "Still, you continued it even into adulthood?"
    e "你连成年都坚持到成年吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_1c773326:

    # v "Well, yes, but for different reasons."
    v "嗯，是的，但有不同的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d2473615:

    # v "As children, we explored to find things for ourselves. Later, we searched for ways to make our tribe greater without the need for stealing or conquest."
    v "儿童时代，我们探索了如何为自己找到东西。后来，我们寻求办法，使我们的部落更加强大，而无需偷窃或征服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_afa3894c:

    # e "And your brother? What would he do?"
    e "你弟会怎么做？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_2554f36d:

    # "Vurro gives you a shrug."
    "伏罗给了你一记号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_4719034e:

    # v "Hunt and train, mostly. There's a reason he's stronger than me, you know."
    v "猎杀和火车，大部分情况下，他比我强是有原因的，你知道的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_cac23091:

    # e "And you never tried to catch up?"
    e "你从来没有试图赶上？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_a5813c93:

    # v "Why bother? I thought that he'd leave me alone as long as I left him alone. By the time I learned better, it was too late."
    v "我以为只要我离开他，他就会离开我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_1088da20:

    # e "I can't blame you. Being paranoid is unpleasant. I'd rather die having lived a happy life, than live afraid of the beast in the dark."
    e "我宁死也宁可过幸福的生活也不愿在黑暗中害怕野兽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d85863a9:

    # e "Maybe that's why I'm here though. Can't say I regret meeting everyone all that much."
    e "也许这就是我来这里的原因不能说我后悔和大家见面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_afb733b5:

    # v "Would you go back if you could?"
    v "如果可以，你会回去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b82df775:

    # e "Depends. Would I be able to visit everyone here afterwards?"
    e "要看情况，之后我能不能去拜访这里的所有人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_58c5812b:

    # "Vurro takes a few seconds to think."
    "伏罗需要几秒钟思考。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d5d31a76:

    # v "No. That would be too easy. Life rarely works to our benefit."
    v "不那太容易了生活很少对我们有利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_80a6cb7e:

    # "You sigh. It's a melancholy sort of question you've been asked."
    "你叹气了，这是你被问到的忧郁的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_98bcef37:

    # e "I... I don't know right now."
    e "我现在不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_68493827:

    # e "Maybe I'll be able to decide someday... maybe I'll have to decide."
    e "也许我有一天能决定…… 也许我必须决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_76e54586:

    # e "I don't like thinking about it. Everyone here is important, but so are some of the folks back home, even if I can't remember them that clearly."
    e "我不喜欢想，这里的每个人都很重要，但家里的一些人也一样，即使我记不清他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_8abda52b:

    # v "Well, as long as it's your decision, I'm sure you'll make the right one in the end."
    v "好吧，只要这是你的决定，我敢肯定，你会做正确的一个在最后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_0d4bcebe:

    # e "It'll all be easier once I know how my friend is doing. Until then, there's not really much point in making up my mind."
    e "一旦我知道我朋友的情况就会变得简单些在那之前，我没什么意义下定决心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_89206bfe:

    # "Looking to your right, you see Vurro staring wistfully up at the sky, beams of light filtering down through the leaves of the canopy."
    "看着你的右面，你可以看到伏罗一直盯着天空，光束通过树冠的叶子过滤下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_9f0f9afb:

    # v "It's a bit like how I feel about dying."
    v "这有点像我对死亡的感觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_97dec0fc:

    # "That sentence hits you like a punch to the gut."
    "那句子打到你的肠子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_93a5e893:

    # e "H-how so?"
    e "H -怎么玩？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_7e4ceb60:

    # "Vurro shakes his head, snapping himself back to reality to look over to you."
    "伏罗摇头回到现实看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b7d2480a:

    # v "Sorry, I shouldn't have said that. To answer your question, though... I don't really mind dying."
    v "抱歉，我不该这么说，但回答你的问题……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_f018a6d1:

    # v "It's the people I'll leave behind that I'm worried about."
    v "我担心的是我留下的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_36bcdadd:

    # v "I want to do all of this before I die so that I can know for sure that Wuldon and the tribe will be fine."
    v "我想在死前做这一切这样我就能确定沃尔登和部落会没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_f49218bb:

    # v "It's alright for things to be rough for them for a while, but what I need to know is that they'll survive, and someday prosper."
    v "暂时对他们来说，事情是艰难的，这是正常的，但我需要知道的是，它们会生存下来，并且有一天会繁荣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_5bf4d42e:

    # "The two of you mull over what's been said, walking together, hearing only the sound of leaves crunched underfoot."
    "你们两个为所说的话吵闹一起走着听着树叶的响声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_a0774363:

    # "Wuldon has gone far ahead of the two of you, in an effort to give you true privacy."
    "伍尔顿已经远领先于你们两个试图给你们真正的隐私。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_a3abd7fc:

    # "It's good to see he trusts you enough to leave you alone with Vurro."
    "很高兴他信任你让你和伏罗单独相处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_e275b16b:

    # v "...For that reason, I'd like to ask if you could make sur-"
    v "……因此，我想问你能不能……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b8adb57b:

    # w "We're at the entrance you were worried about, Little One."
    w "我们在你担心的入口小一号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_4010a180:

    # "Unfortunately, Wuldon's attempts to give you privacy also meant that he didn't know when not to interrupt."
    "不幸的是，沃尔登试图给你隐私也意味着他不知道什么时候不打断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_42fa2391:

    # "Vurro sighs, looking over to you helplessly."
    "伏罗叹息，无助地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_9d859ed8:

    # v "I'll talk to you about it later. Maybe when we go over your daydreams."
    v "晚点再跟你谈也许等我们翻你的白日梦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_f323c8a6:

    # "He says that last part with a wink, as if it did anything to hide the melancholy still dancing behind his eyes."
    "他说最后那部分是用眨眼就像它做了什么隐藏忧郁的仍然在他眼皮底下跳舞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_6daef06e:

    # v "Let's get over there before he gets worried."
    v "让我们在他担心之前过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d657eda2:

    # "Vurro starts running, leaving you no recourse but to chase after."
    "伏罗开始奔跑 让你没有追索权 只能追逐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_a0760ce2:

    # "You find the two of them by a small lake, talking amiably as you arrive panting. There's a familiar looking mountain behind them."
    "你在一个小湖边发现他们俩，说话很亲切，就像你气喘吁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_12d531d6:

    # e "Why did you go so far ahead of us? That was almost seven minutes of running!"
    e "跑得快七分钟了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_f90bb5a8:

    # "Wuldon is unphased by your whining."
    "伍尔顿没有被你的抱怨影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_018e81d8:

    # w "You two were being annoyingly loud. I just wanted some peace and quiet while I walked."
    w "你们两个吵得要命我只想在散步时安静点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_a1b470a5:

    # "Vurro jabs Wuldon in the side with his elbow."
    "伏罗用手肘捅了捅伍尔顿的侧腹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_00c22c20:

    # v "I think I remember a certain someone saying they missed talking to me in their journal."
    v "我记得有个人说他们错过了在日记里跟我说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_51784723:

    # "Wuldon grimaces, giving the two of you an exasperated look."
    "温登的严酷的景象让你们俩一副激动人心的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_cd0a0853:

    # w "I missed what you'd say. I didn't miss how you'd scare away everything within five miles every time you opened your mouth."
    w "我错过了你说的话我错过了你每次张开嘴5英里内都吓跑所有东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_be1279d0:

    # "Vurro laughs at Wuldon."
    "伏罗嘲笑伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_1cf1c6e7:

    # v "Yes, yes. Whatever you say, alpha."
    v "是的，是的，随你怎么说，阿尔法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_bbe2f128:

    # "Wuldon picks up Vurro, and tosses him into the lake unceremoniously."
    "伍尔顿抓起伏罗，把他丢进湖里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d16c2dd7:

    # w "Well, your alpha says get your ass in the cave."
    w "你的阿尔法说让你滚进洞穴去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_f98f9338:

    # "You're almost certain Vurro didn't hear him."
    "你几乎确定伏罗没听到他说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_590ed4e0:

    # "It's also worrying that Vurro hasn't come up from underwater."
    "也让人担心的是伏罗没有从水下上来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_c04d379b:

    # "The two of you wait by the water's edge for two minutes. Wuldon is completely calm, as if his friend {i}weren't{/i} drowning right now."
    "你们在水边等了两分钟。伍尔顿镇定自若，仿佛他的朋友此刻{i}并未{/i}溺水一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_73567fd1:

    # "While you trusted in his calm expression for a while, the extreme length of time Vurro had spent underwater was beginning to make you antsy."
    "虽然你信任他的冷静表达一段时间，极长的时间伏罗在水下度过，开始让你的厌烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_c30fc3e0:

    # e "Should we not go in after him?"
    e "难道我们不应该在他之后进去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_342117b9:

    # "Wuldon looks at you, slightly bemused."
    "伍尔顿看着你，有点迷惑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_53238fdb:

    # w "Well, if you want to help him scout the cave, be my guest."
    w "如果你想帮他探洞请便。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_fc705569:

    # e "The cave? But-"
    e "洞穴？但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_efe1a4ee:

    # e "I understand you're implying there's a tunnel into the cave through here, but I explored most of the cave, and found it to be almost completely dry!"
    e "我知道你的意思是这里有个隧道通往洞穴但我探究了大部分洞穴发现洞穴几乎完全干涸了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_d63d46d4:

    # "Wuldon nods."
    "伍尔顿点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_27741667:

    # w "Yes. We never excavated the part of the cave this connects to. It's a good thing we didn't, or else we'd be facing an even larger collapse in all likelihood."
    w "是的，我们从来没有挖掘过洞穴中与它相连的部分。这是件好事，我们没有，否则我们很可能要面临更大的崩溃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_63c011e4:

    # "You shake your head, simultaneously impressed and frustrated by how easily Wuldon shrugs off the danger in this."
    "你摇头，同时印象深刻沮丧的，因为伍尔顿轻而易举地冲出危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_1e695567:

    # e "I'll trust the two of you on this one. If I start getting short of breath... I'll come back here."
    e "我信任你们两个，如果我开始呼吸不足……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b7e4691b:

    # e "I don't want to run out of breath."
    e "我不想喘不过气来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_5dd91f06:

    # "The blue werewolf looks faintly bemused, if also approving."
    "蓝色狼人脸上带着淡的困惑，却似乎颇为赞同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_4996f244:

    # w "Making an air vent is part of why we're here. I'm glad you thought of it before diving in though."
    w "造空口是我们来这里的原因之一很高兴你在潜入之前想到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_158b6739:

    # w "Speaking of..."
    w "对了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_26808d90:

    # w "You should be getting in there right about now."
    w "你应该马上进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_e5e27c94:

    # "He gestures towards the water."
    "他对水的姿态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_27e19819:

    # e "Why don't you go in first?"
    e "你为什么不先进去呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b9434bbf:

    # w "I want to make sure nobody follows us in, or anything like that."
    w "我想确保没人跟着我们进去或类似的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_22e8133c:

    # e "Alright. Good luck!"
    e "好吧。祝你好运！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_2e76aeb4:

    # "Wuldon dips his head in acknowledgement, turning away to look at the treeline."
    "伍尔顿低头承认，转身看树枝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_c21dc0b0:

    # "Getting the message, you dive into the refreshing waters of the lake."
    "收到消息后，你潜入湖中清新水域。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_f3086482:

    # "Looking down, you spot a dark cave a few feet beneath you."
    "往下看，你发现一个暗洞在你尺下几尺处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_fe231ba4:

    # "You swim towards it, passing through and into a long tunnel. At its end, you see a faint glimmer of light above you. Deciding you've reached the spot, you swim up, and into the cave."
    "你游向它，穿过一个漫长的隧道，游向它，穿过它，进入一个漫长的隧道。在它的尽头，你可以看到一线微光，微的光线在你的上方。决定你到达了那个地方，你游向了那里，游向了洞穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_93826809:

    # "Wuldon picks you up, holding you in his arms in a princess carry."
    "伍尔顿把你抱起来把你抱在公主的怀抱里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_9a29bc6e:

    # "He holds you close for a moment, a wide grin on his face."
    "他把你紧抱紧一阵子笑得他脸上满是笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b585ad0e:

    # e "I could get used to th-"
    e "我可以习惯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_ada74866:

    # "In the blink of an eye, you find yourself above the treeline, looking down at a laughing werewolf."
    "眼一眨你就会发现自己在树上俯视着一个笑着的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_5f8159e8:

    # w "Good luck down there! I'll be with you in just a second!"
    w "祝你好运，我马上来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_1f2771cc:

    # "You plummet down into the cool waters of the lake, flailing around briefly in confusion."
    "你冲进湖里的冰冷水域短暂的迷茫地晃来晃去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_dbf81a90:

    # "While you could go back up and scold Wuldon, it's probably just better to look for the entrance."
    "当你可以回去和冷酷的沃尔登，它可能只是更好寻找入口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_b2826bba:

    # "He said he'd be with you soon, so it'll be fine regardless. The big guy seemed to be looking for something in the treeline, based off of the last glimpse you caught before you hit the water."
    "他说他会很快跟你在一起所以不管怎样都会没事的那个大块头似乎在找树上的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_70e86e1e:

    # "Shaking your head, you look down and spot a dark cave a few feet down."
    "摇头，往下看发现一个深洞几尺下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Cavern_93a83c42:

    # "You head down and in, passing into a long tunnel. At its end, you see a faint glimmer of light above you. Deciding you've reached the spot, you swim up, and into the cave."
    "你往下走，进入一个漫长的隧道。在隧道的尽头，你可以看到一线微光，微的光线在你上面。决定你到达了那个地方，你游了起来，进入了洞穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_a21acc2a:

    # "Coming back to Wuldon's house, you see the werewolf on his doorstep."
    "回到沃尔登家时你看到他家门口的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_4891f1f1:

    # "He's shaking his head at you, telling you that it's not time yet."
    "他在对你摇头告诉你现在还不是时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_63283b18:

    # "That, or he's making fun of you for being too loud again."
    "要么他取笑你又大声了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_98f92f80:

    # "It's probably both."
    "可能是两者兼有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_7e44073e:

    # "Getting the message, you head back."
    "收到留言后，你往后退。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_eb14d8a7:

    # "He's smiling at you. It seems he's quite happy to see you."
    "他在笑你，看来他很高兴见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_90c7d72b:

    # w "Not yet, little one - Vurro still needs some more time."
    w "还没有，小伏罗还需要一些时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_72fa0ede:

    # e "I understand. I'll see you soon!"
    e "我理解，很快再见！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_5c72f0e6:

    # "Wuldon is once again pleased by this."
    "沃尔登再次对此感到高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_15559c1e:

    # w "I look forward to it. Stay safe."
    w "我期待着它。保持安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_442be9ee:

    # e "You too!"
    e "你也是！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_26f37575:

    # "All you get in response is a self-confident smirk. Fair enough."
    "你只得到自信的笑容相当公平。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Check_Vurro_21e929db:

    # "Once again, he watches you until you disappear from sight."
    "他再次看着你直到你消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e0db7757:

    # "Wuldon guides you into the house, bringing you to a tiny drawer, which he grabs a mortar and pestle from."
    "伍尔顿带你进屋带你到一个小抽屉里在那里他拿了个迫击炮和虫子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_26a0cb27:

    # "Ever so gently, he hands it over to you."
    "如此温柔地，他把它交给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b2ca21dd:

    # w "I could make the mixture myself, but... I feel it'd only be right if you did, seeing as you got all of the ingredients."
    w "我可以自己做混合剂，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0bbb7c71:

    # e "But... okay. I'll make sure it comes out okay."
    e "好吧，我会确保一切顺利的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e0e55876:

    # "You grab the tools and bring them outside."
    "你抓住工具，把他们带到外面去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c95f9573:

    # "Once you're there, you lay everything you'll need out on the grass - the two gels, the crystal, and the root."
    "一旦你在那里，你把所有你需要的东西都放在草地上 - 两杯，水晶，和根。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9bb4fb72:

    # w "Here, we'll need this to hold and mix tincture."
    w "在这里，我们需要这个来保持和混合锡刺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e4389fbc:

    # "Wuldon hands you a tall jar with a long wooden spoon in it."
    "伍尔顿给你一个高大的罐子里面装着一个长的木勺子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_cece15a6:

    # "Nodding, you grab it from him, before popping open the vial of teratoid mucus and pouring it in."
    "点头，你从他手里抢走它，之前打开瓶子的畸形史莱姆，并倒进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c69a92c4:

    # "You follow that up by opening the jar of flagitous ooze, which... refuses to follow gravity."
    "之后你打开了那罐臭水拒绝跟随重力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2e03a588:

    # "Thinking quickly, you grab the grancrystal, and use it to scrape all of the flagitous ooze down and into the jar."
    "快速思考，你抓住颗粒晶体，用它来刮所有的光滑的卵液下来，然后进入罐子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_abef055a:

    # "It's a long process - the flagitous ooze takes a bit to cling to the crystal, acting a bit like a drowsy slime, requiring the same time to cling to the jar from the spoon."
    "这是一个漫长的过程-- 胆小的胆小鬼需要一点粘着水晶，有点像一个昏沉的史莱姆，需要同时粘着勺子上的罐子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b74082a0:

    # "Finished with that, you hand the mixture of the slime components to Wuldon, who begins to stir the whole thing vigorously."
    "最后，你把史莱姆成分的混合物交给伍尔顿，他开始大力搅拌整个事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c13ee252:

    # "The once separate gels begin to meld together into a substance like water, but even clingier."
    "曾经分开的凝胶开始混合在一起形成一种物质像水，但甚至粘附。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9ffc4231:

    # "While he does that, you take the hexroot out of your bag, and place it in the mortar along with the grancrystal."
    "当他这么做的时候你从你的包里拿出来把它和颗粒一样放进迫击炮里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_24038cee:

    # "Picking up the pestle, you crush them together, into the mortar. There is a sickening crunch and juicy snap, both materials giving way to your blow."
    "抓起虫子，把它们一起压到迫击炮里。有一种令人恶心的裂缝和多汁的松动，两种材料都随你而去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2b711077:

    # "Over and over again you repeat this process, slowly but surely grinding them down into a paste."
    "你一遍又一遍地重复这个过程，慢地，但肯定地把它们碾碎成糊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b2d3fa3f:

    # "The hexroot's juice is immediately absorbed into the crystal's shards, turning both materials a light purple."
    "将两种材料都变成浅紫色水晶的碎片里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_fa0a3b3a:

    # "The final product looks a bit like a nebula - a purple haze surrounding the mixture, with little glinting pieces here and there signaling the pieces of crystal."
    "最终产品看起来有点像一个星云一种围绕混合物的紫色烟雾这里和那里都有点亮的碎片代表着晶体的碎片。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_5af294ea:

    # "Holding up the mortar once you're done, Wuldon takes it, and begins scraping it into the gel."
    "完成后，沃尔登拿起迫击炮开始把它刮进凝胶里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_47191d37:

    # w "I'll let you do the honors."
    w "我让你来做荣誉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_530db55a:

    # "He proffers the spoon to you."
    "他向你们提供勺子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0af36474:

    # e "Thank you."
    e "谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9b3a744e:

    # "You take the spoon, put it into the jar in his hands, and begin to mix it all together such that there is no precipitate to speak of."
    "你拿勺子，放在罐子里放在他手里，并开始混合起来，这样就没有什么可说的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_17d9bb4f:

    # "The end result is a purple gel, gently glowing and glittering, generating a purple mist that soon fills up the entire jar."
    "最终的结果是紫色凝胶，轻的发光和闪烁，产生紫色的雾，很快会填满整个罐子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_33c72b13:

    # e "Well, it definitely looks magical."
    e "嗯，它绝对看起来神奇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_100c0c08:

    # "Wuldon smirks a little."
    "伍尔顿有点笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_89fd0cce:

    # w "Not the first thing I would have said, but yes, it certainly does."
    w "我不是第一个想说的，但是，是的，它当然会说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_5aa76527:

    # "You blush, embarrassed at his teasing."
    "你脸红了，对他取笑感到尴尬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_223d0b6c:

    # e "What's the first thing you would have said then?"
    e "你当时会说些什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他摇摆着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_18ec901f:

    # w "Good job, probably."
    w "也许做得好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0175ec0f:

    # "You narrow your eyes at the werewolf, only to receive a teasing smile."
    "你对狼人缩小视线只是为了得到笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6b86f6e6:

    # e "Well, at least you're in a good mood."
    e "至少你心情不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2b8f8de1:

    # w "Mhmm, and it's all thanks to a little dragon and his friends."
    w "这都归功于一只小龙和他的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d8474c6e:

    # "The praise was a bit heavy there - you clear your throat to ignore the mix of pride and embarrassment welling up within you."
    "在那里，赞美有点沉重 - 你清喉咙忽略你内心的骄傲和尴尬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b3deff9f:

    # e "We should really get this to Vurro now."
    e "我们现在真的应该把这个交给伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2a4536cf:

    # "Wuldon chuckles, fully knowing why you changed the subject."
    "伍尔顿笑，完全知道你为什么改变话题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c918efce:

    # w "Yes, we should."
    w "是的，我们应该。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a2494708:

    # "Remembering what he'll have to face now, his smile dies a little."
    "记得他现在要面对的是什么他的笑容会消逝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d22a18f7:

    # w "Here, let me show you where he is."
    w "在这里，让我告诉你他在哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b26e3c0c:

    # "You follow Wuldon over to the entrance to his cellar. You can hear a steady thumping sound of flesh on wood, the chain locking the entrance straining with every beat."
    "你跟着伍尔顿走到他地下室的入口，听到木头不断的抽动，锁住入口的链子和每一节拍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_19e36758:

    # e "He's making less noise than I thought - I couldn't even hear this out front."
    e "他的声音比我想象的少我甚至听不见前门的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4d2a189a:

    # "Wuldon looks a bit conflicted."
    "伍尔顿看起来有点冲突。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2da59508:

    # w "He's still a bit sedated, but he's mainly just been trying this for a long time now, and has tired himself out."
    w "他还是有点镇静，但他基本上只是尝试这个已经很久了，已经累了自己了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d90cea73:

    # w "Having you here will make giving him medicine much easier though. Stand back for a second."
    w "你在这里会让他更容易吃药，退后一秒钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_09b2d3b4:

    # "Following his orders, you get back from the cellar's entrance, while Wuldon bends down to unlock it."
    "听从他的命令你从地窖的入口回来沃尔登弯腰打开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2e9735ac:

    # "The moment the chain comes undone, the world erupts into action."
    "链子倒塌后，世界就爆发为行动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_fa7d28b6:

    # "The feral - Vurro - erupts from the cellar, lunging straight for Wuldon's neck."
    "从地窖里喷出直冲着伍尔顿的脖子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4ba7dfab:

    # "Expecting this, Wuldon brings his hand up to Vurro's throat, bends backwards so that Vurro would lunge straight over him, and brings his leg up on Vurro's belly."
    "伍尔顿将他的手伸向伏罗的喉咙向后弯腰让伏罗直冲他将他的腿伸到伏罗的肚子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2baa80a7:

    # "Rolling backwards like this, Wuldon comes out on top of Vurro, having used his momentum to reverse their positions, The feral held down by the throat and belly."
    "伍尔顿在伏罗上方 利用他的力量 扭转了他们的位置 喉咙和腹部紧握着大腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_459fbd30:

    # "Just as quickly, the feral reacts, trying to rip through Wuldon's arms with its claws. In response, Wuldon sits on Vurro's chest, letting go of his throat, using the newly freed up arm to pin his opponent's hands above their head."
    "很快，大便反应迅速，试图用爪子撕穿沃尔登的手臂。作为回应，沃尔登坐在伏罗的胸前，放开他的喉咙，用新解的手臂将对手的手钉在他们的头上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ec41ff5d:

    # "Once properly positioned, all Vurro could do was snap his jaws at nothing, and kick his legs uselessly."
    "一旦定位正常伏罗只能无动于衷地扭断下巴毫无用处地踢他的腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b99c3f1c:

    # w "Alright, can you pass me the chain?"
    w "好吧，你能把链子递给我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2eaa249e:

    # "Confused, but somewhat awed, you go over and pick up the chain that previously barred the entrance."
    "有点迷惑，但有点迷惑，你过去拿起以前禁止入口的链子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b9150079:

    # "Handing it over to Wuldon, you see his plan. By draping the chain over the feral's mouth, it would try to bite him, only to find itself unable to close its mouth."
    "把它交给伍尔顿，你可以看到他的计划。通过把链子扯到大便的嘴上，它会试图咬他，只是发现自己无法闭上嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_34c6a20b:

    # "Leaving it like this was a bit cruel, but it is also what would have allowed Wuldon to feed the feral on his own."
    "离开这感觉有点残酷但这也是伍尔顿自己喂野兽的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_aabf5d0e:

    # w "Bring the jar here and pour the cure down his throat. I can hold him for a long time, but I'm pretty sure this hurts for him."
    w "我可以抱他很长时间，但我敢肯定这对他很疼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_06f06bfc:

    # "You hurriedly bring over the jar, tipping it over so that the solution first drips into his mouth, and then falls in a steady purple waterfall."
    "你匆忙地把罐子拿过来，翻倒它，这样溶液首先滴到他嘴里，然后掉进一个稳定的紫色瀑布里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_cdb152de:

    # "It only takes a few moments for everything to go down his throat, but somehow, not a single of medicine was wasted."
    "只要花一点时间就能让他的喉咙垂下去但不知怎么的一点药都没有浪费。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_59671c20:

    # w "And now we wait."
    w "现在我们等待。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6361c8c3:

    # e "Yeah..."
    e "喜欢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_688c6e8e:

    # e "How long do you think we'll have to wait?"
    e "你觉得我们还要等多久？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_01a790c6:

    # "Wuldon makes an odd movement with his head, which you realize is his best attempt at a shrug, given his inability to do so at present."
    "伍尔顿用他的头做一个奇怪的运动，你意识到这是他最擅长的冲浪，因为他目前无法这样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_83e3ecbb:

    # e "Ah. Well, anything I can do to help in the meantime?"
    e "在此期间我能帮上什么忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b7d2d623:

    # w "Can you go into the house and get him some of the food I prepared him? Should be on the desk near where the mortar and pestle were."
    w "你能进屋给他拿些我准备的食物吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_500aee43:

    # "You leave Wuldon and the struggling feral behind, making your way inside."
    "你离开沃尔登离开挣扎的野兽进入你的房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d5264898:

    # "The house is fairly orderly, though there are a few things that do not seem to be in the right spot."
    "房屋相当有序，虽然有些东西似乎不合适。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_fa4679f2:

    # "Looking around for the little drawer Wuldon grabbed the tools from, you spot a little table with scraps of red meat mixed with strong-smelling root fiber."
    "到处找一个小抽屉伍尔顿抢走了工具，你发现一个小桌子上面有一块红肉，夹杂着浓的根纤维。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_80d56375:

    # "This would be the food he mentioned, you think, considering you find the little drawer shortly after, slightly to the left and up of where the food was."
    "这就是他提到的食品，你认为，考虑到你发现小抽屉过后不久，稍微向左一点，向上的食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4c227a04:

    # "Satisfied that you found the right thing, you pick your way over. On your way there, you notice a small object being revealed, previously covered by the bowl of food."
    "你发现正确的东西，你选择了路。在路上，你注意到一个小东西被揭穿，以前被碗里的食物覆盖了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1d008735:

    # "It is a little book, worn and ragged - Brown from end to end, with thick pages of what appear to be vellum."
    "它是一个小书，破旧和破旧 - 棕色从头到尾，厚的页面似乎是天鹅绒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9ba4d7d9:

    # "You could ignore it and do what Wuldon said, but... something about it looks so inviting."
    "你可以忽略它，做伍尔顿说的，但是…… 有关它的东西看起来如此令人着迷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d6f0bcf7:

    # "You step right past the food, and towards the book, grabbing and opening it."
    "你跨过食物，走向书，抓住和打开它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_444aceea:

    # "The smell of dried leather floods your nostrils as the pages reveal their contents to you."
    "干皮革的气味淹没了你的鼻孔因为这些页面向您透露了它们的内容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_811867f0:

    # e "...a diary?"
    e "…… 日记？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b70c8aad:

    # "The contents towards the beginning are all about the changes to the dark forest, and the days after the mine collapse."
    "开始之前的内容都是关于暗林的变化，以及矿山倒塌后的几天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_603bc1ac:

    # "There appears to be a long time gap after that, where the author gave up on writing, only for it to be picked up later..."
    "之后似乎还有很长的时间隔，作者放弃了写作，只是为了以后再取……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d59b8c7d:

    # "At that point, the writing style changes from present tense to past tense, with the dates often being accompanied by little notes saying 'roughly' or 'I think'."
    "写作风格从现在的时态变为过去时态，日期往伴有微小的音符，上面写着“大概”或“我想”。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e05db84e:

    # "Most of these later entries are accompanied by little drawings of the things in question, well made, and with a careful for anatomy."
    "这些后来的条目大多附有关事物的微小图画，设计得精良，而且对解剖也很小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_8ce6134b:

    # "Moving forward through it, you eventually reach an entry with a drawing that looks a bit like you."
    "向前走下去，你最终会得到一张看起来有点像你的图画的条目。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d60871f2:

    # w "Here we get to the reason I'm writing these."
    w "我们来谈我写这些的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_630436a6:

    # w "This little guy has singlehandedly given me hope that you'll come back again."
    w "这个小家伙单枪匹马地给了我希望你还会回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0b9d3512:

    # w "He's a bit silly and doesn't look particularly reliable, but he went and saved you from that cave."
    w "他有点傻，看起来不太可靠但他去救你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d9d9c739:

    # w "He passed right out after the cave collapsed - having both of you here at home made me very happy."
    w "洞穴塌陷后他就昏倒了你们俩在家让我很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ca1e6683:

    # w "It was really cute to see him all tuckered out."
    w "看到他被塞出来真的很可爱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_48dc755d:

    # "It's a little weird how often you've been called small or cute recently - you were taller than average back home. Now the only person you're taller than is Jog."
    "有点奇怪，最近你经常被称作小可爱你比家乡一般高。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a16ab532:

    # "Turning the page, you see that the next set of entries detail Wuldon's attempts to help Vurro, as well as notes on his condition."
    "翻开页面，你看下一组条目详细介绍了沃尔登试图帮助伏罗以及他状况的注释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_dae80d2f:

    # "You see a small drawing of yourself bent over, harvesting plants in the wheat fields."
    "你看到一小幅你自己的画弯曲在小麦田里收获植物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2115b67a:

    # w "The little guy seems determined to help, no matter how much I tell him he doesn't have to."
    w "不管我告诉他多少他没必要帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ff9cde41:

    # w "I really hope you can meet him. I think you'd really get along with him."
    w "我真的希望你能见他我想你会和他相处的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_67d88e12:

    # "The next few entries detail your recent exploits."
    "下几个条目详细介绍了你最近的利用情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9e1cb907:

    # "There are only about 10 pages left in the book."
    "书中只有大约10页。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_00cf8264:

    # "The first half talk about the visit with Haskell - a little drawing of him looking pouty and wrinkly is appended to the entry, along with a little note saying 'smart dumbass'."
    "上半部谈到哈斯克尔的来访-他一幅小图画，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b72c52f6:

    # "The text itself is fairly dreary. It outright tells Vurro that he will likely become Feral once more."
    "这段文字本身相当晦暗，直截了当地告诉伏罗，他很可能会再次变成狂野狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_f0bafacb:

    # "You felt the journal was likely written for Vurro, but this page really confirmed it for you."
    "你觉得日记很可能是写给伏罗的, 但这个页面确实证实了这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4880bff6:

    # w "I thought we'd be able to have you here with us for a while - and while that might still become a reality, deep down I know Haskell is right."
    w "我想我们可以让你和我们一起在这里呆一阵子虽然这可能仍然会成为现实但内心深处我知道哈斯克尔是对的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_459f04c9:

    # w "We have no way of curing you. We can stop it for a bit, but you will die again someday soon. I know it's unfair, but it might be best to try and find how you'd like to spend your last few days."
    w "我们无法治愈你。我们可以阻止它，但你很快就会死。我知道这是不公平的，但也许最好试着找出你最后几天想怎么度过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_f5cb3f04:

    # "The writing on these last few words is noticeably worse - as if Wuldon had been struggling to write them down."
    "写在最后几句话上的文字明显比这更糟糕，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ef2308d9:

    # "The next entry is the last."
    "下一个条目是最后一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4ef7b49b:

    # w "The little one and I will be hunting for the last of the materials soon."
    w "小家伙和我很快会去打猎寻找最后的材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c85ab1b9:

    # w "I don't know what I'll do after all of this. Up until now, I've just been doing things my way, and hoping to find a way to bring you back."
    w "我不知道这一切之后我会做什么。直到现在，我一直在按照自己的方式做事情，希望找到办法把你带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e2f5f851:

    # w "With the end so close in sight, I've had some time to think about the future."
    w "随着结束如此接近的目光，我有一些时间去思考未来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_3d639b61:

    # w "I owe the people of Lusterfield; the little one most of all. I am going to repay them, even if I don't know exactly how, yet."
    w "我欠乐斯民菲尔德人情,他们中最小的人,我要还给他们,即使我还不知道如何偿还。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9fcc3d2b:

    # w "Though I'm strong, I am one person alone. I could help people one by one like the little one, but that is not my role."
    w "我虽强大，却孤身一人。我可以像帮助那孩子一样，逐一帮助人们；但那并非我的职责。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_16303ced:

    # w "I know what it is I should do, but I do not want to."
    w "我知道我应该做什么但我不想做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_95fabc21:

    # w "If you ask it of me, Vurro, I shall do it. I leave it up to you, not out of laziness, but because I do not wish to force people into my narrative."
    w "如果你问我，伏罗，我会做到这一点。我让你做，不是因为懒惰，而是因为我不想强迫别人进入我的叙述。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_709fd401:

    # w "It also does not help that it would require me to find a mate at some point."
    w "也无济于事需要我找个伴侣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_5424f730:

    # w "As you know, that is a bit complicated for me - I fear I may have to break tradition, and in doing so, put others in peril for my selfishness."
    w "你知道，对我来说，这有点复杂—— 恐怕我必须打破传统，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1c232622:

    # w "I have one in mind, but... unless I find a way around the obvious, it is a choice that puts the future in danger."
    w "我有一个想法，但…… 除非我找到办法绕过显而易见的，这是一个选择使未来处于危险之中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_84f35e6a:

    # "The journal ends there."
    "日记到此结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e097b64c:

    # "Maybe you shouldn't have read it, but... there was something about how the book was placed that made it clear he wanted somebody to find it."
    "也许你不该读，但是…… 书的设置方式表明他想找人找到它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6232be2d:

    # "You'll apologize to him about reading the journal when this is all over - hopefully he'll find it in him to forgive you."
    "你会向他道歉说读日记的事当这一切结束希望他能从他身上找到原谅你的答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_95aeda26:

    # "Grabbing the food, you return to Wuldon."
    "抢食物，你回到伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b07670c7:

    # "He is still on top of the feral, but much more relaxed than before. It has stopped thrashing, twitching slightly instead."
    "他仍然站在大便的顶端，但比以前更加放松。它停止了抽打，略微抽搐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_f2c5120b:

    # w "Good to see you again, little one. Can you go ahead and put the food down next to me? I think he'd choke if we tried to feed him now."
    w "很高兴再次见到你，小家伙，你能把食物放在我旁边吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_833fa63d:

    # "Looking down at Vurro's limp form, you can see why. He is out cold, his muscles, teeth, and claws shrinking little by little, as they return to a normal size."
    "看着伏罗的软体形状,你可以看到原因。他冷冷,肌肉,牙齿,爪子慢慢缩小, 恢复到正常大小。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c3e4f585:

    # "It seems the curse made him stronger."
    "看来诅咒让他更强大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_908ee281:

    # e "It seems like he's getting better."
    e "看来他越来越好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d63d46d4:

    # "Wuldon nods."
    "伍尔顿点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_5ece5c3b:

    # "You both sort of just... stand there for a bit."
    "你们俩都只是…… 站在那里呆一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_dd622c7e:

    # w "You should probably find a seat while we wait."
    w "我们等的时候你最好找个座位坐吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_68c8213b:

    # e "But what if something happens?"
    e "如果出了什么事呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9ce83194:

    # "You get a small grin back from Wuldon."
    "你得到一个小笑容从沃尔登回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_f749a093:

    # w "You can handle yourself."
    w "你可以自己处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b0429cc2:

    # w "Then I'll protect you."
    w "然后我会保护你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_7e9928a0:

    # "You blush a little."
    "你脸红了一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ad238e03:

    # e "I guess..."
    e "我想……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a3d6a5e1:

    # w "Just relax a little. You've earned yourself at least a bit of a break."
    w "放松点，你至少可以休息一会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a58fcc36:

    # "Sitting down with your back against the cabin wall, you get a good look at the area in front of you."
    "背靠着小木屋墙坐着仔细看前面那块地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_99e3cf9a:

    # "The only thing you can hear is Vurro's labored breathing, and the constant, underlying gurgling of the nearby stream."
    "你唯一能听到的就是伏罗的呼吸疲劳以及附近溪流的恒定的根底凝结。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d0acf181:

    # "The wind caresses your cheek, bringing with it the smell of verdure. Everything is as it should be - not a single thing out of place."
    "风抚摸你的脸颊，带去香水的气味。一切都是应该的，不是一成不变的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_09179f9f:

    # "You think you can understand why Wuldon likes it here. It's kind of... making you...... sleepy."
    "你以为你能理解伍尔顿为什么喜欢这里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_00df5543:

    # my "... -e!"
    my "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_af6c783e:

    # "Mrgg... is this a dream?"
    "Mrgg…… 这是一场梦吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_8bcbbd54:

    # w "Wake up, little one!"
    w "醒，小家伙！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_af875d09:

    # "Light floods your world as your eyes slam open, Wuldon's yelling finally cracking through the haze of sleep."
    "伍尔顿的叫喊声终于在睡眠的雾中敲碎了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c903e9af:

    # e "AAH, WHAT, ARE WE UNDER ATTACK?!"
    e "啊？什么，我们遭到袭击了吗？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_593e9e3b:

    # "Wuldon catches your flailing limbs, laughing."
    "伍尔顿接住你胡乱挥动的四肢，笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0c9bf19a:

    # "Wuldon suddenly snatches you up in a big, fluffy hug, just as quickly letting go."
    "伍尔顿突然把你一把抱起，用蓬松的身躯给你一个大大的拥抱，随即又松开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_8ccd724f:

    # w "No! Vurro is finally coming to!"
    w "不！伏罗终于要醒过来了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4ce986e5:

    # "The big werewolf appears to be in an excellent mood, a genuine smile spreading from ear to ear."
    "大狼人似乎心情很好，真正的笑容从耳到耳的传播。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_799788fc:

    # w "Come, come!"
    w "来吧，来吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e681352f:

    # "He moves over to Vurro's side, beckoning you over."
    "他移到伏罗那边让你过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6581e269:

    # e "Alright, alright, give me a second."
    e "好吧，好吧，给我一秒钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c7110322:

    # "Getting up takes you longer than you thought. It feels like you've been batted around by 80 of Lothar's dummies."
    "起来的时间比你想象的要长 感觉你好像被80个洛萨尔的假人缠住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_882609d5:

    # "When you do walk over, you see that Vurro's eyes have fluttered open."
    "当你走过去时，你可以看到伏罗的眼睛已经睁开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1e6bf472:

    # "His lips are moving slightly as well, as if he's trying to say something - all that comes out is a faint groan, however."
    "他的嘴唇也稍微动了一下，好像他想说点什么—— 出来的东西只是一小声呻吟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_70c9addb:

    # w "He's been like this for a little bit, but it's getting better."
    w "他一直这样一点，但它越来越好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ea4b04b2:

    # "Wuldon's foot is tapping nervously."
    "伍尔顿的尺被打得神经紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2452fc8f:

    # w "Can you go and bring me the small brown book from inside my house? It's on the table, next to where the food was."
    w "你能把我家里面的小棕色书拿来给我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9f91d32b:

    # "At any other time, you'd think he was fucking with you, and telling you he knew you read the journal, but right now he seems too distracted to play around."
    "在任何其它的时间，你会认为他是在耍你，并告诉你他知道你读日记，但现在他似乎太分心了，不能玩耍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c82bad7a:

    # e "Alright. I'll be right back."
    e "好吧。我马上回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b7979384:

    # "Once again heading inside, you make your way over to where you last left the book."
    "你再次进入，回到你上次离开书的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b0ede5e0:

    # "It's... on the floor. Not where you left it."
    "在地板上，不是你放的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1eb1286d:

    # "Maybe Wuldon did that? You'll ask him, just in case."
    "也许伍尔顿干的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_13b713be:

    # e "Hey! Wuldon! Did you go in here and use the book while I was sleeping?"
    e "嘿伍尔顿你进来用书了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ffdf488c:

    # w "No! Why do you ask?"
    w "不！你为什么问？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_022de93a:

    # e "No reason! I'll explain later!"
    e "没有原因！我稍后解释！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_21f3d6b7:

    # "Well, as much as yelling like that isn't really your style, it's starting to feel more and more warranted."
    "好吧，虽然大喊大叫不是你的风格，它开始感觉越来越需要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_43574ceb:

    # "Creeping forwards, you crouch down, looking at the book."
    "向前爬，蹲下，看着书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_21cb7b00:

    # "It's opened up on its very last page, previously left blank."
    "它在最后一页打开了之前是空白的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4ef0e3da:

    # "On them are two eyes, staring straight at you. I know what you're doing, they seem to say."
    "他们双眼盯着你，直盯着你我知道你在做什么，他们似乎都说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_fcc98dc7:

    # "When you blink, they're gone, and the book is back on the table."
    "当你眨眼的时候，他们就走了书又回到了桌子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a878cebf:

    # e "...what?"
    e "……啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_893067d4:

    # "That wasn't supposed to happen."
    "这不应该发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d14aa082:

    # "Scrambling for the book, you open it to the last page."
    "拼凑书本，你打开它到最后一页。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6e84d08f:

    # "It's blank again."
    "它又是空白的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_777b3371:

    # e "I... I know I'm not that tired. Something's going on here."
    e "我知道我没那么累，这里有点不对劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_15606a6f:

    # "But there's no proof of that."
    "但是没有证据。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9265f5d8:

    # "For now, you'll just have to bring the book over to Wuldon. You can hear some faint murmuring from over there already."
    "现在，你只需要把书带到伍尔顿，你已经听到那边有些微的杂音了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_49687e5a:

    # "Hurrying outside, still a bit spooked from what just happened, you get to Wuldon's side."
    "匆忙出门，还是有点害怕刚发生的事情，你得到沃尔登的侧面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_7d48aaf2:

    # w "Look! Vurro is almost forming words!"
    w "看伏罗快编造出词来了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1b07bec5:

    # "Listening closely, you can hear small murmurs from him."
    "仔细听着，你能听到他的小杂音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9b027835:

    # v "Wher- -wh- h-"
    v "Wher - -wh -h"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4dfe3b83:

    # "Still not really coherent though."
    "仍然没有真正一致。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e27a08a0:

    # e "I got the book for you though."
    e "虽然我有这本书给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_bf8a3c3f:

    # "You pass it over to him."
    "你把它传给他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ced41d49:

    # w "Thank you, little one."
    w "谢你，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_259cbf94:

    # "His nose twitches, confused."
    "他的鼻子抽搐，混乱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_8f77466e:

    # w "Did you spill blood on this? It... reeks of the stuff."
    w "你身上有血迹吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_812e87eb:

    # e "...no. I found it on the floor, not where I left it."
    e "不，我在地上找到的，不是放在我留下的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4f31f0dc:

    # "Wuldon looks over to you, deeply concerned."
    "伍尔顿很关心你十分关心你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_7b2ac6cf:

    # w "Any other signs of someone being there?"
    w "还有其他迹象显示有人在那里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1fdad0fb:

    # e "No, when I went down to pick it up, I saw that someone had left it open to the final page, where a pair of eyes stared up at me. Immediately after, it was back on the table, and the eyes were gone."
    e "不，当我下楼去捡它的时候，我看到有人把它留到最后一页，一对眼睛盯着我看。紧接着，它就回到桌子上，眼睛就不见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0d04128e:

    # w "..."
    w "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_8efe2bca:

    # w "We're going to have to figure out what that means. For now, let's pay attention to Vurro, though."
    w "我们得弄清楚那是什么意思现在让我们关注伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9f67001e:

    # e "Yeah. He should be the number one priority right now."
    e "是的，他应该是第一要务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_03a66432:

    # "Wuldon's throat rumbles as a deep growl rips through the clearing."
    "伍尔顿的喉咙像咆哮一样破空而出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_474320ef:

    # w "If they dare lay a finger on you, they'll lose the whole fucking arm. I don't care if they're magic, or if they're hiding - I will leave nothing of them but the smell left on this book."
    w "我不在乎他们是否是魔法，或者他们是否在躲藏—— 我会留下他们身上除了书上留下的气味之外什么都不留下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_fb39c8ba:

    # "He means that. You can see it in his body. His teeth are bared, claws flexed to rip and tear... you've never seen Wuldon like this."
    "他的意思是，你可以看到他的身体。他的牙齿被刺破，爪子被扭断，撕裂……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_3e88ae4e:

    # v "Wul- w- -ing -n -lp."
    v "Wul-w-ing-n-lp。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b94baf75:

    # "Wuldon's head snaps down, and his body relaxes, remembering where he is."
    "沃尔登的头折断了，他的身体放松，记得他在哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ed08787d:

    # w "Sorry Vurro, we'll focus on you for now."
    w "抱歉，伏罗，我们暂时专心看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_f19857e0:

    # e "We can worry about everything else later. Right now, let's just take care of Vurro"
    e "以后我们什么都可以担心现在，我们来照顾伏罗"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_db2ea20f:

    # "You both wait patiently for Vurro's words to gain cohesion. It's not a long wait, but the worry from the book looms over the two of you like a stormcloud."
    "你们都耐心等待伏罗的话来获得凝聚力。这不是一个漫长的等待，但书上的担忧像暴风雨一样笼罩着你们两人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_846e51a4:

    # v "W-wuldon?"
    v "W-wuldon？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_250423ff:

    # "And just like that, the worry dissipates, a grin coming to both of your faces."
    "就这样，忧虑消散了；你们脸上都浮现出笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0128e0f4:

    # w "Good morning Vurro. How are you feeling?"
    w "早上好，伏罗，你感觉怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_74eb17a0:

    # v "...confused."
    v "……困惑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_ea5f4f20:

    # w "I take it you don't remember anything from after we were mining?"
    w "我猜你不记得我们开采后的事了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_10fc6eaa:

    # "Vurro shakes his head, no. Now that his body has returned to normal, you can tell that he's definitely the smaller of the two brothers."
    "现在他的身体已经恢复正常了，你可以看到他绝对是两个兄弟中最小的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_13b1d278:

    # "Despite that, you can also see a sharp wit living behind those ears, where you couldn't with Uffe."
    "尽管如此，你也可以看到一只聪明的智慧生活在那些耳朵后面，在那里你无法与乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e98e8640:

    # v "I've had a very long dream - a dream of a dire wolf chasing me throughout the cave, and towards the end, the forest. Otherwise, nothing."
    v "我做了一个很长的梦一个可怕的狼的梦在整个洞穴里追我，最后是森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0d04128e_1:

    # w "..."
    w "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9739ae4e:

    # "Wuldon clears his throat."
    "伍尔顿清除了他的喉咙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1dbe1de7:

    # w "Well, you've definitely been doing things out here in the waking world."
    w "你绝对在醒过来的世界里一直在做一些事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_f52fc3e4:

    # w "I prepared this journal for you to catch you up on everything."
    w "我为你准备了这本日记让你赶上你的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_f70bdc65:

    # "Wuldon holds out the journal to Vurro, who slowly reaches out and takes it."
    "沃尔登把日记交给伏罗，他慢地伸出手来，拿下日记。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_fa6e4934:

    # v "So... I've been gone for a while?"
    v "我走了一阵子了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_095fd3ab:

    # "You both nod."
    "你们两个点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_38f1a692:

    # w "A lot has changed."
    w "许多变化。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_251417c9:

    # "Vurro turns to look at you."
    "伏罗转身看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_640d4750:

    # v "And who is this one? Did we finally manage to convince the tribe to talk to the others?"
    v "这是谁？我们终于说服部落和其他人谈话了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_31af851f:

    # "Ouch. He is {i}really{/i} going to hate reading that journal."
    "他真的{i}很{/i}讨厌读那本日记。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_0e71d511:

    # w "No, we... we're even more isolated than before."
    w "不，我们…… 我们比以前更孤立。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_cb287531:

    # w "This is my friend, [e]. He's been an incredible help when it comes to your recovery."
    w "这是我的朋友[e]对你康复的帮助非常大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_de0131b7:

    # w "All of this would likely have been impossible without him."
    w "没有他，这一切很可能是不可能的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1a37f68e:

    # w "I wanted you to meet him at least once, and for him to meet you as you are now."
    w "我要你见他至少一次也想让你见他就像你现在一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_e3aa457b:

    # w "This is [e]. I don't know where we'd be without him."
    w "这是[e]我不知道没有他我们去哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_fcff7eee:

    # "A satisfied rumble comes out of his throat."
    "他喉咙里流出一股满意的暴动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_8617a0d0:

    # w "Hopefully you'll be seeing a lot of him in the coming days. He's a wonderful person and friend."
    w "希望你们能在未来几天里见他是一个很棒的人和朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_057d7a94:

    # "A knowing smile crosses Vurro's lips."
    "一个熟悉的微笑 穿过了伏罗的嘴唇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1c140846:

    # v "I see your tastes haven't changed."
    v "我看见你的品味没有变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a69474da:

    # v "Nothing."
    v "没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_99a429af:

    # "Wuldon claps his hands together gently, getting your attention."
    "伍尔顿轻地拍手引起你的注意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_823b7c07:

    # w "Point is, he has been crucial to helping you get better, and I wanted you to meet him, and for him to be here."
    w "重点是他对于帮助你康复至关重要我想请你见他也想让你见他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9b949140:

    # "Vurro props himself up better to face you directly, offering his hand to you."
    "伏罗 自己站起来更好地面对你 直接向你伸出手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_59eeaf45:

    # v "It is a pleasure to meet any friend of Wuldon's. He is and was my most trusted advisor and friend - any friend of his is a friend of mine."
    v "很高兴见到沃尔登的朋友，他是我最信任的顾问和朋友，他的朋友也是我的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a64173dc:

    # "You take his hand, shaking it."
    "你握着他的手摇晃它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_8e1e72a4:

    # e "It is a pleasure to meet you as well, Vurro! I have heard much and more about you from Wuldon. To hear him say it, you were the greatest werewolf to ever live."
    e "我也很高兴见到你伏罗我从伍尔顿听到很多关于你的消息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6e454dc2:

    # "That ends the handshake, as Vurro promptly turns to glare at Wuldon."
    "结束握手，当伏罗迅速转向伍尔顿的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_050b759e:

    # v "I see he hasn't gotten better, then."
    v "看来他没好起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1f858022:

    # "Wuldon is looking back at him with a face that told Vurro what he thought of that statement."
    "伍尔顿正用一张脸看着他 将他的想法告诉了伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_4ca54c79:

    # w "I'll get better when your brother does. Or when we develop an actual history."
    w "等你哥来的时候我会好起来的或者等我们发展出真实的历史。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_5400d108:

    # "Vurro shakes his head, disappointed."
    "伏罗摇头，失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6dc72dd4:

    # e "No, I think Wuldon is onto something. Other than him, you're pretty much the only werewolf I've seen have an actual conversation."
    e "不，我想沃尔登有线索，除了他之外，你几乎是我见过的唯一个真正对话的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6b1a83b0:

    # "All that does is earn you a frustrated look."
    "所有这一切都让你一副沮丧的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_77e1fac5:

    # v "Fine, I'll take it. Even if our fellow werewolves are only like that due to a lack of proper leadership, I see your point."
    v "好吧，我接受，即使我们的狼人兄弟们只是因为缺乏适当的领导才这样，我理解你的观点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_373903ac:

    # "Vurro taps his claws together, looking down at them."
    "伏罗把他的爪子一起拍下来俯视它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_1170b619:

    # "In there he sees long dried blood - a reminder of the time that has passed."
    "他在那里看见长血干，以示对已逝者的记忆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_01c4ca6f:

    # v "I don't mean to be rude, but... I just woke up from whatever this was."
    v "我不是想无礼，但我刚从这里醒来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c3957b9c:

    # v "You seem like a wonderful person, and I'll want to talk to you later, if you'd be happy to."
    v "你看上去是个好人我想晚点再和你谈如果你愿意的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_88124008:

    # "He grimaces."
    "他很凶恶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d7a0a99e:

    # v "But for now I'd like to read this journal, and have Wuldon help me fill in the gaps."
    v "但现在我想读这本日记并且让伍尔顿帮我填补空白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_171589b9:

    # "You nod. It's not hard to see how this could be overwhelming."
    "你点头，不难看出这怎么令人难以承受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_a8575b4b:

    # e "Alright, I'll come back later. It really was a pleasure meeting you, Vurro."
    e "好吧，我晚点再来，很高兴见到你，伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_3cd9c7fd:

    # e "Best of luck."
    e "祝好运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b7bea861:

    # "Wuldon walks up to you, and puts a hand on your shoulder."
    "伍尔顿走到你面前把手放在肩膀上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_c6462ec0:

    # w "I owe you much and more for this, little one. It would be nice if we talked again soon."
    w "我欠你的人情，小家伙最好我们尽快再谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_544c14e7:

    # "He tilts his head towards Vurro."
    "他把头向伏罗倾斜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_10fcfff7:

    # w "Once he is properly caught up, of course."
    w "当然，一旦他被妥善地抓住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_5fdea1b2:

    # e "Of course. I'll see you later, Wuldon."
    e "当然了回头见伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_022a2f68:

    # "Turning away from him, it is your turn to raise your hand in farewell to the werewolf."
    "背弃他，现在轮到你举手告别狼人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_2c61e0dd:

    # "As you begin to move away, to give the two space, Wuldon quickly closes the distance between the two of you."
    "当你开始搬走，给两个空间，沃尔登很快关闭了你们两个之间的距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_99ad9ac5:

    # "As he gets to you, he wraps you up in a big hug, one hand pressed against your lower back, right against your hip, and the second on your neck."
    "当他接近你时，他拥抱你，一只手紧地按在你的下背，右对着你的臀部，和第二手在你的脖子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b2a5b2ed:

    # "You're smushed against his soft fur and chubby body, held protectively and dotingly."
    "你被他的软毛皮和胖的身体压扁了被保护着被可怜地压着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_738d2946:

    # "It's a surprising move from Wuldon, but you can't say you mind."
    "从伍尔顿来的这举动令人吃惊但你不能说你介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_b539da04:

    # "After a few brief moments, Wuldon pulls away from you."
    "几分钟后伍尔顿从你身边消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_d27721dd:

    # w "Stay safe. Come back and talk to me when Vurro's done catching up, okay?"
    w "小心点伏罗追上后再回来跟我说话好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_3a2b0180:

    # "You were already planning to, but..."
    "你已经计划好了，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_91462881:

    # e "How am I supposed to know when that'll happen?"
    e "我怎么知道什么时候会发生？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_8bc9e0d9:

    # "Wuldon grins wolfishly."
    "伍尔顿狼吞虎咽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9a3abb0e:

    # w "You'll be stopping by regularly to see if he's still reading that journal. You'll know."
    w "你会定期来看他是否还在看日记。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_7e9928a0_1:

    # "You blush a little."
    "你脸红了一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_54d4952d:

    # e "Fair enough."
    e "有道理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_f36abfee:

    # e "I'll see you two later then. Hopefully Vurro gets through reading everything okay."
    e "晚点见希望伏罗能读完所有东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_80e0f4d2:

    # "Wuldon nods to you, smiling."
    "伍尔顿点头，微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_6128d6d3:

    # w "I'll make sure he does. Now, get going, we'll see each other again soon."
    w "我会确保他能这么做的，现在，走吧，我们很快会再见面的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Cure_Vurro_9994bb2b:

    # "He waits for you to turn around and go, watching over you until you finally disappear from sight."
    "他等着你转过身去看着你直到你从眼前消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_137302eb:

    # "You find Wuldon in front of his house, sharpening his khopesh."
    "你发现伍尔顿在他家门口磨他的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_25039ed9:

    # "There is a look of deep concentration on his face, as he gently applies the whetstone to the blade, over and over."
    "他脸上有一张很深的表情，他轻地把石碑反复地用在刀片上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_8abc4b0f:

    # e "You ready to go?"
    e "你准备走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_454099c5:

    # "Wuldon looks up from his blade, before putting his whetstone to the side, sheathing his sword, and standing up."
    "伍尔顿从他的刀上抬头看，然后再把他的石碑放在一边，捆起他的剑，站起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_d7b28669:

    # w "Mhmm. I've just been waiting for a certain little one to finish his own preparations."
    w "我只是在等某个小的完成他自己的准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_eeea12a2:

    # e "But I didn't even take that long!"
    e "但我甚至没花那么长时间！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_3a7e4a9e:

    # "Wuldon shrugs."
    "伍尔顿的摇摆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_9a65ad33:

    # w "Maybe, but it's still fun to tease you."
    w "也许吧，但取笑你还是很有趣的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_da11c14b:

    # e "Am I just bullyable or something?"
    e "我只是欺负人还是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_aeca2ff7:

    # "He shakes his head."
    "他摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0d4f3cce:

    # w "No, just cute."
    w "不，只是可爱而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_8763c8b4:

    # "You grumble a bit, but still follow Wuldon as he starts walking towards Lusterfield."
    "你有点发牢骚,但还是跟着沃尔登 他开始走向乐斯民菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e55846d3:

    # "The way there is fairly quiet. The only notable thing to happen was that Wuldon asked you to take the lead once you got past the river."
    "唯一值得注意的事情是沃尔登让你在经过河后带头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_9739872c:

    # "Lusterfield was rather quiet at this time of day, something you were thankful for. You don't want to think about how a crowd of people would react to seeing Wuldon."
    "乐斯民菲尔德在今天这个时候很安静,你感激不尽。你不想去想 一群人会怎么对看到沃尔登的反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_a425a271:

    # w "Huh, this place is smaller than I thought?"
    w "这地方比我想象的小？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f2fbd9e6:

    # e "I thought so too, but you have to keep in mind that this is only a small part of Lusterfield, even excluding the vast stretches of farmland you've seen."
    e "我也这么认为, 但你必须记住,这只是 乐斯民菲尔德 的一小部分, 即使排除了 你见过的广阔的农田。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f458d617:

    # "Wuldon shakes his head."
    "伍尔顿摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_597fcc29:

    # w "No, no. I mean that nobody's here."
    w "不，不，我是说没人在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0ddbcc5f:

    # e "Oh. That's less typical. There's normally at least one person on this street."
    e "不太典型，这条街上通常至少有一个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_d5a868d9:

    # "You look over at the space Lothar usually lounges at."
    "你看看洛萨尔的太空 通常都是休息室。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_25bdbaef:

    # e "But they don't seem to be here today."
    e "但他们今天似乎不在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6519f024:

    # w "Probably for the best."
    w "可能是最好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_97ddc1e7:

    # "You shiver, thinking about the fit Lothar would pitch at a werewolf being in town."
    "你颤抖，想着洛特尔会喜欢城里的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_05364ff8:

    # e "Agreed."
    e "同意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_3b80db25:

    # "So saying, you walk into the King's Pawn. Inside are Ole and Sebas, both of which look bored out of their mind, checking and rechecking their wares."
    "你 便 走进 王 的 兵、 里面 有 奥利 和 西巴、 都 看上去 无聊、 检查、 重新 检查、 心 中 的 衣物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_d91c1d60:

    # e "Good morning! It's good to see you two again."
    e "早上好很高兴再次见到你们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_97a8274d:

    # "Sebas' tail immediately starts swishing back and forth."
    "塞巴斯的尾巴立即开始回转。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_2954c483:

    # s "Roomie! It's good to see you too! How has the day been treating you? Seen anything cool?"
    s "室友见到你也很高兴今天过得怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_8c8baa56:

    # "Before you can answer the gush of information Sebas has thrown your way, Ole cuts in."
    "在你回答塞巴斯的口供之前塞巴斯的手法已经抛出欧里插手了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_1d49d1f8:

    # o "You see us every morning, but it's good to see you, yes. You don't have to tell us about your day. I wouldn't mind if you did, but Sebas just wants a distraction."
    o "你每天早上都看到我们，但很高兴见到你，是的，你不必告诉我们你今天的事儿，我不介意你这么做，但塞巴斯只是想分散你的注意力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_afbdf135:

    # s "Yeah, because it's booooooring. If you don't tell me anything cool I might just fall asleep at the desk!"
    s "是啊，因为那太酷了，如果你不告诉我什么很酷的话，我可能会在桌子上睡着！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_88f38ba9:

    # "Ole rolls his eyes."
    "奥莱翻转他的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_094d3907:

    # "At that moment, you hear the quiet jingling of bells, signaling a new customer. It's Wuldon, of course. Both Ole and Sebas' eyes widen."
    "那一刻,你听到钟声响起, 发出新客户的信号。当然,是沃尔登。奥利和塞巴斯的双眼都扩大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_b68a2af5:

    # s "H-hello, and welcome to the King's Pawn."
    s "你好，欢迎来到国王的战犬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_8d1468c8:

    # "Wuldon chuckles, looking between them and you."
    "伍尔顿笑着看着他们和你之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_bd189d59:

    # w "You know, you were much less scared of me than these two, little one. Do I have blood on my face today or something?"
    w "你知道，你比这两个小个子更怕我，今天我脸上是不是有血？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e2cdc303:

    # "It's a terrible joke, and it makes you smile, but Sebas and Ole seem to be petrified in fear."
    "这是一个可怕的笑话, 它让你微笑, 但塞巴斯和奥利似乎被吓得要死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_be6ffb80:

    # e "I don't think it's a good idea to joke about that yet, Wuldon, they still don't get why you're here, and they think you're like the other werewolves."
    e "我不觉得开这个玩笑是个好主意，沃尔登他们还是不明白你为什么在这里他们认为你跟其他狼人一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_4f58b965:

    # w "Fair enough. I can introduce myself if you think that'd be best?"
    w "说得公平点如果你觉得这样最好我可以自我介绍一下吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_890a2140:

    # "It seems that Wuldon is looking to you for help on this one. He isn't particularly used to talking to 'normal people'."
    "沃尔登似乎在找你帮忙，他不习惯和\"正常人\"说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_461537b0:

    # e "It's fine, I'll introduce you three to each other."
    e "没关系，我给你们介绍三个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_06f9be11:

    # e "Alright, Ole, Seb, this is Wuldon. He's a friendly werewolf I met during my travels - he might look scary, but he means no harm, I promise."
    e "好了，奥利、塞巴斯，这是伍尔顿。我旅行时认识了这位友善的狼人——他看起来可能有些吓人，但我保证他没有恶意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_a445087c:

    # e "Wuldon, the green lizard to your left is Ole, and the yellow lion to your right is Sebas. They're both friends of mine, so try not to scare them too much, okay?"
    e "沃尔登,你左边的绿蜥蜴是奥利,右边的黄狮是塞巴斯。他们都是我的朋友,所以尽量不要吓到他们,好吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_79332a2a:

    # "Wuldon smiles at the two of them, a big smile full of confidence you're pretty sure he doesn't have."
    "伍尔顿对两人微笑充满自信的笑你确信他没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_650229cf:

    # w "It's a pleasure to meet both of you."
    w "很高兴见到你们俩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0bacb84a:

    # o "...it's a pleasure to meet you too?"
    o "很高兴见到你吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_4c00d9a4:

    # o "[e], where did you meet him exactly? Is he your friend?"
    o "[e]，你在哪里认识他的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_3b3c6653:

    # "The whole time you and Wuldon were talking, Seb's tail was thrashing, the lion clearly upset by something."
    "你和伍尔顿一直聊天塞巴斯的尾巴被打得粉碎狮子显然被什么东西惹毛了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6ba929b5:

    # s "Or maybe something more? You never tell us what you're doing out in the forest - maybe you've found a big werewolf lover and came here to say goodbye to civilization."
    s "你从不告诉我们你在森林里做什么或许你找到了一个狼人大情人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f6e34ac9:

    # "He's definitely saying it as a joke, but there's a tinge of something unpleasant in it. A bit more bite than you're used to hearing in Seb's voice."
    "他肯定是在开玩笑，但里面有不愉快的东西，比塞巴斯的声音里你经常听到的多一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_3206e634:

    # e "He's a friend. I've spent a good amount of time with him, but that's because he's been going through a lot recently, and I'm not one to leave a friend in need."
    e "他是朋友，我和他相处很久了，但那是因为他最近经历了很多事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_63cad868:

    # o "Oh, is he having trouble with the other werewolves?"
    o "哦，他有问题与其他狼人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_c61d6dbf:

    # e "Sort of. It's mainly that his friend got cursed... which is why we're here actually."
    e "算是吧。主要是他的朋友中了诅咒……所以我们才会来到这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_240c26ba:

    # e "Haskell told us that any cure for him would involve hexroot, and that it would be best to get that from you."
    e "哈斯克尔告诉我们任何治疗他的方法都会涉及到苔根最好从你那里得到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_4cc5be6f:

    # e "He's a friend. A very handsome friend, sure, but we've spent most of our time together trying to resolve an issue we've both encountered."
    e "他是朋友，当然是个非常英俊的朋友但我们大部分时间都在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_edd65340:

    # "Ole rolls his eyes at the mild flirting, before returning to what actually interests him."
    "奥利在回到他真正感兴趣的事情之前 就会对温和的调情感兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_b7042d32:

    # o "An issue you've both encountered?"
    o "你们都遇到过一个问题？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_ef417125:

    # e "Yeah. A friend of his got cursed, and we need to buy some hexroot from you."
    e "是的，他的一个朋友被诅咒了，我们需要从你那里买一些毒根。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_54663ba7:

    # "Your cheeks go a bit red, embarrassed at Seb's suggestion."
    "你的脸红了一点被塞巴斯的建议蒙羞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_7917fa28:

    # e "He's someone I trust a great deal."
    e "他是我信任的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_9401095c:

    # e "He's strong, kind, and dependable... we've spent a lot of time together recently because of something he's been going through."
    e "他强壮善良可靠最近我们在一起很久了因为他经历了一些事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_bc447bde:

    # "You didn't answer the question, and while Ole just chuckles, Seb and Wuldon take note of that."
    "你没有回答问题 而奥利只是笑 塞布和沃尔登注意到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_3fa2fafc:

    # "Wuldon looks deeply amused, and perhaps a bit interested. Seb, on the other hand, has a very strained smile on his face, tail once again thrashing."
    "沃尔登看起来非常有趣，也许有点感兴趣。另一方面，塞巴斯脸上的笑容非常紧张，尾巴再次被打得喘不过气来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_675a6674:

    # w "Nah, even if he is sorta cute, we're just friends."
    w "不，即使他有点可爱，我们只是朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_bb939c86:

    # o "Alright then, how did you and your 'friend' meet?"
    o "好吧，那你和你\"朋友\"是怎么认识的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e4f23c5b:

    # "Seb is struggling to contain himself, quietly fuming in the background."
    "塞巴斯正努力控制自己悄地在幕后熏蒸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_5166fffe:

    # e "I was hired to do a certain job by the werewolves, and I met Wuldon on the way there. He told me not to do the job, because it would hurt his friend, which is..."
    e "我受雇于狼人做某件工作，我在路上遇到了伍尔顿，他叫我不要做，因为这会伤害他的朋友，那是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6e355f5a:

    # e "Well, helping that friend of his is why we're here, actually. We need to buy some hexroot off of you, if possible."
    e "帮助他的朋友就是我们来这里的原因，我们需要从你那里买一些毒根，如果可能的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0472ef2c:

    # "Your face grows complicated."
    "你的脸变得复杂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_7917fa28_1:

    # e "He's someone I trust a great deal."
    e "他是我信任的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e812be41:

    # e "He's strong, kind, and dependable, and I want to make sure everything goes well for him and Vurro."
    e "他强壮善良可靠我要保证他和伏罗一切顺利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_bc447bde_1:

    # "You didn't answer the question, and while Ole just chuckles, Seb and Wuldon take note of that."
    "你没有回答问题 而奥利只是笑 塞布和沃尔登注意到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_08f9a4ed:

    # "Wuldon seems deeply satisfied, an oddly protective look plastered across his face."
    "伍尔顿似乎非常满意，奇怪的保护性表情涂满了他的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_334ea38f:

    # "Seb, on the other hand, looks just about ready to kick Wuldon out of the store."
    "另一方面塞巴斯看上去正准备把伍尔顿赶出店外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_2e083de6:

    # w "We're just friends for now."
    w "我们现在只是朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_bcde2f2c:

    # "Your blush deepens, turning your face near-scarlet."
    "你的脸红得深脸朝下转。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_bb939c86_1:

    # o "Alright then, how did you and your 'friend' meet?"
    o "好吧，那你和你\"朋友\"是怎么认识的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e4f23c5b_1:

    # "Seb is struggling to contain himself, quietly fuming in the background."
    "塞巴斯正努力控制自己悄地在幕后熏蒸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_12ffa35f:

    # e "Oh, umm..."
    e "哦，嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6549d1b3:

    # e "We met because I had a job to do for the werewolves, and I found him along the way."
    e "我们相遇是因为我为狼人工作我一路找到他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0fc16d70:

    # e "One thing led to another, and now we're trying to cure a friend of his from a curse."
    e "有一件事导致另一件事，而现在我们试图治愈他的一个朋友从诅咒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_2a4366e4:

    # "You hear a gruff grunt from behind you, and feel the warm weight of Wuldon's hand on your shoulder."
    "你听到后面的一阵痛声感受着伍尔顿的手在肩膀上的温暖重量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_9b266162:

    # w "We came here to buy some hexroot from you."
    w "我们来这里是为了从你这里买一些毒根。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f3209e91:

    # "Regardless of how they felt previously, Seb and Ole grow sympathetic to Wuldon's plight - both of them disgusted by the idea of a curse."
    "无论他们以前的感受如何，塞巴斯和奥利都同情伍尔顿的困境，他们两人都厌恶诅咒的想法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_aa20ab05:

    # o "Oh dear, a curse... I haven't heard of one of those in a long time."
    o "哦，亲爱的，一个诅咒……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_87cfddd7:

    # "Seb lets out a quiet hiss."
    "塞巴斯释放出一个安静的他的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_11215d0a:

    # s "And it would have been better not to hear it at all."
    s "最好别听进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6fe094f1:

    # s "What asshole needs to get a fist to the face for doing that to your friend."
    s "哪个混蛋要对你的朋友那样对你朋友就要当面拳打尺踢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_573a9385:

    # "Both you and Wuldon sigh."
    "你和沃尔登都叹气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_54095354:

    # w "We don't know. There are a couple leads, but we'll try and figure it out after we cure him."
    w "我们不知道有几个线索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f130754b:

    # o "Not a bad idea. Curses are bad business, but helping your friend comes first."
    o "不错的主意诅咒是坏事但帮助你的朋友是第一位的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_dfe24624:

    # o "Here, I have some hexroot in the back, let me go grab it for you - I'll just be a second."
    o "我后面有些毒根让我帮你拿一下我马上就来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_d9adce3c:

    # "With that, Ole runs to the back, soon coming back with a thick purple root with conical protrusions randomly interspersed. He hands it over to you almost immediately."
    "欧力跑到后面很快又带着厚的紫色根和圆锥的刺痕随机地穿透。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_b9c941a1:

    # o "Good luck - I hope your friend recovers alright."
    o "祝你朋友康复顺利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_abdd56f5:

    # "Seb nods, getting up and walking over before giving you a big hug."
    "点头起来走过去然后给你一个拥抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e4e37b13:

    # s "If you find out who did it, kick their ass, roomie. I know you can do it."
    s "如果你发现是谁干的，就揍他们，室友我知道你能做到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_1bc776a2:

    # "This entire situation is overwhelming, but Wuldon appears to be completely shell-shocked."
    "整个局势是压倒性的，但沃尔登似乎完全被炮弹击中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_be6fa833:

    # w "I... appreciate the well wishes for both [e] and I, but..."
    w "我很感激[e]和我的好愿望但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_85e3fc80:

    # w "What about your payment? How much do you need?"
    w "那你的薪水呢你需要多少钱？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e390ab90:

    # "Ole waves his hand dismissively."
    "奥利轻率地挥动他的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_3b38c972:

    # o "This isn't something that should be paid for. Please just use it to help your friend as soon as possible."
    o "这不是应该付钱的请尽快用它来帮助你的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0c32c591:

    # "Wuldon's ears go flat against his head in dismay."
    "伍尔顿的耳朵在惊慌中直地对着他的头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_5e39a6a3:

    # w "I can't just... not pay you, right?"
    w "我不能不付你钱，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_cb35961f:

    # s "He means it you oaf. Now stop wasting time and leave."
    s "他的意思是你别浪费时间了离开吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6da6c8ba:

    # "Sebas was not nearly as gentle as Ole was, but it is not nearly as spiteful as he seemed earlier."
    "塞巴斯没有奥利那么温柔，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_dbee2602:

    # w "I'll find a way to pay you all back later. I cannot thank you enough for your help with Vurro."
    w "我以后会想方设法还清你们非常感谢你们对伏罗的帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_022f205f:

    # "Taking their words to heart, Wuldon gently nudges you towards the door."
    "沃尔登轻地把你推向门前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_59e1df62:

    # w "I know you said you wanted to come with me, so... I'm heading there now. If you'd like to come, do so now."
    w "我知道你说想和我一起去，所以……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_c7ad506d:

    # w "Otherwise, please stay safe while I go get the rest of the materials."
    w "否则，我去拿其他材料时请小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e3fbc656:

    # "You shake your head at Wuldon."
    "你在沃尔登摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_5f43d441:

    # e "No, I'm coming with you."
    e "不，我和你一起去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6ff7096e:

    # "With that, Wuldon walks out of the door, making his way towards the dark forest."
    "伍尔顿走出门走向黑暗的森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0f40532b:

    # "You turn your head back to Sebas and Ole."
    "你的头转回塞巴斯和奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_a9abda13:

    # e "Thank you so much for all of the help again. You're incredible people and housemates."
    e "再次感谢你们的帮助，你们是不可思议的人和室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0c4fe627:

    # s "Anytime, roomie! Just make sure to get your fluffy butt back here safe and sound!"
    s "随时都行室友一定要让你的毛屁股安全回来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_d93e6a22:

    # o "Yes, what he said. Run if it ever looks too dangerous."
    o "是的，他说的，如果看起来太危险就快跑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_4fde1a4f:

    # e "I know Wuldon has my back."
    e "我知道沃尔登支持我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_a959580d:

    # e "I need to go after him now though, he's getting away from me. Bye! See you again in a bit!"
    e "我现在得去追他，他离我而去再见，回头见！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e80e5828:

    # "Dashing out of the door, you run towards Wuldon's distant form, determined to make your way to slime country side by side."
    "走出门，你跑向沃尔登的遥远形态决心要走你的方式一起爬到乡下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_bceb635b:

    # "After a while of walking, you notice that the trees are slowly changing, growing closer together to each other, and occasionally dripping unknown goo at your feet."
    "经过一段时间的步行后，你注意到树木正在慢变化，彼此之间越来越近，偶尔在你的尺上滴出未知的谷歌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_dd7059fa:

    # "Wuldon keeps disappearing from your side, returning with a significantly slimier khopesh every time."
    "伍尔顿一次次从你身边消失，回来时手里都拿着一把黏滑得多的弯刃剑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_1f27ccb7:

    # "Your surroundings only grow stranger as you go forward, eventually leading to an area completely choked by trees."
    "你周围的环境只会变得陌生当你前进，最终导致一个完全被树木窒息的地区。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_b44895ca:

    # "Looking through a small hole in the trees, you see a clearing with a similar opening on the opposite side of you."
    "透过树上的小洞，你可以看到一个空地，在你的对面有一个类似的开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_782132ff:

    # "Giant slimes are roaming freely around the area - likely the ones you need to hunt for Vurro."
    "巨型史莱姆在附近自由游荡很可能是你们要找的伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_198027b3:

    # w "Well, here we are."
    w "好了，我们到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_5c5b4918:

    # w "I'll be out here making sure none of the area's slimes try to come in after you."
    w "我会在这里确保该地区没有史莱姆试图进入后，你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_0acf8a63:

    # "He takes out his khopesh with a grim look on his face."
    "他脸上一副严酷的表情拿出他的呼声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_184cc8af:

    # w "I'd let you do this part, if it weren't for how sneaky they are, like -"
    w "我会让你做这部分，如果不是因为他们多狡猾，"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_1320a7a3:

    # "Wuldon slashes his Khopesh at an inconspicuous patch of grass, piercing through a translucent slime you hadn't realized was there."
    "伍尔顿在一片不显眼的草地上将他的霍佩斯鞭打成碎片穿透了你不知道的半透明的史莱姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_bf20efb3:

    # e "Yeah... I think I'm better suited for the clearing anyways. I'm not sure if you can fit through the gap."
    e "我觉得我更适合清空，我不确定你能不能穿过空隙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f47cf443:

    # "You point at the hole between the trees."
    "你指着树之间的洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_356f242c:

    # w "I'm pretty sure I could if I tried, but... it would be unpleasant."
    w "我敢肯定，我可以如果我尝试，但是…… 这将是不愉快的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_dcb07571:

    # "Wuldon lets out a deep sigh."
    "伍尔顿让大家深叹息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e3ec0464:

    # w "Wait, wait... I almost forgot to explain how these slimes behave."
    w "等，我差点忘了解释这些史莱姆的行踪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_e2090283:

    # w "Slimes are stupid, and will only follow you when you get near."
    w "斯利姆斯是愚蠢的，只会跟着你当你接近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f04dc12b:

    # w "The small ones don't hurt very much, but they do tend to wear you down at least a little with how clingy they are."
    w "小的不伤得很重，但是他们确实会因为它们多粘紧使你至少有点累。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_4abc506f:

    # w "Bigger ones are more dangerous - they'll chase you down and attack you. The upside is that they're pretty slow."
    w "更大的更危险他们会追逐你攻击你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_2c00a68b:

    # w "All slimes eventually give up when you get far enough from where they consider 'home', slipping off and returning to their original spot after a certain time."
    w "当你离他们认为\"家\"的地方越远越好，。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_78afe74e:

    # e "...and my goal is to beat all of them in the hopes of getting the right material, yeah?"
    e "……我的目标是打败他们所有人……。……希望得到正确的材料，是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f458d617_1:

    # "Wuldon shakes his head."
    "伍尔顿摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_f11103fc:

    # w "No, the only one you really need to fight is that one, I imagine."
    w "不，你唯一需要战斗的就是那个，我想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_12693534:

    # "He points at what you thought was a goo-covered boulder."
    "他指向你认为的是一个谷歌覆盖的巨石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_1c10f167:

    # w "The bigger slimes should be what you're looking for - creatures that big tend to be where the best reagents come from."
    w "更大的史莱姆应该是你要找的 - 那些大的生物往是最好的试剂的来源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_65750554:

    # e "But there's only one of them."
    e "但只有一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_58b28050:

    # w "And there's more than one room."
    w "并且不止一个房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_d9ccde4f:

    # "Wuldon chuckles lightly."
    "伍尔顿轻笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_6d69201d:

    # w "I'm sorry about all the work I'm throwing your way with this."
    w "很抱歉我把你丢在了这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_1551785d:

    # w "Regardless, good luck, little one. I'm counting on you."
    w "祝你好运，小家伙，我全靠你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_035b0b53:

    # "You give him a nod, and walk into the dungeon, his smile disappearing into an expression of worry."
    "你向他点头走进地牢他的笑容消失在忧心忡的表情中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_3dd126a4:

    # "In the distance behind you, you hear Wuldon whisper to himself, underestimating your sense of hearing."
    "在你身后的远处，你听到伍尔顿自言自语低估了你的听觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Shop_aa322d65:

    # w "He'll be fine. If worse comes to worst, I'll just pull him out of there. Just focus on protecting him out here."
    w "他会没事的如果情况更糟我就把他拉出来集中保护他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_9a299508:

    # "You've been to Wuldon's house enough times that you've memorized the way there."
    "你去过沃尔登的家已经够多次了你记住了去那里的路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_deb3df0f:

    # "It's extremely relaxing to walk through this section of the woods. There are no werewolves to terrorize you here."
    "穿过树林的这一带可是很轻松的，这里没有狼人来恐吓你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_a848eb36:

    # "A cool breeze tickles your cheeks, the gentle rustling of the leaves lulling you into a feeling of deep cal-"
    "凉的微风让你的脸部痒叶子的轻柔偷猎让你感到深的痛"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_2a6acf91:

    # "Right as you thought that, a large, heavy mass slams into the back of your head, throwing you to the ground. Right before your face makes impact however, you find your momentum halted by two fluffy arms."
    "正如你所想的，一个大而沉重的集体撞击你的后脑勺，将你扔到地上，就在你的脸撞击之前，你发现你的势头被两只毛的手臂所阻挡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_a496130c:

    # w "I thought I told you to look above you?"
    w "我不是叫你往上看吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_7b6eaa5a:

    # "Wuldon's rumbling voice comes from right behind you. His warm breath tickles your ear as you dangle just above the ground, held only by his embrace. He seems to be teasing you."
    "伍尔顿的呼声从你身后传来，他温暖的呼吸让你耳痒，因为你只靠着他的拥抱在地上晃动，他似乎在取笑你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_0673bed7:

    # e "I thought I was safe..."
    e "我以为我是安全的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_1d527267:

    # "Your protests only make Wuldon chuckle, a sensation you hear and feel with your whole body at this proximity."
    "你的抗议活动只会让伍尔顿沉睡一种感官你听到和感受与你整个身体在这种近距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c5135d9e:

    # w "Nowhere is safe, little one. Why would my house be?"
    w "没有地方是安全的，小家伙为什么我家会是？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_bb90b467:

    # "As he says this, he lifts you a bit so you can properly get up on your feet, letting go of you when you find your balance."
    "正如他说的，他举起你一点这样你就可以正常站起来，让你在找到平衡时放手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_19916987:

    # e "Because you're there."
    e "因为你在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_bbae1685:

    # "Wuldon raises an eyebrow at you, trying to look skeptical. It fails to hide the content look on his face."
    "伍尔顿对你眉目一亮，试图看似怀疑。它没有隐藏他脸上的内容表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f8e0e008:

    # w "Well, I'm glad you trust me that much. Can't promise I can keep you safe from everything, but..."
    w "我很高兴你这么信任我不能保证能保护你的安全但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c962eab4:

    # "Wuldon's ear wiggles slightly. He seems... embarrassed? It's a bit hard to tell, as he turns around and starts heading home."
    "伍尔顿的耳朵稍微扭动了一下他好像……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_52d67375:

    # w "I'll try."
    w "我试看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_635efb77:

    # "He doesn't turn around, or make any particular motion when he says that, but you can't help but believe him."
    "他不会转身，也不会做任何特别动议当他说，但你不能不相信他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_bd1661fc:

    # e "I know."
    e "我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c09d6386:

    # "You walk after him, nearing the house in the distance once more. You can definitely tell that Wuldon is a lot happier now than when you first met him."
    "你跟着他走离房子又近了一步绝对可以看出沃尔登现在比第一次遇见他时快乐多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_1c497f2f:

    # "Suddenly, you feel a strong tug on your horns."
    "突然间，你感觉自己被强力拉着喇叭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_57aaa9e0:

    # w "Convenient little handlebars you got there, little one."
    w "轻巧的小把手杆你在那里，小一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_34890fda:

    # "Wuldon drops down from above you, a faint grin on his face."
    "伍尔顿从你上方掉下来脸上有微弱的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_18cf368d:

    # w "You really do need to get better at looking out for danger at all times."
    w "你真的需要更好地注意出危险随时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f1f59586:

    # "The big werewolf immediately starts walking towards his house."
    "大狼人马上走向他家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_54e03736:

    # e "What if I don't want to spend all of my time on edge, and just relax every once in a while."
    e "如果我不想把时间都花在悬崖上偶尔放松一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_5baca164:

    # "You hear Wuldon chuckle, a hollow thing void of mirth."
    "你听到伍尔顿的笑声，一个空洞的东西，没有欢乐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4c3d15a0:

    # w "If you want to die, be my guest."
    w "如果你想死，请便。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f2ff0ec3:

    # "You follow after Wuldon after a moment of thought."
    "你经过一小会儿的思考之后跟着沃尔登之后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_5b227168:

    # e "Do you really care so little?"
    e "你真的那么不在乎吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_a327d98d:

    # "Wuldon doesn't turn around, but he shakes his head slightly."
    "沃尔登不会转身，但他摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f4d11571:

    # w "No, but it's your life. I'll try to help, as thanks for helping Vurro, but I won't live your life for you."
    w "不，但这是你的生活我会尽力帮助你，谢你们帮助伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8b7a3d17:

    # "You keep walking a bit."
    "你继续走一点路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4c1d2ba8:

    # e "I guess we'd both be miserable if you did."
    e "我想如果你这么做我们都会很惨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_9131594c:

    # "You get no response other than a nod."
    "你除了点头别无回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_1859612c:

    # "The two of you have gotten quite near the entrance at this point, and the closer you get, the louder the background noise you've been hearing for a while now."
    "你们两个已经接近入口了越近了听到的噪音越大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_6af1ad26:

    # "It's something of a deep dull ringing, pausing briefly for irregular intervals."
    "这是很无聊的铃声，短暂的不定期的暂停。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_2275a371:

    # "You think about asking Wuldon about it, but he seems to be completely unaffected."
    "你想问伍尔顿这件事但他似乎完全没有受到影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_5a72b6bb:

    # "As the two of you reach the door, you find out where the sound is coming from."
    "你们两个一到门前就会知道声音来自哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_382653fe:

    # "As Wuldon opens the door, the ringing turns to a roar, as the sounds of Vurro snoring fill the forest."
    "当伍尔顿打开门时铃声变成咆哮当伏罗的呼喊声席卷森林时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_acc7be44:

    # e "Did he always snore this loudly?!"
    e "他总是这么大声打呼噜吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_090fc423:

    # "Wuldon taps his ear to signal that he can't hear you, and beckons for you to follow him inside."
    "伍尔顿窃听他的耳朵发出他听不到你的声音的信号让你跟着他进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_7d8adf4d:

    # "Going in, the two of you find a heap of fur and blankets on the bed, which you can only assume to be Vurro."
    "你们俩进去时在床上发现一堆毛皮和毛毯你们只能假设是伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_ae6b0e54:

    # "Just as you consider asking if you should leave, Wuldon walks up to the bed, and rips off all of the covers at once."
    "就像你考虑问你是否应该离开一样沃尔登走到床上立刻撕掉所有盖子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_42ec416d:

    # "Vurro, tucked away as he was within the comfortable confines of his blanket-den, falls onto the floor, rotating slightly from the sheer force of Wuldon's tug."
    "伏罗 躲在毛毯盖的舒适地带 摔倒在地上 从沃尔登拖船的纯力中 稍稍旋转一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_783cf7d7:

    # "Vurro continues to sleep, his face now smushed against the floor."
    "伏罗继续睡觉,现在脸被压在地板上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_69102832:

    # "Wuldon lets out an inaudible sigh of frustration, the only sound occupying the air being the loud snoring of the lithe brown werewolf."
    "伍尔顿释放出令人难以置信的挫折感，空气中唯一的声音是棕色狼人的喉咙响亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e0905acd:

    # "He heads over to a small cabinet on the far wall, and grabs a small container off of it. The contents appear to be a grainy black paste of some form."
    "他朝远墙上的一个小柜子走去，拿起一个小容器。里面的东西好像是某种形态的黑糊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_ea96cbb7:

    # "Wuldon moves the container next to Vurro's nose, and uncorks it."
    "伍尔顿把容器移到伏罗鼻子旁边,解开它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_05d249d6:

    # "A smell like burnt flesh mixed with rotten tomatoes and spoiled milk fills the air, hitting you like a punch to the gut."
    "闻起来像烧焦的肉和腐烂的西红柿和腐烂的牛奶充斥着空气，打你像一拳直肠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_aefd96c3:

    # "Wuldon was clearly prepared, as he was visibly holding his breath, ready to pop the cork back in at any moment."
    "伍尔顿已经做好了明确的准备，因为他明显地屏住呼吸，随时准备把软木塞倒回。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_087016b3:

    # "The person who took it the worst out of all of you, though, is Vurro."
    "最糟糕的是你们中最坏的人是伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_0b715e3f:

    # "The brown werewolf immediately begins coughing violently, eyes flashing open as his body moves to scramble away from the vile smell."
    "棕色狼人立刻开始用暴力咳嗽，眼睛睁开，当他的身体移动起来，从肮脏的气味上冲走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_dc4cb853:

    # w "Awake now?"
    w "现在醒了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f236a040:

    # "His voice is teasing, but also... sad?"
    "他的声音是开玩笑的，但是…… 悲伤？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_6266cb5e:

    # v "Fuck, yes, I'm awake."
    v "操，是的，我醒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_52180dd7:

    # v "Please, never do that again."
    v "请永远不要这样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8c56ef8f:

    # "All he gets is a shrug, as Wuldon recorks the bottle, and begins moving it back to its shelf."
    "他得到的只是一股沙发伍尔顿收回瓶子开始把它搬回货架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_225b08fc:

    # w "It worked. It's getting harder and harder to wake you up, you know."
    w "起作用了，越来越难吵醒你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_b34991be:

    # "At that, all of the energy in Vurro's body dissipates into defeated acceptance."
    "在那之后伏罗体内的所有能量都消散为失败的接受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4ff31a37:

    # v "I know."
    v "我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_161fc0ef:

    # "No one speaks. All you can hear are the clinks of containers being moved around."
    "没人会说话，你只能听到集装箱被移动的环形环绕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8592345b:

    # "Silence is normal with Wuldon, but right now it hangs over the three of you, draping you in a smog that threatens to suffocate you."
    "温顿的沉默是正常的但现在它挂在你们三个身上把你用烟雾吞噬威胁要窒息你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c373677e:

    # "You try to stomach it for a little while, but break under the pressure."
    "你试着忍耐一下，但打破压力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_36ee97ae:

    # e "Okay, what are the two of you talking about? Please be a little less cryptic."
    e "好吧，你们两个在说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_9c77f6e0:

    # "Both Vurro and Wuldon sigh, breaking the uncomfortable silence."
    "伏罗和伍尔顿都叹气 打破了不舒服的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4a8a8bab:

    # v "I've been sleeping longer and longer, deeper and deeper as time goes on."
    v "我睡得越久越深越好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c60f1765:

    # v "We're both pretty sure it means the curse is coming back. We don't have definitive proof, but it's a feeling. Doesn't help that my claws have started growing out again."
    v "我们都很肯定，这说明诅咒又回来了。我们没有确凿的证据，但这是一种感觉。我的爪子又开始长出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_39f00634:

    # "Just as he says, his body is starting to change ever so slightly - his teeth larger, claws sharper, eyes just a bit more animalistic."
    "正如他说的，他的身体开始变得如此轻微 - 他的牙齿更大，爪子更锋利，眼睛只是有点动物主义。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e05ecd89:

    # w "It's also that we know it's going to come back. Haskell said as much."
    w "我们也知道它会回来哈斯克尔也这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_5339a5e6:

    # "Wuldon's voice is clipped and terse, frustration written across his face when you turn to look."
    "沃尔登的声音被剪断了当你转过来看时他脸上写着挫折感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c13efed6:

    # "A short silence falls again, far less intense than the last."
    "短暂的沉默再次降临，比过去少得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_d23db096:

    # e "I take it you finished reading the journal?"
    e "我猜你读完日记了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_dd6c8b35:

    # v "Yes. It was nice to catch up on everything that's happened."
    v "是的很高兴能赶上一切发生的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8fdf4b47:

    # v "It's definitely made me reach a few decisions I wouldn't have otherwise."
    v "肯定让我做出了一些决定否则我就不会做出这些决定了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_73c9328c:

    # "Unlike Wuldon, Vurro seems to have accepted his death, fists clenched and eyebrows furrowed in grim determination. His eyes pierce through you, the kindly werewolf from before, seemingly gone."
    "与沃尔登不同的是，伏罗似乎接受了他的死亡、拳头紧和眉毛的阴暗决心。他的眼睛穿透了你，从以前起就善良的狼人，似乎消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_23891ccb:

    # v "I'll be needing your help for a lot of this."
    v "我需要你的帮助这么多的这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_00b2da8a:

    # v "You'll come with Wuldon and I, and help him put me down if I turn. I don't want him to have to deal with that alone."
    v "你跟我和沃尔登一起来如果我转身了帮他把我放下来我不想让他一个人处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_661f0418:

    # "You gulp nervously, giving the werewolf a small nod."
    "你紧张得要命给狼人点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_ce94a3e3:

    # e "I'd rather it not come to that, but I'll help if it does."
    e "我宁可不要这样但我会帮忙的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c50b63c0:

    # "Vurro's face breaks out into a sunny smile."
    "伏罗的脸露出一个阳光灿烂的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_0000f483:

    # v "Wonderful! I also just wanted to have you along. A friend of Wuldon's is a friend of mine after all!"
    v "棒极了，我还想跟你在一起沃尔登的朋友毕竟是我朋友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_b254cb76:

    # "You turn to look at the bigger werewolf. He has one hand against his head, rubbing his forehead slightly, as if nursing a headache."
    "你转过身去看更大的狼人，他头上有一只手，轻地擦前额，好像在头痛中哺乳一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_2263bbfe:

    # w "You could have just told him that from the beginning."
    w "你可以从一开始就告诉他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f31de05a:

    # v "Yes, but then it'd be less fun!"
    v "是的，但那样就不好玩了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_5fd334a3:

    # "Vurro's face sobers up a little again."
    "伏罗的脸又清醒了一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_d5efb6e8:

    # v "Well, that, and I wanted to be sure you were ready for the possibility that you'd have to kill me out there."
    v "嗯，那个，我想确定你已经准备好有可能你不得不杀了我在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_5f97416f:

    # "It's uncomfortable, but you have been aware this entire time that Vurro could change at any moment, and the two of you would have to put him down on the spot."
    "这很不舒服，但你一直都知道伏罗随时可能改变你们两个必须把他当场干掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_d7024ddd:

    # e "Is there anything you need me for in particular?"
    e "有什么特别需要我帮忙的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_39bdc25c:

    # v "Well, one thing is that I want to finish exploring the caves I turned feral in."
    v "嗯，有一件事是，我想完成探索洞穴，我转身大便进入。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c329a88f:

    # v "My nose has gotten better since I turned, and from what I can tell, a new area should have opened up with the front of the cave collapsing."
    v "我转过身，鼻子已经好起来了从我所知道的，一个新的区域应该已经打开随着洞穴前门崩塌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8cdf8487:

    # v "If the scent is to be trusted, the new area should be extremely rich in metals. That should hopefully open up our future in trading once more."
    v "如果气味值得信任，新区应该拥有丰富的金属。希望这能打开我们未来再次交易的大门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_988b9c45:

    # e "Well, first Uffe has to let that happen. I don't think he's going to roll over and let you do what you want."
    e "首先，乌菲得让这件事发生我不认为他会翻身让你做你想做的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_fc7bb64f:

    # "Vurro pauses briefly, scanning your face for a moment."
    "伏罗短暂的暂停, 扫描你的脸片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8ee0da89:

    # v "Well, that brings me to my next point. It's okay if you refuse to go with me to the caves. The caves don't need to be reopened now, and Wuldon will know about them after my death."
    v "好吧，这让我想到我的下一点。如果你拒绝和我一起去洞穴，那没关系。这些洞穴现在不需要重新开放，在我死后，沃尔登会知道它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_1a7a19e3:

    # v "What I do need you to do for me, is help me kill my brother."
    v "我需要你帮我杀了我弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_09891bdf:

    # "That does solve the issue of Uffe refusing to let the werewolves become mercantile. Still, you didn't really think he'd be asking you to kill the man out of the blue like this."
    "这确实解决了乌菲拒绝让狼人变成商品的问题。但你并不认为他会要求你这么突然地杀死那个男人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_1cad5d40:

    # e "O-oh. Any reason you need me for that in particular?"
    e "你特别需要我做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_dfd549e8:

    # "Vurro shrugs."
    "伏罗耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f32af664:

    # v "Three versus an entire tribe is bad odds for us, but two versus an entire tribe is substantially worse."
    v "三对一整个部落对我们来说是坏的几率，但两对一整个部落是严重得多的更糟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8789cc3c:

    # v "Plus, I have some plans for doing it that involve you."
    v "另外，我还有些计划要让你参与进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_82b54921:

    # "Uffe is pretty awful, but does he really deserve to die? Your potential role in making it come to pass feels... guilty."
    "乌菲很可怕，但他真的该死吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c1d6b5e5:

    # e "Why would I help you kill him though? I understand removing him from power, but killing him?"
    e "我理解他被从权力中夺去，但杀了他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_cf1b6299:

    # "Vurro gives you an approving nod, seemingly happy with your reticence to kill."
    "伏罗给了你一个批准点头, 似乎很高兴你对杀人的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_b8a8390d:

    # v "Look what happened the last time I let him live. He'll keep climbing his way to the top no matter what, no matter what he has to break."
    v "不管发生什么，不管他要打破什么他都会一直爬到顶端。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c933cd15:

    # v "I'm pretty confident he's been looking for a good opportunity to make you disappear without drawing attention to his pack for a while now."
    v "我很有信心他一直在寻找一个好机会让你消失而不引起注意他的背包现在一段时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4ad8c020:

    # "A shiver crawls down your spine."
    "一股颤抖的气息从你的脊椎上爬下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_64e6d457:

    # e "Still... that's your own brother, no?"
    e "还是…… 那是你亲兄弟，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_13239d7a:

    # "Vurro winces at the accusation."
    "伏罗对指控的迷彩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_89bbcc18:

    # v "Yes. We share blood, and I did love him at one point."
    v "是的，我们有血，我确实爱过他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_03a802ea:

    # v "He threw all of that away the day our father died. He tried to kill me not thirty minutes after finding out."
    v "父亲去世那天他扔掉了所有的东西他想在发现后不到30分钟就杀了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_2dd145a5:

    # "You feel pretty uncomfortable after hearing that. It seems everyone else is in a similar mood, Vurro not looking you in the eyes, and Wuldon turned around, organizing medicine jars."
    "听说后你感觉很不舒服。似乎其他人都心情相似，伏罗不看你的眼睛，沃尔登转过身去，组织医药罐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_64c39b7a:

    # e "Well... I trust that killing Uffe is not a decision you would reach easily."
    e "我相信杀乌菲不是你能轻易达成的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_a1352d39:

    # e "I'll help you with both of the things you've mentioned... better to do them while you're still around to see it."
    e "我会帮你处理你提到的两件事…… 趁你还在的时候更好地做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_277a42ed:

    # "Vurro gives you a grateful smile."
    "伏罗给了你一个感恩的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_df5ec6e9:

    # v "Thank you, [e]. I appreciate it more than you could know."
    v "谢你[e]我很感激你所知道的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_2b806476:

    # v "Wuldon might not be saying much, but I'm sure he appreciates your help greatly as well."
    v "伍尔顿可能没说什么但我肯定他也很感激你的帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_2dff1884:

    # "Looking over at Wuldon, you see that he still isn't looking your way."
    "看着沃尔登，你看他仍然没有看你的方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_3f49bcfd:

    # "Further down his back, however, you see his tail wagging slightly."
    "但是他的尾巴在背部往下滑你看见他的尾巴稍滑动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_df25f05c:

    # "It seems the big guy is really happy to have you along."
    "看来大块头真的很高兴有你陪着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e5da0a10:

    # "You turn back to Vurro, who's looking at you with a knowing smile."
    "你回到伏罗身边,他带着微笑看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4d11c6c4:

    # "It seems he can somehow tell you're looking at him anyways, though, as he immediately begins speaking."
    "他似乎可以分辨出你反正在看着他因为他马上开始说话了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_7180372e:

    # w "Yes, I do. You are someone I always seem to be able to rely on."
    w "是的，我愿意，你是我一直以来都能够信赖的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_13a425d3:

    # "There's a small pause."
    "有一个小暂停。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_11530b28:

    # w "I will find a way to pay it back."
    w "我会想办法还的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4b0d835e:

    # "You turn your head to look at Vurro again, who's rolling his eyes."
    "你转过头来再看一眼伏罗，他正在转动他的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_1c54317d:

    # v "Not every relationship is transactional. People can do things for you expecting nothing in return."
    v "并不是每一段关系都是交易的人们可以为你做一些事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_ec2e91ec:

    # "He gets no response. Shaking his head, Vurro stage-whispers to you."
    "他没有反应向你摇头和伏罗的舞台低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f76d96d7:

    # v "This is why he's alone all the time, he sucks at letting people know that he's happy to help regardless of if you help him."
    v "这就是为什么他总是孤单，让人知道他很高兴帮助他不论你是否帮助他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4a9eb651:

    # "Thwap."
    "Thwap。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_bf096087:

    # "A carrot bounces off of Vurro's skull, falling in between the two of you."
    "胡萝卜从伏罗的头骨上弹下来 掉进你们两个之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_62ebea3a:

    # w "Oops. My hand slipped."
    w "哎呀，我的手滑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_0984e804:

    # "Vurro picks up the carrot and throws it at Wuldon, who still hasn't turned around."
    "伏罗拿起胡萝卜 扔到伍尔顿,他还没有转身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_0d5cd9b9:

    # "Just as he does this, Wuldon bends down to grab a jar from a lower cabinet, the carrot sailing over him, where his head just was."
    "就像他这么做一样，沃尔登弯下腰从下层的柜子手里拿一个罐子，胡萝卜在他身上漂浮，他的头就在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f0e9e615:

    # "Vurro turns back to you."
    "伏罗回到你身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_02d33385:

    # v "As I was saying, thank you for offering to help."
    v "正如我所说，谢你主动提出帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8ab8b1ec:

    # v "We'll be heading out soon with some buckets, pickaxes, and food."
    v "我们很快就要出发了带一些桶子皮克斯和食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e8ffb617:

    # v "If you have anything you need to go do, please hurry and do so. We will depart once you get back."
    v "如果你有什么需要去做的，请快点做，等你回来，我们就会离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_3ddc5df7:

    # w "Assuming we aren't asleep."
    w "假设我们没睡着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_fa20a3ac:

    # "Vurro winces."
    "伏罗皱了皱眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4e16f1df:

    # v "Please don't use the jar again."
    v "请不要再使用罐子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e944d411:

    # "All he gets is a snort from Wuldon."
    "他只得到来自伍尔顿的鼻涕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_60043759:

    # "Vurro looks at Wuldon a moment longer, concern creasing his features. After he sees that Wuldon isn't joking, he turns to you."
    "伏罗更长时间地看伍尔顿, 担心他的特点。他发现伍尔顿不是开玩笑,然后转过身来找你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_277b1569:

    # v "Well, you heard the man. Please hurry."
    v "你听到他说的了，请快点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_128d81c7:

    # e "I don't really know if I have the time to help with either of those things..."
    e "我不知道我有没有时间来帮助那些东西……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_063d3473:

    # "As you say this, Wuldon's ear twitches violently. The big wolf turns towards you, face schooled into neutrality."
    "就像你说的，沃尔登的耳朵抽动很激烈大狼朝你转过来，面对着中立。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_0a79c6c0:

    # "Despite his best efforts, however, you can see the disappointment in his eyes."
    "尽管他尽了最大努力，但你可以看到他眼中的失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4e83eb68:

    # w "I understand if you can't, but it would be nice to have you there with us."
    w "如果你不能，我理解，但这将是很好的有你和我们在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_7e3ca70f:

    # msg "Continuing with this decision will likely decrease Wuldon's affection for you drastically. Do you still wish to reject Vurro's petition for help?" nointeract
    msg "继续这一决定可能会大降低沃尔登对你的兴趣。你还想拒绝伏罗的求助请求吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_09ec4630:

    # e "I really can't help you, sorry."
    e "我真的帮不了你，对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_ed586511:

    # "Vurro's face wears a small frown now, rather than the smile of before."
    "伏罗的脸现在有点皱纹了 而不是之前的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_57196296:

    # v "Unfortunate."
    v "不幸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c0b91cd2:

    # v "I completely understand. We will not hold it against you."
    v "我完全理解，我们不会反对你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_c9d10a6a:

    # v "I will, however, ask you to reconsider your refusal to kill Uffe. If you don't help us kill him, or kill him on your own, he'll kill you someday soon."
    v "不过，我还是要请你重新考虑你拒绝杀乌菲的问题如果你不帮我们杀死他，或者你一个人杀了他，他很快就会杀了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_55cc0e3c:

    # e "...how can you be so sure?"
    e "……你怎么能这么肯定？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_ddda255e:

    # v "Let's just say I know my brother."
    v "这么说吧，我认识我哥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_a3fe8c32:

    # w "And also that I've heard him boast about how he'll gut you to his lieutenants."
    w "我也听说他夸其谈他会如何将你送进他的中尉身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_43dc9c51:

    # "That's... well, it's not entirely unexpected, but it's certainly disturbing."
    "这…… 嗯，这并非完全出乎意料，但确实令人不安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_7d36b523:

    # e "And why hasn't he done it yet?"
    e "为什么他还没做呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4da839df:

    # "Wuldon gives you a shrug."
    "伍尔顿给了你一记尖锐的拳头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_9ed30724:

    # w "Uffe likes fighting, but not war. He knows that if he kills you while the goats or village know you're in here, they'll come and attack him."
    w "乌菲喜欢战斗，但不喜欢战争，他知道如果他杀了你而山羊或村庄知道你在这里，他们就会来攻击他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_5c94519a:

    # e "So he's waiting for the day I leave without telling anyone?"
    e "所以他等着我离开的那一天没告诉任何人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_70369b0f:

    # "Wuldon gives you a nod."
    "伍尔顿给你点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_b7f64fc2:

    # w "That, and waiting for your scent trails near both locations to grow old enough that they can't trace you back to us."
    w "等你的气味踪迹靠近两个地点长大到足以让人无法追踪到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_0b80502c:

    # v "Though he's not omniscient, my brother knows how to do things like this."
    v "虽然他不是无所不知我哥知道怎么做这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_f11eabf9:

    # v "Using your scent to figure out how long it's been since you visited either place is good enough for him."
    v "利用你的气味来弄清楚你多久没去过任何一处都足够适合他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_5725326c:

    # v "When that day comes, he will lunge for your throat, with no hesitation."
    v "当那日来临的时候，他将毫不犹豫地为你而跳入你的喉咙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_9d1366a1:

    # "If it's really you or him, it might be necessary to kill him after all."
    "如果真的是你还是他可能还是有必要杀了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4dfc27cb:

    # e "Fine. You'll have my help when the time comes for you to kill Uffe."
    e "好吧，等你杀了乌菲的时候你就会得到我的帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_31ac1543:

    # e "I'm still not going to help you with the exploration. The last time I went into a cave, it almost killed me."
    e "上次我进洞穴的时候差点就死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_a9254682:

    # e "If there's nobody that needs saving in there, I think I'll pass."
    e "如果里面没人需要救的话我想我会过关的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_82ec872a:

    # "Vurro nods at that."
    "伏罗点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_367f6342:

    # v "Fair enough."
    v "有道理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e8aa321f:

    # v "Wuldon and I are probably going to try and scout out a little bit on our own, though not nearly as far as we'd go otherwise."
    v "伍尔顿和我可能要尝试和侦察出一点我们自己，虽然不远到我们去否则。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_d4b2fc81:

    # v "We need to plan for that though, so... please come back and talk to us about our plan for taking down Uffe in a few days, alright?"
    v "我们得计划一下，所以…… 请回来跟我们谈我们几天后要干掉乌菲的计划，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e8949abc:

    # "Wuldon waves at you with a gruff g'bye, quickly returning to his job organizing the jars."
    "伍尔顿粗声向你道别，随后迅速回去整理罐子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_55ebea00:

    # "Taking your queue, you head out of Wuldon's house."
    "排队，你从沃尔登家出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_a5e322bc:

    # "Sighing, you turn to face Vurro."
    "叹息，你转身面对伏罗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_64c39b7a_1:

    # e "Well... I trust that killing Uffe is not a decision you would reach easily."
    e "我相信杀乌菲不是你能轻易达成的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_a1352d39_1:

    # e "I'll help you with both of the things you've mentioned... better to do them while you're still around to see it."
    e "我会帮你处理你提到的两件事…… 趁你还在的时候更好地做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_63f2fb15:

    # "Vurro gives you a grateful smile. You catch a glimpse of a similar expression on Wuldon's face before he turns back around to continue working with the jars."
    "伏罗给了你一个感恩的微笑。你可以看到在伍尔顿转过身去继续和罐子一起工作之前,他脸上也有类似的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_df5ec6e9_1:

    # v "Thank you, [e]. I appreciate it more than you could know."
    v "谢你[e]我很感激你所知道的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_2b806476_1:

    # v "Wuldon might not be saying much, but I'm sure he appreciates your help greatly as well."
    v "伍尔顿可能没说什么但我肯定他也很感激你的帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4fabee3d:

    # "Looking over at Wuldon, you see that he isn't looking your way at the moment."
    "看着沃尔登，你看他现在没看你的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_3f49bcfd_1:

    # "Further down his back, however, you see his tail wagging slightly."
    "但是他的尾巴在背部往下滑你看见他的尾巴稍滑动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_2a061b27:

    # "It seems the big guy is really happy to have you along, far more than he let on earlier."
    "看来大块头真的很高兴有你陪着比他早些时候多得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e5da0a10_1:

    # "You turn back to Vurro, who's looking at you with a knowing smile."
    "你回到伏罗身边,他带着微笑看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_02d33385_1:

    # v "As I was saying, thank you for offering to help."
    v "正如我所说，谢你主动提出帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_8ab8b1ec_1:

    # v "We'll be heading out soon with some buckets, pickaxes, and food."
    v "我们很快就要出发了带一些桶子皮克斯和食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e8ffb617_1:

    # v "If you have anything you need to go do, please hurry and do so. We will depart once you get back."
    v "如果你有什么需要去做的，请快点做，等你回来，我们就会离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_3ddc5df7_1:

    # w "Assuming we aren't asleep."
    w "假设我们没睡着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_fa20a3ac_1:

    # "Vurro winces."
    "伏罗皱了皱眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_4e16f1df_1:

    # v "Please don't use the jar again."
    v "请不要再使用罐子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_e944d411_1:

    # "All he gets is a snort from Wuldon."
    "他只得到来自伍尔顿的鼻涕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_60043759_1:

    # "Vurro looks at Wuldon a moment longer, concern creasing his features. After he sees that Wuldon isn't joking, he turns to you."
    "伏罗更长时间地看伍尔顿, 担心他的特点。他发现伍尔顿不是开玩笑,然后转过身来找你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Vurro_Mine_Quest_277b1569_1:

    # v "Well, you heard the man. Please hurry."
    v "你听到他说的了，请快点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_4fa20c4d:

    # "You finally make it out of the slime chambers."
    "你终于能从史莱姆室里出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_f052ff54:

    # "Your body is covered in mildly acidic goo. You could kill for a bucket of water right about now."
    "你的身体被酸性微软的阴茎覆盖你可以为了一桶水而杀人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_888da336:

    # w "Nice job in there - hopefully you got everything you needed from there, because I don't know of any other spots where big ones swarm together like that."
    w "干得漂亮 -希望你从那里得到了你需要的一切因为我不知道其他任何地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_c88fbc9a:

    # "You reach into your pocket and pull out 3 vials."
    "你伸手伸进口袋拿出三个瓶子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_ba40db9c:

    # "You have one filled with deep green goo, more viscous than molasses, which should be the teratoid mucus."
    "你有一个充满深绿色谷类，粘度比糖浆还要高，这应该就是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_7e4d514b:

    # "The second has a far more liquid ooze in it, bright green and hollow in the middle, the goo clung to the side of the glass, ignoring gravity from the moment you put it in there. Flagitous ooze, at a guess."
    "第二个是液溶液多得多，中间是亮绿色和空洞的，谷歌向玻璃的侧斜，忽略了从你放进去的那一刻开始的引力。引人瞩目的卵，猜测。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_cdbdc8f7:

    # "The last of the three vials is empty aside from a bright green crystal the size of your thumb. If this isn't the grancrystal, you may as well give up on guessing anything ever again."
    "三个瓶子中最后一个瓶子是空的，除了你拇指大小的明亮绿晶体之外。如果这不是颗粒晶体，你也许应该放弃再猜一次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_9b8b8d18:

    # e "Yeah, I think this is everything."
    e "是的，我想这是一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_a2dbefd4:

    # w "Perfect. You ready to head back and cure Vurro?" nointeract
    w "太好了，你准备好回去治疗武洛了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_4eba447b:

    # e "Yeah, we should do that as soon as possible."
    e "是的，我们应该尽快这样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_edfbe8f2:

    # w "Definitely. Let's just hope it works."
    w "当然，希望它能成功。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_4ffef6cc:

    # "The two of you begin walking towards Wuldon's home."
    "你们俩开始走向伍尔顿的家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_75328a16:

    # e "Thank you for standing guard by the way."
    e "感谢您在路上站岗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_e5f7496a:

    # w "No problem. It's the least I could do for all the help you've given us. Doesn't even begin to cover the debt I owe you."
    w "⊿拜肈硂琌и程腊腊иㄆ ⊿Τ秨_и临欠债。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_70399c3f:

    # "There's a small while of silence between the two of you."
    "你们两个之间有一段沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_a9df192e:

    # e "You know you don't owe me anything, yeah?"
    e "你知道你什么都不欠我，是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_52c8a2ab:

    # w "I disagree, but if you don't want to call it debt, then it barely contributes to how much I want to help you in return."
    w "我不同意，但如果你不想称之为债务，那么它几乎不能促进我多么想帮助你作为回报。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_b4a786cc:

    # "You get the feeling he's not going to back down on this issue."
    "你感觉他不会在这个问题上退缩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_4b491cb1:

    # "Staying quiet, the two of you make your way home."
    "保持安静，你们两个让你回家的路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_231adaaa:

    # "Arriving at Wuldon's house, you hear a faint scrabbling sound."
    "来到伍尔顿家你听到微弱的尖叫声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_3cff9747:

    # "It seems the two of you took a bit too long. That or the sedatives have stopped working as they should."
    "看来你们两个花的时间太长了不然镇静剂就停止工作了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_094fbe6c:

    # w "Sounds like we need to make that cure as soon as we can."
    w "听起来我们需要尽快治愈这种疾病。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_64626d19:

    # "You nod, agreeing wholeheartedly."
    "你点头，全心全意地同意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_c5c5e57a:

    # e "Do you have a Mortar and Pestle anywhere?"
    e "哪里有迫击炮和佩斯特雷？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_c2c5efbb:

    # w "Yes, come with me."
    w "是的，跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_4f18c28a:

    # e "No, sorry, I'm not quite ready to do that yet."
    e "不，对不起，我还没有准备好这样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_b85c38d0:

    # w "Alright, well, I'll keep Vurro pacified until you're ready."
    w "好吧，好吧，我会保持伏罗的平静直到你准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_3572be24:

    # e "Why not just heal Vurro while I'm not there?"
    e "为什么我不在时不治好武洛呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_133c67de:

    # "Wuldon once again has a complicated expression on his face."
    "伍尔顿脸上的表情又变得复杂了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_d01eb253:

    # w "You've done a lot to help him, and... we don't know how long the cure will last."
    w "你帮了他很多我们不知道解药能持续多久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_fb39060a:

    # w "I want you to at least meet him, and him meet you."
    w "我要你至少见他，他见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_1bccfa9f:

    # "A short silence hangs between the two of you."
    "你们两个之间短暂的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_c3489153:

    # w "It would be sad if neither of you got to know the other."
    w "如果你们都不认识对方那会很伤心的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_0d04128e:

    # w "..."
    w "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_d8437106:

    # e "Alright. I'll come over as soon as I can, okay?"
    e "好吧，我会尽快过来，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_70369b0f:

    # "Wuldon gives you a nod."
    "伍尔顿给你点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_327bf399:

    # w "Take as much time as you need. We have the cure now, and I trust you to come back eventually."
    w "需要多少时间就花多少时间，我们现在有解药了我相信你最终会回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_979cd215:

    # w "Good luck with whatever it is you're doing."
    w "祝你好运无论你在做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_d43dab48:

    # e "Thank you, and good luck with Vurro."
    e "谢，祝你和伏罗好运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Enter_Cure_Transition_057da376:

    # "You both nod at each other, and go your separate ways for now."
    "你们俩互相点头分开走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d118f886:

    # "Searching through the fields for a while, you struggle to find him."
    "在田野里搜寻一段时间你努力寻找他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_fb25cb4d:

    # "You'd think dark blue would be hard to hide in a sea of light brown, but apparently you'd be wrong."
    "你会认为暗蓝色很难藏在浅棕色的海中但显然你错了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_26e96531:

    # e "I should probably just go and ask Jog to help me find him, even if it makes things a bit harder."
    e "我也许应该去叫约格帮我找到他即使这样事情就更难办了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_7551dccb:

    # "Giving up for now, you turn around, only to find yourself face to face with a cream colored wall of fur."
    "暂时放弃，你转过身来却发现自己面对着一面鲜花色的毛墙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_97192b0b:

    # w "Boo."
    w "Boo。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_6dc9a2b0:

    # "The wall, now identifiable as Wuldon, rushes downwards as he bends down to put his face close to yours."
    "墙现在可识别为沃尔登弯下腰往下倾斜将他的脸贴近你的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_055f587e:

    # w "Looking for something, little one?"
    w "找什么，小东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_9fa66dd1:

    # e "Y-yeah! I was looking for you!"
    e "是的，我在找你！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_6e72293f:

    # "Wuldon cracks a little smile."
    "沃尔登笑了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4f2dcb83:

    # w "Ooh, should I be worried? Has the little hero come here to put down the big bad wolf?"
    w "哦，我该担心吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_05f44d45:

    # "You roll your eyes."
    "你转动眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_e76e14ed:

    # e "As if. We both know you're harmless."
    e "好像我们都知道你是无害的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_ac6dc2a5:

    # "Wuldon stands up straight and steps back a bit, grinning."
    "伍尔顿站直身体，后退了一点，咧嘴笑着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_8612893a:

    # w "Maybe, but the farmers don't know that."
    w "也许吧，但农民不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_85a818a0:

    # "He turns to his right, to an inconspicuous patch of farmland."
    "他转向他的右手边，向着一块不显眼的农田。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_bc280295:

    # w "AND NEITHER DOES THE HYENA WATCHING FROM OVER THERE. I'VE HAD ENOUGH VOYEURISM FROM YOU, SHOO."
    w "我从你那里已经够多的了，肖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_8a5e3180:

    # "You hear a faint rustling sound, before a small area of wheat shifts."
    "你听到微弱的偷盗声在小麦变换之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_ef69fafe:

    # j "Aww, man, I thought I had you for sure this time."
    j "哦，伙计，我还以为这次我肯定有你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_225714ee:

    # "You and Wuldon both look at Jog for a little while, until he gets the hint and leaves you alone."
    "你和伍尔顿都看着乔格一阵子直到他得到暗示让你一个人待着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_46004353:

    # e "How do you keep doing that, anyways?"
    e "你怎么一直这样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_5de9c600:

    # w "Mm. He forgets that the natural dyes he uses have scents."
    w "他忘了他用的天然染料有气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_197413d7:

    # w "It's not exactly normal to smell a field's worth of crushed honeyberries."
    w "闻到田地上压碎的蜜莓是很不正常的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_048dc0cc:

    # e "Oh. I hadn't realized your nose was that sensitive."
    e "哦，我没想到你的鼻子这么敏感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_c36f1547:

    # e "None of the other werewolves have ever noticed him."
    e "其他狼人都没注意过他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_5a0d1501:

    # "A touch of pride enters Wuldon's face."
    "一点自尊感就进入了沃尔登的脸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_caa02c30:

    # w "That's because none of those idiots have bothered to learn the scents of anything other than animals."
    w "那是因为除了动物以外，那些白痴都没人去了解动物的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_902493ec:

    # "You lift an eyebrow in question."
    "你举起一个有争议的眉毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_e7af98ae:

    # e "So all the other werewolves are pure carnivores?"
    e "那么其他狼人是纯食肉动物？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_b726746e:

    # "A nod."
    "点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_09d5104b:

    # w "They only eat non-meats if they'll starve without them. Only my father, Vurro, and a couple others have really bothered to have diets with plants in them."
    w "他们只吃非肉类，如果没有它们，他们就会饿死。只有我父亲，伏罗，和另外几个人，确实非常想用植物来饮食。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_5755deb1:

    # e "Does that have anything to do with why you all are so different from the other werewolves?"
    e "这跟你们为什么和其他狼人有如此的不同有关吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4da839df:

    # "Wuldon gives you a shrug."
    "伍尔顿给了你一记尖锐的拳头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d945d392:

    # w "No idea. All I know is that some werewolves are just... born different - often with unnatural strength, intelligence, charisma, and so on."
    w "不知道，我所知道的只是一些狼人……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d4cb1943:

    # w "Some people... hm. {i}people{/i} is a strong word."
    w "有些人……嗯，{i}人{/i}这个词用得未免太重了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_07645f71:

    # w "Uffe thinks it's werewolves that are meant to lead, 'natural alphas'."
    w "乌菲认为是狼人注定要领头的，\"自然的阿尔法\"。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_7b99dadf:

    # "Considering the other werewolves, Uffe might not be entirely wrong for once."
    "考虑到其他狼人，乌菲可能不会是完全错误的一次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_1dec82cc:

    # e "I get what you're saying, but... the rest of the pack isn't particularly bright, no?"
    e "我明白你的意思，但是…… 剩下的人并不特别聪明，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_e4320b61:

    # "Wuldon looks at you, as if considering whether to give you a legitimate answer or not."
    "伍尔顿看着你好像考虑是否给你一个合理的答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_5bbebe01:

    # w "You're not wrong. It's something I've thought a lot about after seeing many of Vurro's loyal followers happily assimilate with Uffe."
    w "你没有错，这是在看到很多伏罗忠诚的追随者与乌夫同化后，我考虑过很多事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4118c7e0:

    # "He heaves a small sigh, and gives you a somewhat helpless smile."
    "让你笑得有点无助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_b93b3f42:

    # w "Still, I believe it should be based on merit or public support, not simply birthright."
    w "但我还是认为，它应该基于功劳或公众的支持，而不是单纯的生来权利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_265c5dbc:

    # e "Oh. That'll probably have the same end result, no?"
    e "哦，结果可能是一样的，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_7f3e851f:

    # w "Yes, but it is fairer - better for the pack to be able to choose between the two brothers, rather than have it decided by a fight."
    w "是的，但更公平，更适合两兄弟之间选择，而不是由战斗决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_7009bd05:

    # e "Fair point."
    e "公平点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_fa7d682b:

    # "Wuldon gives you a nod, content with that argument being sealed away."
    "沃尔登给你点头满足于这个论点被封存。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4c762c32:

    # "He doesn't say anything else, looking at you, as if expecting you to do something."
    "他对你一副眼神什么都不说好像期望你做点什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_035d66c0:

    # "An awkward silence falls between you."
    "你们之间出现了尴尬的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_0dc88690:

    # e "So, uhh. What are you gathering exactly?"
    e "那么，呃，你到底在收集什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a621ae80:

    # w "Nothing, right now."
    w "没什么，现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_b3eb6c4b:

    # "His face is completely deadpan. If he wasn't gathering, what was he doing?"
    "他的脸是完全枯萎的如果他没有集合，他在做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_9d2b8805:

    # e "Oh, I heard that you'd been cutting plants in the area, though not much beyond that. What are you doing in the area?"
    e "听说你一直在切植物，不过除了这个你还不知道？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_e7352590:

    # "Wuldon cracks a grin."
    "伍尔顿笑着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_3d069c17:

    # w "I'm here to gather some plants that grow around the area, or at least, I would be if a cute little dragon weren't taking up all of my time."
    w "我是来收集一些植物生长在附近，或者至少，如果一个可爱的小龙不占用我所有的时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_f434d0fd:

    # e "...okay. What plants are you {i}going{/i} to gather while you're here."
    e "……好吧。你在这里会{i}去{/i}采集哪些植物？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4e750733:

    # "Wuldon begins laughing."
    "沃尔登开始笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_19d8c2ec:

    # w "Tsk, tsk, tsk, little one. First you call the average werewolf dull, and then you fail to ask the right question? Not making a very good impression, are you."
    w "开始你叫一般狼人无聊，然后你又不问正确的问题？你没有给人留下好印象，是不是？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a5c03f7d:

    # "You smack your hand to your face."
    "你用手对着脸打。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a6e79723:

    # e "Fine. You don't know if you'll be able to gather them, I get it."
    e "好吧，你不知道你能否收集到它们，我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_fada4186:

    # e "Can we please just get to the part where you tell me the actual answer?"
    e "我们能不能直接说到你告诉我实际答案的部分？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_106cb881:

    # "Wuldon's uproarious laughter comes down to a lighthearted chuckle, waving his hand towards you in apology."
    "温登的愤怒笑声落到一个轻柔的笑柄上向你挥手道歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_025727fb:

    # w "Fine, fine, enough teasing. I'm here to collect medicine for Vurro, little one."
    w "好吧，好吧，别闹了，我来这里是为伏罗，小家伙收集药品的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_fcfc665c:

    # e "...Aren't you in a bit of a hurry then?"
    e "你不是有点匆忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_0f0b8b83:

    # "Wuldon lips form a weary smile."
    "沃尔登嘴唇形成疲惫的微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a945994d:

    # w "Yes, I suppose I am."
    w "是的，我想是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a162e114:

    # "He sighs, turning away from you to bend down and look through the grass underfoot."
    "他叹气了离你而去弯下腰穿过尺下草地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_118a21a4:

    # "You stand there for a while, watching him sift through the grass... expecting him to do something special or something."
    "你站在那里呆一阵子看着他从草地里搜出来期待他做一些特别的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_063325cd:

    # "Instead, he just keeps checking plant by plant for something, occasionally moving slightly forwards to get to a new patch of turf."
    "他只是不停地通过工厂检查工厂以寻找什么偶尔稍微向前移动以获得新的地盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_784c47c4:

    # e "Is... is that it?"
    e "是…… 是这样吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_549460fc:

    # "Wuldon looks over his shoulder briefly, before turning his head back down to the plants."
    "伍尔顿短暂地仰望他的肩膀然后再把头朝下转向植物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_7dd42144:

    # w "What do you mean?"
    w "你的意思是？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_dd102308:

    # e "Is this what the farmers have been so scared about?"
    e "这就是农民害怕的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_bccb624c:

    # w "Yeah."
    w "对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_400f1747:

    # e "But you're just looking through grass."
    e "但你只是从草丛里看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_eb7ae7c7:

    # w "Yup."
    w "是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_44dd97e8:

    # "Silence falls between you again."
    "沉默再次落在你们中间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_aac7712a:

    # e "Mind if I help?"
    e "介意我帮忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_67299f94:

    # "Wuldon pauses, before turning to look at you with a bemused expression."
    "沃尔登暂停了一下，然后转过身来用一个令人迷惑的表情来看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_68f6995e:

    # w "And here I thought you'd prefer to stare at my ass all day instead."
    w "我还以为你宁愿整天盯着我的屁股看呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_6bf0bbac:

    # "You blush red."
    "你脸红了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_86f8ec59:

    # w "Please, feel free to. We're looking for milkweed, a plant with an orb of pink flowers on top, with a green stalk that lets out thick white liquid when you squeeze it."
    w "请随意我们在找牛奶草上面有一团粉红色花的植物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d8e76839:

    # e "F-first of all, I wasn't staring at your ass."
    e "首先我没有盯着你的屁股看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d3e06838:

    # "You mutter the next bit to yourself, remembering your first meeting."
    "记得你第一次见面的时候自己唱下一首。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a5144efc:

    # e "not that I could pay your rates according to you."
    e "而不是我能按照你的要求支付你的工资。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4d0e5192:

    # "Wuldon's ear twitches slightly."
    "伍尔顿的耳电略微抽动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_6abe2d6b:

    # e "And second, are you pranking me about the thick white liquid? Because that sounds like the kind of joke you'd make."
    e "第二，你是不是在耍我说那些厚的白色液体？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_b7621db5:

    # "You hear a snort from the stout werewolf in front of you."
    "你听到在你面前的臭人狼的鼻涕声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_7b956178:

    # "You'd already been looking at it before, but now that he mentioned it, He really does have a nice ass."
    "你以前已经看过了但现在他提到过他屁股真的很漂亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4f48241a:

    # w "I'm not messing with you. Whatever you do, don't drink that fluid, or put it near your eyes - it's poisonous."
    w "我不是在耍你不管你做什么不要喝那个液体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_ad028415:

    # w "And for the other point, I'm going to ignore the first bit, and just tell you that ogling me is free of charge for a while. Flash sale."
    w "另一点，我将忽略第一点，告诉你，勾引我是免费的，一段时间。即时销售。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_b7f3ebda:

    # e "O-okay. I'll get to helping, I guess."
    e "好吧，我该去帮忙了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_7a1465a0:

    # "Wuldon just makes a short grunting noise to signal his satisfaction with this."
    "沃尔登只是发出一小声叫声来表示他对这个很满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_50134425:

    # "You and Wuldon carefully work side by side, checking for milkweed together."
    "你和沃尔登小心地并肩工作一起检查牛奶草。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_8ec75e25:

    # "Every once in a while one of you will find some and put it in one of the buckets Wuldon carries at his side."
    "偶尔你们中有人会找到一些把它放在伍尔顿身边的桶里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_b443d89e:

    # "After a long while, you hear Wuldon begin to hum happily to himself, a deep, rumbling noise, comforting in its warm timbre."
    "很久之后，你听到伍尔顿开始开心地向自己诉说，一个深沉的响声，在温暖的气息中安慰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a0420788:

    # "You continue your work together, picking through yards and yards of grass to Wuldon's tune."
    "你们继续一起工作从草地和草地上爬到沃尔登的旋律上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_693fd7a7:

    # "Eventually, you work up the courage to talk to him again."
    "最后，你鼓起勇气和他再谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_01c0dce1:

    # e "You know, I never really asked how you knew about the effects of Milkweed, or to come here to get it."
    e "你知道，我从没真正问过：你是怎么知道乳草的功效，又为什么会知道要来这里取它？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_df0d986c:

    # "The humming cuts off, leaving only the sounds of the rustling wheat around you."
    "蜂蜜被切断了只剩下你周围的偷牛的小麦的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_762b3fa7:

    # w "My father taught me."
    w "我父亲教我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_917b6c8d:

    # "His body language shifts to show that he is paying attention to you, despite continuing his work at the exact same pace as before."
    "他的身体语言变换表明他正在关注你，尽管他继续工作与以前一样的速度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_0f108792:

    # "Being with Wuldon like this sort of gives you time to think before you speak... he seems to take life at a somewhat slower pace, doing things at a slow but steady rhythm."
    "和沃尔登这样在一起让你在说话前有时间思考…… 他似乎以较慢的速度夺去生命以缓慢但稳定的节奏行事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4d835fb9:

    # "Because of that, it takes a bit before you speak."
    "因为这样，你说话需要一点时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_693eb049:

    # e "Was he like you? Like..."
    e "他跟你一样吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_8e52631a:

    # "You point at his fur and size."
    "你指向他的毛皮和大小。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_65fcb289:

    # w "Yes, though he was very much not a leader."
    w "是的，虽然他不是领袖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_140841d5:

    # "He sighs, thinking back to someone long gone."
    "他叹气了，回想着一个早已逝去的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_16a697f1:

    # w "He was as close to a doctor as the tribe ever had."
    w "他跟部落一样接近医生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_899d37aa:

    # "Steady quiet falls once more, as you think on how to respond."
    "静的静悄地再次倒下，当你思考如何应对的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d9a05e25:

    # e "Uffe doesn't really have a need for a doctor, does he. A need for you."
    e "乌菲不需要医生，他需要你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_239a39ff:

    # "For the first time, Wuldon shifts uncomfortably, and his pace slows significantly."
    "伍尔顿第一次发生令人不适的转变，他的步伐大放慢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_278edd6c:

    # w "I know nothing compared to my father. But no, Uffe has no need for learned men like him, especially one with a tendency to talk to other groups."
    w "与我父亲相比，我一无所知，但乌菲不需要像他这样的有学识的人，特别是喜欢与其他团体交谈的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_6ff75df6:

    # e "I take it that's where he found out about the milkweed?"
    e "我猜他就是在那里发现牛奶草的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_6e795a1e:

    # "Wuldon's pace resumes as he nods."
    "沃尔登点头时恢复了速度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_0f25240c:

    # w "Yup. I only learned about the plants he told me stories about - regrettably little now that I have to treat Vurro."
    w "是啊，我只了解到他告诉我的植物故事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_6361c8c3:

    # e "Yeah..."
    e "喜欢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_5fa06c6e:

    # "And with that, silence falls once more."
    "沉默再次降临。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_bc34dcd6:

    # "The mood is less lighthearted than before, but you still have a sort of understanding between the two of you."
    "心情比以前轻柔但你之间还是有某种理解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_77ddff14:

    # "You continue to work until the sky begins to darken."
    "你继续工作直到天空开始黑暗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_c3f044b5:

    # w "Alright. I think that's enough for the day."
    w "好了，今天就到此为止吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_959a38cf:

    # "Wuldon declares this as he cuts the final piece of milkweed, both buckets halfway full with the plants."
    "伍尔顿在切最后一块牛奶草的时候宣布了这一点，两桶水都满了一半的植物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_67d48e78:

    # "Brushing the dirt on his hands off, he stands upright again."
    "擦掉手上的泥土他又站直了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_262b9dc7:

    # e "Are you sure that's going to be enough?"
    e "你确定这样就够了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_f458d617:

    # "Wuldon shakes his head."
    "伍尔顿摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_dc817b96:

    # w "But I don't even know if this will work."
    w "但我甚至不知道这是否可行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_51b66e71:

    # w "I have an idea of the next thing to try after this, but after that, I'm not really sure."
    w "我有一个想法，接下来的事情尝试之后，但在那之后，我真的不确定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_7626c4e5:

    # "He seems a bit dispirited. It makes sense when you consider that Vurro is still just as feral as when you left him, despite Wuldon's best efforts."
    "他似乎有点沮丧。当你认为伏罗仍然像你离开他时一样无私时，这很合理，尽管沃尔登尽了最大的努力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_42d5e9c5:

    # e "You'll figure something out. And if not, I'll do my best to help anyway."
    e "你会想出办法的如果不是我会尽力帮你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_ced41d49:

    # w "Thank you, little one."
    w "谢你，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_620efea1:

    # "You both stand there for a bit."
    "你们都站在那里稍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_f95359cc:

    # e "So, umm. What now?"
    e "那么，嗯，现在怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_8c5f22b9:

    # "Wuldon looks at you somewhat oddly."
    "伍尔顿看你有点奇怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_50fb75ec:

    # w "Well, I go home and give this to Vurro, see if it works."
    w "好吧，我回家把这个给伏罗，看它是否有效。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a0ee36f2:

    # w "Then, if it doesn't, I go to the river to collect some Boneset or Roundleaf Sundew."
    w "如果不行，我去河边收集一些骨头或圆叶松秋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_9ef8585d:

    # e "Oh. So, we should get going?"
    e "哦。我们该走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d09518ec:

    # w "Yeah, probably."
    w "是的，也许吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_fd87ca25:

    # "You both keep standing there."
    "你们都站在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_ed9f12e7:

    # e "Why are we still standing here?"
    e "为什么我们还站在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_3a7e4a9e:

    # "Wuldon shrugs."
    "伍尔顿的摇摆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_fb45d23c:

    # w "I'm not in a huge rush, and I don't mind spending time in good company."
    w "我并不急着去，我不介意在良好的公司里花时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_01221ce0:

    # w "Not much of that where I come from."
    w "我从哪来，那可不多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_27205c67:

    # "He's smiling, but it's a rather unhappily."
    "他在笑，但有点不高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_fc467d26:

    # e "Are... are you lonely, Wuldon?"
    e "你寂寞吗，沃尔登？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d57ba398:

    # w "No, little one. I'm not lonely."
    w "不，小家伙，我不孤单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_8139541d:

    # w "I am happiest when I am alone, in the quiet, but..."
    w "我最快乐的是我独自一人，静地，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他摇摆着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_675aa0f0:

    # w "You saved Vurro for no reason other than mercy. I appreciate that, and don't want to just leave without letting you say what you need."
    w "我很感激，你不想不让你说出你需要什么就离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_a301ae79:

    # w "Plus, as I said before, you're fairly good company."
    w "另外，正如我之前说过的，你是一个相当不错的公司。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_519cde26:

    # w "You saved Vurro just because a handsome stranger asked you to. Made me approve of you quite a bit."
    w "你救伏罗只是因为一个帅气的陌生人让你来让我相当喜欢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4aa787e5:

    # "He lets out a sigh."
    "他发出叹息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_b3b22e47:

    # w "As I said, regrettably little of that in the tribe."
    w "正如我所说，令人遗憾的是，在部落中，这种情形很少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_05bc5e08:

    # w "While I prefer to be alone, I don't mind having you around. Feel free to stop by anytime, little one."
    w "我宁可一个人待着，但不介意有你陪着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_87aa5048:

    # "You don't know how he said all of that without a hint of embarrassment, but it's good to know you're on the werewolf's good side."
    "你不知道他怎么说的毫无尴尬感但很高兴知道你站在狼人的好一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_044ec4ae:

    # e "That's... good to know. Thanks, Wuldon."
    e "蔼砍笵谅放箉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_d729cc55:

    # w "Anytime."
    w "随时随地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_cdb3834c:

    # w "I now understand that you are waiting for me to end the conversation though."
    w "我现在明白你正在等着我结束谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_80b99941:

    # w "I'll see you next time, little one. Stay safe out there."
    w "下次见，小家伙在外面小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_376e787d:

    # "Wuldon turns around and walks off without another word."
    "沃尔登转身，无声无息地走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_92b93f47:

    # e "Good luck! I hope the medicine works!"
    e "祝你好运希望药效好！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Field_4622cd1f:

    # "Wuldon gives you a thumbs up without turning around."
    "伍尔顿给你一个拇指而不是转身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_3234bbb1:

    # "You decide to look for Wuldon over by the river, where he said he'd be if things didn't work out with Vurro."
    "你决定到河边找伍尔顿他说如果伏罗出事了他会去的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_23b6ab75:

    # "While you could have checked his home first, he'd probably just not be there again, either gathering more milkweed, or looking for any of the river plants he mentioned."
    "你本可以先检查他的家他可能不会再在那里了要么收集更多的奶草要么去找他提到的河流植物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_acb1034c:

    # "You wander around for a while, eyes roaming fairly aimlessly around the area."
    "你四处游荡一阵子，眼睛漫无目的地在附近游荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_366c7734:

    # "The fields were much harder for him to hide in, but this area shares many of his colors... he's probably just going to find you again anyway."
    "田地对他来说更难躲藏但这个区域有很多他的颜色他可能还是会再找到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_4f5d03c0:

    # "Actually, speaking of."
    "实际上，说到这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_a496c589:

    # e "Hey Wuldon, how's it going?"
    e "嘿，沃尔登，情况如何？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_fc7cae42:

    # "Nothing. No sound."
    "没什么。没有声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_6fc58e3f:

    # "Absolutely mortifying."
    "绝对令人感到羞愧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_ac5df236:

    # "Blushing deeply, you start to move forwards, hoping nobody heard you."
    "脸红得要死，你开始向前看希望没人听到你说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_18f47151:

    # "Immediately, you hear a tiny whisper - so quiet it feels like you may have imagined it."
    "你听到一个小耳语如此安静感觉就像你想象的一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_78d9a065:

    # w "Giving up so soon?"
    w "这么快就放弃？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_4e09c00e:

    # "You whip your head up, looking around rapidly."
    "你抬起头迅速四处看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_2cd8b280:

    # "You look behind you to see if he's there, like last time."
    "你看着你身后看他是否在那里像上次一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_63045ec6:

    # "Just then, you hear a quiet thump from behind you, where you were just facing."
    "刚才，你听到从你身后静地敲打的声音，你刚正面对的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_cb259847:

    # w "You forgot to look up. Rookie mistake."
    w "你忘了抬头看饼干弄错了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_308d3721:

    # "You jump in surprise, the voice coming from right next to your ear."
    "你突然跳出惊喜声音从你耳朵旁边传来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_95a17962:

    # e "STOP DOING THAT!"
    e "停止这样做！"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_38cea8fd:

    # "Actually stopping to look at Wuldon, he's got a bemused expression on his face, an eyebrow cocked in merciless mirth."
    "停下来看伍尔顿他脸上有张很沉闷的表情眉毛在无情的欢乐中张大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_1ff62688:

    # w "Stop being so easy to surprise."
    w "不要太容易出人意料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_9775ef26:

    # e "I'll work on it."
    e "我会努力的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_3b48aa36:

    # "He lets out a small laugh at that."
    "他对此大开眼界。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_61c8ecda:

    # w "Please do, I don't want you getting killed out there because you didn't see something like the LITTLE HYENA STILL WATCHING US."
    w "求你了我不想你因为没看到象小海纳还在盯着我们被杀死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_35955570:

    # "Neither of you even look in the direction of the crash from the trees this time."
    "这次你们都不用从树上看坠机的方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_d77a1ceb:

    # e "So... the milkweed didn't work?"
    e "那么…… 牛奶草没有用？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_River_2498b49b:

    # "A brief flash of pain."
    "一瞬间痛苦的闪光。"

